<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ISA" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Annabi Esayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Esayi bɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Annabi Esayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Esa</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Esayi bɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Esayi xa kitaabui findixi masenyi belebele nan na duniɲa birin bɛ. Alatala a xilixi nɛ, a xa Yudaya mangɛe Osiyasi, Yotami, Axasi, nun Xesekiya mali a sago kolonde. Mangɛ ndee nu birama kuyee fɔxɔ ra, ndee nu e yɛtɛ taxuma mangɛ booree ra naxee sɛnbɛ gbo e bɛ. Na birin kui Annabi Esayi naxa a masen e bɛ, a Alatala gbansan nan nɔma mixi malide. Kuye tan findixi wuri sɛnbɛtare nan na. Duniɲa mangɛe fan findixi ibunadama gbansan nan na, naxee mu nɔma sese ra Ala xa maragiri ya ra. Alatala nan findixi duniɲa mangɛ sɛniyɛnxi ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firinyi nu fatanxi mangɛya firin nan na. Naxan nu na kɔɔla mabiri, a xili Isirayila. Naxan nu na yirefanyi mabiri, a xili Yudaya. Annabi Esayi xa kitaabui a masenma e firin birin Ala matandixi ki naxɛ, e fa xanin konyiya kui ɲamanɛ ma na xa fe ra. Beenun na xa raba Yudaya, Alatala naxa yi masenyi fi a xa namiɲɔnmɛ ma alako a xa ɲama xa ratanga na birin ma, kɔnɔ ɲama mu tin e tuli matide Ala ra. Mangɛ nde alɔ Xesekiya naxa kata birade Ala fɔxɔ ra, kɔnɔ booree tan mu tin na ra fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na kui Ala xa ɲaxankatɛ naxa bira e birin fɔxɔ ra, e fa xanin konyiya kui Babilɔn bɔxi ma. Namiɲɔnmɛ xa kawandi findixi marasi nan na won birin bɛ. Mixi naxan tondima a tuli matide Alatala ra, a xa fe fama nɛ xun nakanade. Kɔnɔ Annabi Esayi xa masenyi luma nɛ alɔ boore namiɲɔnmɛe xa masenyi. E birin a falama a ibunadama xa yunubie a niyama nɛ e xa ɲaxankatɛ sɔtɔ, kɔnɔ e man Ala xa hinnɛ masenma naxan a niyama mixie xa tuubi, e gbilen e xa yunubie fɔxɔ ra, Ala fa e rakisi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ala xa kisi ɲɔxun. A fɔlɔma duniɲa nan ma, a fa aligiyama li. Mixi naxee birama Ala waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra, e hɛɛri toma nɛ na ɲɛrɛ kui. Duniɲɛigiri xɔrɔxɔ, kɔnɔ naxan luma Ala xa fe kui, a xunnakeli toma nɛ. Annabi Esayi man a masenma, yi duniɲa na ɲɔn, Ala fama nɛ a xa ɲama rasode a xɔnyi, bɔɲɛsa nun baraka luma dɛnnaxɛ. Na kisi fan. Ala xa won mali na sɔtɔde a xa hinnɛ saabui ra. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa masenyi Annabi Esayi bɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ISA 1" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa sɛrɛxɛ kanaxie a xa yunubie xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 1:1" />Masenyi naxee goro Amosu xa di Esayi ma, Yudaya nun Darisalamu xa fe ra, Yudaya mangɛe Osiyasi, Yotami, Axasi, nun Xesekiya xa waxati.<verse eid="ISA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 1:2" />Alatala nan masenyi tife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">koore nun bɔxi birin xa e tuli mati a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">Alatala naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">«N bara die xuru, n e ramɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:2">kɔnɔ e bara muruta n ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 1:3" />Ninge yati a kanyi kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">sofale fan a kolon a kanyi donse sama a bɛ dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">Kɔnɔ Isirayila tan mu sese kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:3">n ma ɲama mu sese fahaamuxi.»<verse eid="ISA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 1:4" />Ɲaxankatɛ na yi ɲama yunubitɔɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">naxan yunubi kote xaninma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">naxan findixi fe ɲaaxi rabae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">naxan findixi di murutaxie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">E bara mɛ Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">e Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ mabere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:4">e e kobe raso a ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 1:5" />Wo na ɲaxankatɛ fenfe munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">Wo tondixi gbilende Alatala ma munse ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:5">Wo bara fura wo xunyi ma, wo tɔɔrɔxi wo bɔɲɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 1:6" />Kelife wo sanyi ma han wo xunyi, wo xa fefe mu lanxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:6">Wo xa fie ya mu ixaxi, e mu maxirixi, ture yo mu saxi e ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 1:7" />Wo xa bɔxi bara kana, wo xa taae bara gan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">Si gbɛtɛe na wo xa daxamui donfe wo ya xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:7">e na a birin tongofe e yɛtɛ bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 1:8" />Siyoni taa na a kerenyi ma alɔ bage di xɛ tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">alɔ leele naxan tixi mɛrɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:8">alɔ taa naxan nabilinxi yaxuie ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 1:9" />Xa Alatala Sɛnbɛma mu mixi ndee rakisi won bɛ nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:9">won bara lu nu alɔ Sodoma nun Gomora taae.<verse eid="ISA 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 1:10" />Wo wo tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">wo tan naxee maniyaxi Sodoma kuntigie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">Wo xa won Marigi Alatala xa sɛriyɛ ramɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:10">wo tan naxee luxi alɔ Gomora ɲama.<verse eid="ISA 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 1:11" />Alatala naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">«N munse rabama wo xa sɛrɛxɛ wuyaxie ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">N bara luga yɛxɛ kontonyi sɛrɛxɛe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">n bara luga xuruse bɔrɛgɛxie ture ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:11">Tuurae, yɛxɛɛe nun si kontonyie wuli mu rafan n ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 1:12" />Nde wo xilixi fafe ra n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi tɛtɛ kui, tife ra n ya i?<verse eid="ISA 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 1:13" />Wo ba fafe hadiya fufafu ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">Surayi xiri mu rafan n ma fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">Wo xa kike nɛɛnɛ salie, wo xa malabui lɔxɔɛe, wo xa malanyie, nun wo xa salie xungbee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:13">e sese mu rafanxi n ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 1:14" />N wo xa kike nɛɛnɛ salie xɔnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:14">wo xa sali birin bara n bɔɲɛ raɲaaxu n ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 1:15" />Wo na wo bɛlɛxɛe itala sali kui tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">n na n ya ragalima nɛ alako n naxa fa a to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">Hali wo maxandie bira e boore fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:15">n mu e ramɛma, barima faxɛtie nan wo ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 1:16" />Wo lu fe fiixɛ kui, wo wo yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:16">wo ba yunubie rabafe n ya i.<verse eid="ISA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 1:17" />Wo wo matinkan fe fanyi rabade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">wo lu tinxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">wo mixi kobie makiiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:17">wo kiridie nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe xun mafala.»<verse eid="ISA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 1:18" />Alatala naxɛ, «Wo fa, won xa wɔyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">Hali wo xa yunubie to bara wo manɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">wo nɔma fiixɛde fɔɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">Hali e sa xɔsi nɛ alɔ garɛ gbeeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:18">e nɔma nɛ fiixɛde alɔ xuruse fiixɛ fate maxabe.<verse eid="ISA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 1:19" />Xa wo tin wo tuli matide n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:19">wo yi bɔxi daxamui donma nɛ,<verse eid="ISA 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 1:20" />kɔnɔ xa wo sa tondi n natinmɛde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:20">santidɛgɛma nan wo sɔntɔma.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:20">Alatala xui nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 1:21" />Yi taa luxi nɛ alɔ ginɛ naxan nu dugutɛgɛxi a xa mɔri ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">a fa mɛ a ra, a findi langoe ginɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">A singe a nu tinxin a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:21">kɔnɔ yakɔsi a bara findi faxati ra?<verse eid="ISA 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 1:22" />I xa gbeti bara findi se kanaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:22">i xa wɛni bara sunbu ye ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 1:23" />I xa mangɛe bara muruta, e findi muɲɛtie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">buɲa tinxintare rafan naxee ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">Na kui e mu kiridie malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:23">e mu kiiti fanyi sama kaaɲɛ ginɛ xa tɔɔrɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 1:24" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma xui nan ya, na xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">Isirayila Marigi Ala Sɛnbɛma naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">«N ɲaxankatɛ dɔxɔma nɛ n gerefae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:24">n na n gbe ɲɔxɔ n yaxuie ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 1:25" />N gbilenma nɛ n yi sa ra i ma a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">n i rasɛniyɛn alɔ gbeti gbi bama ki naxɛ tɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:25">alako i xa ba tinxintareya ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 1:26" />N kiitisa tinxinxie tima nɛ wo xun alɔ singe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">n marasima fanyie luma nɛ wo tagi alɔ tɛmui dangixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">Na dangi xanbi, i xili fama nɛ falade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:26">‹Taa tinxinxi naxan dugutɛgɛxi.›»<verse eid="ISA 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 1:27" />Siyoni xun sarama nɛ tinxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:27">tuubi mixie kisima nɛ tinxinyi saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 1:28" />Kɔnɔ gbaloe goroma nɛ murutɛlae nun yunubitɔɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:28">halaki lu mixie fɔxɔ ra, naxee e kobe soma Alatala ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 1:29" />Wo fama nɛ yaagide fɔtɔnyi ra wo nu kuye batuma dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:29">Wo yaagi belebele sɔtɔma nɛ na yiree xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 1:30" />Wo fama nɛ lude alɔ wuri bili lisixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:30">ye mu na naxan ma.<verse eid="ISA 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 1:31" />Sɛnbɛma sɛnbɛ ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">a tan nun a xa wali birin gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 1:31">a rakisima yo mu lu na.<verse eid="ISA 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ISA 2" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa xunnakeli nun a xa xɔnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 2:1" />Amosu xa di Annabi Esayi xa masenyi nan ya Yuda nun Darisalamu xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 2:2" />Waxati dɔnxɔɛ Alatala xa banxi tixi geya naxan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">na fama nɛ lude geyae birin xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:2">Si birin e xun tima nɛ na yire itexi ra.<verse eid="ISA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 2:3" />Bɔnsɔɛ wuyaxi sigama nɛ naa, e a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">«Wo fa, won xa te Alatala xa geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">Yaxuba Marigi Ala xa banxi na dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">A won xaranma nɛ a xa sɛriyɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">alako won xa bira a xa kira fɔxɔ ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">Alatala xa sɛriyɛ minima Siyoni geya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:3">a xa masenyi fɔlɔma Darisalamu taa kui.<verse eid="ISA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 2:4" />Alatala nan kiiti sama ɲamanɛe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">a findi si wuyaxi tagi ibama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">E fama e xa santidɛgɛmae xabude kerie nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">e e xa tanbɛe findi wɔrɔtɛe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">Gere ɲɔnma nɛ sie tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:4">sɔɔriɲa mu matinkanma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 2:5" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ, wo fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:5">won xa won ɲɛrɛ Alatala xa naiyalanyi ma.<verse eid="ISA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 2:6" />Alatala, i bara i xa ɲama rabolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">barima e birama naamunyie fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">naxee kelixi sogetede mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">Se matoe bara wuya naxee walima alɔ Filisitakae.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:6">I xa ɲama nun si Ala kolontaree bara lanyi xiri.<verse eid="ISA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 2:7" />I xa ɲama bara xɛɛma nun gbeti gbegbe sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">e xa naafuli mu ɲɔnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:7">E xa bɔxi bara rafe sɔɔri xa soee nun e ragisee ra.<verse eid="ISA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 2:8" />Kuyee toma nɛ yire birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:8">Kankan a xinbi sinma kuyee bɛ, e naxee masolixi e bɛlɛxɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 2:9" />E felenma nɛ e bɛ, e e magoro e batufe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:9">Na kui, i naxa diɲɛ e ma feo.<verse eid="ISA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 2:10" />Wo wo nɔxun fanyee tagi bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">alako wo xa wo makuya Alatala xa xɔnɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:10">naxan fama a xa nɔrɛ makaabaxi kui.<verse eid="ISA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 2:11" />Adamadi xa yɛtɛ igboya magoroma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:11">mixie xa yɛtɛ iteya kuntin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:11">Alatala keren nan a yɛtɛ itema na lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 2:12" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa kiiti lɔxɔɛ fama yɛtɛ igboe bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:12">Naxee bara e yɛtɛ ite, Ala fama nɛ e ragorode.<verse eid="ISA 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 2:13" />A Liban sɛdiri bili nun Basan xa wuri bili itexi birin nagoroma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 2:14" />A geya itexi fan bama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 2:15" />A mixie xa banxi makantaxie kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:15">a e xa tɛtɛe rabira.<verse eid="ISA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 2:16" />A e xa kunkui xungbee radulama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 2:17" />Alatala fama nɛ Adamadi xa yɛtɛ igboya ragorode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17">a mixie xa yɛtɛ iteya kuntin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:17">Alatala keren nan a yɛtɛ itema na lɔxɔɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 2:18" />Kuye fe birin kanama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 2:19" />Mixie e nɔxunma nɛ fɔnmɛe tagi gɛmɛ longori ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">e yili gema nɛ bɔxi kui, e fa e nɔxun Alatala xa xɔnɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">naxan fama a xa nɔrɛ makaabaxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:19">a na keli bɔxi rasɛrɛnde tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 2:20" />Na lɔxɔɛ, mixie fama nɛ e xa kuye wɔlɛde bale nun tuukɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:20">e nu naxee yailanxi xɛɛma nun gbeti ra e batufe ra.<verse eid="ISA 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 2:21" />E e nɔxunma nɛ yilie nun fɔnmɛe kui fanye longori ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">e xa e makuya Alatala xa xɔnɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">naxan fama a xa nɔrɛ makaabaxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:21">a na keli bɔxi rasɛrɛnde tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 2:22" />Wo ba wo yɛtɛ taxufe adamadi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:22">ɲɛngi keren peti na naxan bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 2:22">Tide mundun na a ma?<verse eid="ISA 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ISA 3" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxasi birafe Yudaya kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 3:1" />Marigi Alatala Sɛnbɛma bara natɛ tongo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">Darisalamu nun Yudaya xun nakanafe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:1">A xa baloe nun ye ba e yi ra,<verse eid="ISA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 3:2" />a xa e xa ɲalamae nun e xa sɔɔrie ragoro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:2">a xa e xa kiitisae nun namiɲɔnmɛe rasabari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:2">a xa e xa sematoe nun e xa forie makuya e boore ra,<verse eid="ISA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 3:3" />a xa e xa sɔɔri mangɛe, e xa marasimae, e xa walikɛ fanyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:3">nun e xa mixi kɔɔtaxi birin ba e yi ra.<verse eid="ISA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 3:4" />N fama fonikee nan tide mangɛya ra e xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:4">dimɛe nan fama dɔxɔde e fari.<verse eid="ISA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 3:5" />Kankan fuma nɛ a boore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">fonikee tima nɛ xɛmɔxie kanke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:5">fuyantee fan bagan mixi binyɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 3:6" />Na kui, mixi nde a falama nɛ a bari boore nde bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">«Donma fanyi to na i tan yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">i xa findi muxu xa yarerati ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:6">i xa mangɛya tongo yi ɲaxasi kui.»<verse eid="ISA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 3:7" />Kɔnɔ a ngaxakerenyi a yaabima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">«Seriba mu na n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">donma nun donse yo mu na n ma banxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:7">Wo naxa n findi ɲama xa mangɛ ra.»<verse eid="ISA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 3:8" />Darisalamu na birafe, Yudaya xun na kanafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">barima e Alatala matandima e xa wɔyɛnyi nun e xa wali ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:8">e bara muruta Alatala xa mangɛya ma.<verse eid="ISA 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 3:9" />E xa kaarinyi findi seede ɲaaxi nan na e xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">E yunubi rabama kɛnɛ nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">alɔ Sodomaka naxee mu e xa yunubi nɔxun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">Ɲaxankatɛ na e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:9">e na gbaloe nan bɛndunfe e yɛtɛ ma na ki.<verse eid="ISA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 3:10" />Wo a fala tinxintɔɛ bɛ, a na kira fanyi xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:10">a fama nɛ a xa tinxinyi sare sɔtɔde.<verse eid="ISA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 3:11" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixi ɲaaxi tan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:11">gbaloe fama nɛ a lide a ɲaaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:11">a fama nɛ a xa tinxintareya sare sɔtɔde.<verse eid="ISA 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 3:12" />Dimɛe nan na n ma ɲama ɲaxankatafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">ginɛe nan nɔɛ dɔxɔxi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:12">mangɛe na a ralɔɛfe kira ɲaaxi xɔn ma.<verse eid="ISA 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 3:13" />Kɔnɔ Alatala bara a ikeli kiitisa yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:13">a xa kalamui tinxinxi masen, a xa kiiti sa nɔndi ra.<verse eid="ISA 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 3:14" />Alatala na a xa ɲama kuntigie nun a mangɛe makiitife yi wɔyɛnyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:14">«Wo bara n ma ɲama xun nakana. Wo bara misikiinɛe muɲa.<verse eid="ISA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 3:15" />Won n ma ɲama halakima munfe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:15">Wo setaree tɔɔrɔma munfe ra?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:15">Marigi Alatala Sɛnbɛma xui nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 3:16" />Alatala naxɛ, «Siyoni ginɛe findixi yɛtɛ igboe nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">naxee e ɲɛrɛma e xunyi rakelixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:16">e e ɲɛrɛ mɛrɛmɛrɛ ra e sankɔnyi xunmasee nu e xui ramini.<verse eid="ISA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 3:17" />Alatala fama nɛ suuri raminide e xunyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:17">a e xunsɛxɛ birin ba e ma.»<verse eid="ISA 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 3:18" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala e xa xunmase birin bama nɛ e yi ra: e xa sankɔnyi xunmase tofanyie, e xa kɔnmagore, e xa xunmase naxee misaalixi kike ra, <verse eid="ISA 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 3:19" />e xa tulirasoe, e xa bɛlɛxɛrasoe, e xa mafelenyie, <verse eid="ISA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 3:20" />e xa xun maxirisee, e xa sankɔnyi xunmasee, e xa bɛlɛtie, e xa labundɛ sasee, e xa makantasee, <verse eid="ISA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 3:21" />e xa bɛlɛxɛsole xurundɛe, e xa ɲɔɛ xurundɛe, <verse eid="ISA 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 3:22" />e xa xulun dugie, e xa donma kuyee, e xa donma fari igoroe, e xa gbɔnfɔɛe, <verse eid="ISA 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 3:23" />e xa dugie, e xa donma bunmagore, e xa xunmaxirie, nun e xa mafelenyie. Alatala na birin bama nɛ e yi ra.<verse eid="ISA 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 3:24" />Se bɔrɔxi nan findima e xa labundɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">Luuti nan findima e xa bɛlɛti ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">E xunyi dɛnbɛxi bima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">Bɛki nan findima e xa dugi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:24">E fate kiri tofanyi ganma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 3:25" />Santidɛgɛma e xa mɔrie faxama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:25">e xa ɲalamae faxama gere nan kui.<verse eid="ISA 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 3:26" />Siyoni ɲama wa xui minima nɛ sunnunyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 3:26">alɔ kaaɲɛ ginɛ naxan dɔxɔ bɔxi ma, a wa.<verse eid="ISA 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ISA 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankatɛ raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 4:1" />Na lɔxɔɛ ginɛ solofere a falama nɛ xɛmɛ keren bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">«Muxu xa baloe nun muxu xa maxirisee xa findi muxu xa kote ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">kɔnɔ i tan xa muxu dɔxɔ, i xili xa lu muxu xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:1">alako yaagi xa ba muxu ma.»<verse eid="ISA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 4:2" />Na lɔxɔɛ Alatala xa salonyi tofanyi minima nɛ a xa nɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:2">Isirayila bɔxi xa daxamui fanyi xa lu a xa mixie bɛ naxee kisixi.<verse eid="ISA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 4:3" />Mixi naxee fama lude Siyoni nun Darisalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:3">e findima nɛ sɛniyɛntɔɛe ra naxee xili sɛbɛxi kisi mixie ya ma.<verse eid="ISA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 4:4" />Marigi fama nɛ Siyoni ginɛe xa sɛniyɛntareɲa maxade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:4">a Darisalamukae rasɛniyɛn e xa faxɛ tife ma kiiti tinxinxi saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:4">a fa e sare ragbilen e ma.<verse eid="ISA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 4:5" />Na tɛmui Alatala fama Siyoni geya makotode nuxui nun tuuri nan na yanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:5">a tɛ xungbe ramini e xun ma kɔɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:5">A xa nɔrɛ nan luma se birin xun ma,<verse eid="ISA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 4:6" />alɔ bage xungbe naxan niini mixi makantama soge ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 4:6">a findi yire kantaxi ra tunɛ goro tɛmui.<verse eid="ISA 4:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ISA 5" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xa sansi yire</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 5:1" />N xa bɛɛti ba n xanuntenyi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">n xanuntenyi naxan bara wɛni xɛ sa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:1">Wɛni xɛ nu na n xanuntenyi yi ra bɔxi turaxi ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 5:2" />A naxa bɔxi buxa, a gɛmɛe matongo, a sansi fanyie si a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">A naxa tide itexi ti naa tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">a yili ge wɛni bogi bunduma dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">A ɲɔxɔ nu a ma a sansi fama nɛ wɛni bogi raminide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:2">kɔnɔ a bogi kanaxi nan naminixi.<verse eid="ISA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 5:3" />Darisalamukae nun Yudayakae, wo kiiti n tan nun n ma wɛni xɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 5:4" />Munse man luxi, n mu naxan nabaxi n ma xɛ bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:4">Munfe ra n xaxili to nu tixi bogi fanyi ra, a fa bogi kanaxi ramini n bɛ?<verse eid="ISA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 5:5" />N xa a fala wo bɛ n naxan nabama n ma xɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">N sansanyi talama nɛ alako xurusee xa a maxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:5">N tɛtɛ bama nɛ alako a xa maboron.<verse eid="ISA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 5:6" />N a raboloma nɛ alako tunbe nun ɲooge xa bula sansi fanyi ɲɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:6">N nuxuie yamarima, e naxa tunɛ yo rayolon a ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 5:7" />Na wɛni xɛ misaalixi Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa ɲama Isirayila nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">a man misaali Yudaya ɲama fan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">Alatala nu wama tinxinyi nan xɔn, kɔnɔ a faxɛ tife nan tun to naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:7">A nu wama fe fanyi nan xɔn, kɔnɔ a wa xui nan tun mɛ naa.<verse eid="ISA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 5:8" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixie bɛ, naxee banxie tima e fari idɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">naxee xɛe dɔxɔma e bore ra, han e bɔxi birin tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:8">e tan keren gbansan lu naa.<verse eid="ISA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 5:9" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma a masen nɛ n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">«Na banxi galie fama nɛ tuxunsande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:9">mixi mu sabatima na banxi tofanyie kui fa.<verse eid="ISA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 5:10" />Wɛni xɛ xungbe, bogi dondoronti raminima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:10">Sansi xɔri gbegbe, findima maale dondoronti nan na.»<verse eid="ISA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 5:11" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixie bɛ naxee kelima subaxɛ ma sigafe ra beere fende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:11">e fa na min han e ya gbeeli kɔɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 5:12" />E kɔrae, maxasee, nun sarae raberema e xa xulunyie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:12">kɔnɔ e mu Alatala xa wali tan kolonma, e mu a bɛlɛxɛ fɔxi toma.<verse eid="ISA 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 5:13" />Na fahaamutareɲa nan a niyama e xa xanin konyiya kui ɲamanɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">E xa ɲalamae faxama nɛ kaamɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:13">e xa mixie tɔɔrɔma nɛ ye xɔli ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 5:14" />Aligiyama naadɛ rabima nɛ e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">Siyoni kuntigie nun e xa ɲama xa so naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:14">a nun taa xurutaree nun mixi ɲaaxie.<verse eid="ISA 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 5:15" />Adama xa fe xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:15">yɛtɛ igboe xa fe goroma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 5:16" />Kɔnɔ Alatala Sɛnbɛma tantuma nɛ a xa tinxinyi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:16">Ala Sɛniyɛntɔɛ a yɛtɛ masenma a xa fe fanyie nan saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 5:17" />Na tɛmui yɛxɛɛe e dɛ madonma nɛ na yire kanaxie ma alɔ e na e xɔnyi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:17">xɔɲɛe fan baloe toma naa.<verse eid="ISA 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 5:18" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixie bɛ, naxee yunubie bɛndunma e yɛtɛ ma wule ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:18">naxee e e yɛtɛ xirima fe ɲaaxie ra alɔ kote naxan xirima sofale fari.<verse eid="ISA 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 5:19" />Na mixie nu fa a fala e dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">«Alatala xa a xulun a xa wali raba ra, alako muxu xa a to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:19">Isirayila Marigi Ala sago sɛniyɛnxi xa raba, alako muxu xa a kolon.»<verse eid="ISA 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 5:20" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixie bɛ, naxee fe ɲaaxi findima fe fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">e fe fanyi findi fe ɲaaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">E dimi xili naiyalanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">e naiyalanyi xili dimi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">Fe xɔnɛ luxi nɛ a bɛ alɔ fe ɲɔxunmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:20">fe ɲɔxunmɛ lu e bɛ alɔ fe xɔnɛ.<verse eid="ISA 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 5:21" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixie bɛ, naxee e yɛtɛ maɲɔxunxi fe kolonyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:21">e e yɛtɛ findi xaxilimae ra.<verse eid="ISA 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 5:22" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixie bɛ, naxee xili xungbe sɔtɔma beere minfe kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:22">e fisa e boore bɛ siisi fe kui.<verse eid="ISA 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 5:23" />E nɔndi fi funmala ma kɔbiri xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:23">e nɔndi ba nɔndi kanyi yi ra.<verse eid="ISA 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 5:24" />Na mixie xa fe xun nakanama nɛ alɔ sɛxɛ xaraxi ganma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">E luma nɛ alɔ sansi naxee sankee bɔrɔma, e fugee yensen alɔ xube,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">barima e bara mɛ Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa sɛriyɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:24">e Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ xa masenyi mabere.<verse eid="ISA 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 5:25" />Na nan a ra Alatala bɔɲɛ texi a xa ɲama xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">a bɛlɛxɛ italaxi, a xa e bɔnbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Geyae bara sɛrɛn, binbie bara yensen taa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">Hali na birin to rabaxi, a xa xɔnɛ mu ɲɔnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:25">a bɛlɛxɛ man italaxi e xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 5:26" />Alatala bara tɔnxuma masen ɲamanɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:26">a e xili e xa fa kelife yire makuye.<verse eid="ISA 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 5:27" />Mixi taganxi yo mu na e ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">mixi yo sanyie mu binyaxi a bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">mixi yo mu kinsɔnfe a xa xi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">mixi yo xa bɛlɛti mu fulunxi a tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:27">mixi yo xa sankiri luuti mu bolonxi.<verse eid="ISA 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 5:28" />Na mixie xa xalie ɲɔɛe raxaɲɛnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">e xa tanbɛ woli see birin italaxi a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">e xa soe toree xɔrɔxɔ alɔ gɛmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:28">e xa sɔɔri ragise sanyie xui gbo alɔ turunnaadɛ.<verse eid="ISA 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 5:29" />E ɲarandan alɔ yɛtɛ naxan sube suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:29">a a xanin yire makuye.<verse eid="ISA 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 5:30" />Na lɔxɔɛ e ɲarandanyi mɛma nɛ alɔ baa mɔrɔnyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">tɔɔrɛ nan tun toma bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">naiyalanyi findima dimi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 5:30">nuxui ifɔɔrɔxie lu koore ma.<verse eid="ISA 5:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ISA 6" />
  <para style="s">Esayi findife Ala xa xɛɛra ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 6:1" />Mangɛ Osiyasi faxa ɲɛ naxan na, n naxa n Marigi Ala to a xa kibanyi itexi kui. A xa nɔrɛ nu gbo, a xa donma xungbe nu italaxi a xa hɔrɔmɔlingira kui. <verse eid="ISA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 6:2" />Malekɛe nu na a xun ma. Gabutenyi senni nu na kankan bɛ: gabutenyi firin nu e yatagi makotoxi, firin nu e sanyie makotoxi, firin nan nu a niyama e xa ɲɛrɛ koore ma. <verse eid="ISA 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 6:3" />E nu fa a fala e boore bɛ e xui itexi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">Alatala Sɛnbɛma sɛniyɛn han!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:3">A xa nɔrɛ duniɲa birin lima nɛ!<verse eid="ISA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 6:4" />E xui nu hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛe rasɛrɛnma, banxi fa rafe tuuri ra.<verse eid="ISA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 6:5" />Na kui n naxa gbelegbele, «Ɲaxankatɛ na n bɛ, barima n findixi adamadi sɛniyɛntare nan na, naxan sabatixi ɲama sɛniyɛntare ya ma. N yae na n Marigi Ala Sɛnbɛma to, n faxama nɛ!»<verse eid="ISA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 6:6" />Na tɛmui na malekɛ keren naxa tugan, a fa n yire, tɛ wole keren na a yi ra a nu bara naxan tongo sɛrɛxɛbade kui. <verse eid="ISA 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 6:7" />A naxa a dɔxɔ n dɛ ra a fa a fala, «Yi to bara din i dɛ ra, i xa tinxintareya bara ba, i xa yunubi bara xafari.»<verse eid="ISA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 6:8" />N naxa n Marigi xui mɛ a masen na, «N na n nde xɛɛma? Nde sigama xɛɛra ibade muxu bɛ?» N naxa a yaabi, «N tan nan ya. I xa n tan xɛɛ.» <verse eid="ISA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 6:9" />Awa, a naxa a fala n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">«Sa a fala yi ɲama bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">‹Wo wo tuli matima n na, kɔnɔ wo mu fahaamui sɔtɔ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:9">Wo fe matoma, kɔnɔ wo mu a kui kolon?›<verse eid="ISA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 6:10" />I xa yi ɲama xaxili raxɔrɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">i xa e tuli dɛsɛ, i xa e ya ragali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">E ya nu nɔma to tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">e tuli nu nɔma fe mɛde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">e xaxili nu nɔma fahaamui sɔtɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:10">e fa tuubi, e kisi.»<verse eid="ISA 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 6:11" />N naxa a maxɔrin, «N marigi, na buma han tɛmui mundun?» A naxa n yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">«Han e xa taae na gɛ kanade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:11">mixie xa ɲɔn naa, e xa banxi xa bira, e xa xɛe xa gan.<verse eid="ISA 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 6:12" />Han Alatala na gɛ ɲama xaninde yire makuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:12">e xa bɔxi fa rabɛɲin.<verse eid="ISA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 6:13" />Hali mixi ndee fa kisi naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">gbaloe man fama nɛ dinde naa ra.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 6:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">«Kɔnɔ wuri bili xungbe na sɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 6:13">a sanke sɛniyɛnxi luma nɛ bɔxi bun ma.»<verse eid="ISA 6:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ISA 7" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xa masenyi mangɛ Axasi bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 7:1" />Yudaya mangɛ Axasi xa waxati, naxan findixi Yotami xa di nun Osiyasi xa mamadi ra, Arami mangɛ Resin nun Isirayila mangɛ Peka, Remaliyahu xa di, e naxa siga Darisalamu gerede, kɔnɔ e mu nɔ a ra.<verse eid="ISA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 7:2" />Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ mixie to a kolon a Aramikae bara lanyi xiri Efirami bɔnsɔɛ ra, Mangɛ Axasi nun a xa ɲama naxa sɛrɛn gaaxui kui, alɔ foye wuri bilie ramaxama ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ISA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 7:3" />Na tɛmui Alatala naxa a masen Annabi Esayi bɛ, «I tan nun i xa di Seyara Yasubu, wo xa siga mangɛ Axasi naralande ye ragatade xungbe xanbi ra, kira naxan sigama dugi xama dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="ISA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 7:4" />A fala a bɛ, ‹I naxa kɔntɔfili. I xa limaniya. Hali i mu gaaxu yi mixi firinyi ra, naxee luma alɔ tɛ xubenxi naxan tuuri tun raminima. I naxa gaaxu Arami mangɛ Resin nun Remaliyahu bɔnsɔɛ ya ra. <verse eid="ISA 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 7:5" />Aramikae, nun Remaliyahu xa mixie Efiramikae bara yanfanteya nan xiri i xun ma na ki, a falafe ra, <verse eid="ISA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 7:6" />«Won xa Yudaya gere, won xa a ya iso, won xa nɔ a ra, Tabeeli xa findi e xa mangɛ ra.»›»<verse eid="ISA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 7:7" />Kɔnɔ Alatala xa masenyi nan ya na xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:7">«Na mu sɔɔnɛyama, n mu na rabama feo,<verse eid="ISA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 7:8" />barima Damasi mangɛ Resin nan Arami yamarima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">Ɲɛ tongo senni nun suuli gbansan nan luxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:8">Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xa yensen.<verse eid="ISA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 7:9" />Samari mangɛ Remaliyahu nan Efirami yamarima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:9">Xa wo mu wo yɛtɛ taxu wo Marigi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 7:9">wo mu kisima.»<verse eid="ISA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 7:10" />Alatala naxa yi masenyi fan ti Axasi bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="ISA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 7:11" />«I xa n tan i Marigi Alatala maxandi tɔnxuma ma n ma masenyi xa fe ra.» <verse eid="ISA 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 7:12" />Axasi naxa a yaabi, «N mu sese maxandima i ma, barima n mu wama i tan Alatala matofe siikɛ kui.»<verse eid="ISA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 7:13" />Na kui Annabi Esayi naxa a fala, «Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ, wo luma mixie ratagan na, kɔnɔ yakɔsi wo wama Alatala nan fan nataganfe? <verse eid="ISA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 7:14" />Alatala yɛtɛ yati fama nɛ tɔnxuma nde fide wo ma: Ginɛ dimɛdi nde fama tɛgɛde, a di bari, a na di xili sa Emanuwɛli, naxan fasarixi, ‹Ala na won ya ma.› <verse eid="ISA 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 7:15" />A xiɲɛ fɛnɛ nun kumi nan donma han a mɔ, a nɔ fe kobi nun fe fanyi tagi raba kolonde. <verse eid="ISA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 7:16" />Kɔnɔ beenun a xa na simaya sɔtɔ, na mangɛ firinyi i gaaxuxi naxee ra, nee xa bɔxie fama nɛ kanade. <verse eid="ISA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 7:17" />Na tɛmui Alatala fama nɛ gbaloe nde ra wo xun ma naxan mu kolonxi wo nun wo babae xa waxati kafi Efirami a makuyaxi Yudaya ra tɛmui naxɛ. Alatala Asiriya mangɛ nan xɛɛma wo yire.»<verse eid="ISA 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 7:18" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala xɛɛrie rafama nɛ kelife Misira xuree ma, a nun kumie kelife Asiriya bɔxi ma. <verse eid="ISA 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 7:19" />E fama nɛ lude folee kui, gɛmɛ longorie ra, kunsie fari, nun ye yiree. <verse eid="ISA 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 7:20" />Na lɔxɔɛ Marigi fama nɛ Asiriya mangɛ ra kelife xure xungbe naakiri ma, a xa wo rayaagi a ɲaaxi ra, alɔ mixi naxan fate maxabe birin mabima. <verse eid="ISA 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 7:21" />Na lɔxɔɛ, mixi fama ninge keren nun si firin nan gbansan sɔtɔde, <verse eid="ISA 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 7:22" />e xiɲɛ fɛnɛ sɔtɔma naxan na. E luma na nun kumi gbansan nan don na. <verse eid="ISA 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 7:23" />Na lɔxɔɛ, wɛni bili wulu keren nu na xɛ naxan ma, naxan sare nu gbeti kole wulu keren lima, naa findima nɛ tunbe nun baagi yire ra, <verse eid="ISA 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 7:24" />koyinmae xalie wolima dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="ISA 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 7:25" />Xɛe nu sama geya naxee fari, tunbe nun baagi dinma nɛ naa ra, mixi yo mu suusa sigade naa sɔnɔn. Naa findima xurusee madonde nan gbansan na.<verse eid="ISA 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ISA 8" />
  <para style="s">Annabi Esayi xa di xili safe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 8:1" />Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ, «I xa kɛɛdi tongo, a sɛbɛ kale ra, ‹Maheri Salali Hasi Basi,› naxan fasarixi ‹Kasarɛ ti, se birin xaninma mafuren mafuren.› <verse eid="ISA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 8:2" />I xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ Uri nun Yeberekiya xa di Sakari xili seedee ra n bɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 8:3" />Na tɛmui, n naxa n maso n ma ginɛ ra, a naxa tɛgɛ a di bari. Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, «A xili sa, ‹Maheri Salali Hasi Basi.› <verse eid="ISA 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 8:4" />Beenun na di xa mɔ, a fa nɔ a falade, ‹N nga, n ba,› Asiriya mangɛ fama nɛ naafuli xaninde a naxan toma Damasi taa kui nun Samari bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="ISA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 8:5" />Alatala man naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ,<verse eid="ISA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 8:6" />«Yi ɲama to bara Silowa xure xa baraka bɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:6">Ala naxan fixi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:6">e fa bira Resin nun Remaliyahu xa di xa fe fɔxɔ ra,<verse eid="ISA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 8:7" />n tan Alatala fama nɛ banbaranyi xungbe ra e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">naxan findi Asiriya mangɛ yɛtɛ igboe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">A sɛnbɛ luma nɛ alɔ banbaranyi naxan kelima xure,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:7">a fa dangi bɔxi birin ma,<verse eid="ISA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 8:8" />a din Yudaya ra, a te han a gbe mu nu luxi mɛnnikae fan xa madula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:8">Emanuwɛli, na fama nɛ wo xa bɔxi birin xun nakanade.»<verse eid="ISA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 8:9" />«Wo tan ɲamanɛ naxee na duniɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">wo gere xui rate, kɔnɔ wo xun nakanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">Wo wo yɛtɛ yailan gere xili ma, kɔnɔ wo faxama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:9">Wo xa ti gere ki ma, kɔnɔ wo birama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 8:10" />Wo natɛe tongo, kɔnɔ a mu sɔɔnɛyama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">Wo lanyi xiri wo boore tagi, kɔnɔ wo mu tima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:10">barima Ala na muxu ya ma.»<verse eid="ISA 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 8:11" />Alatala naxa n nasi sɛnbɛ ra, a falafe ra n bɛ, a n naxa bira yi ɲama ɲɛrɛ ki kobi fɔxɔ ra. A naxɛ,<verse eid="ISA 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 8:12" />«I naxa yanfanteya xili fala fe ma, yi ɲama a falama fe naxan ma yanfanteya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:12">I naxa gaaxu fe ya ra, yi ɲama gaaxuma fe naxan ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 8:13" />I xa Mangɛ Alatala nan kolon sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:13">i xa xanmɛ a tan nan xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:13">i xa gaaxu a tan nan ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 8:14" />Na kui a findima nɛ wo bɛ yire sɛniyɛnxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">Kɔnɔ Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ firinyie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">a findima nɛ gɛmɛ ra e dinma naxan na, e fa bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:14">a findima nɛ gantanyi ra Darisalamukae bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 8:15" />Mixi gbegbe e sanyi radinma nɛ a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 8:15">e bira, e e maxɔnɔ, e xanin konyiya kui.»<verse eid="ISA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 8:16" />Yi seedeɲɔxɔya naxan sɛbɛxi, wo xa tɔnxuma sa a ma, wo xa a ragata n ma fɔxirabirɛe yire. <verse eid="ISA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 8:17" />N tan xaxili tixi Alatala ra, naxan a kobe soxi Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ ra sinden. N bara n ma lanlanteya sa a ma. <verse eid="ISA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 8:18" />N tan nun n ma die, Alatala naxee fixi n ma, muxu findixi tɔnxumae nan na Isirayila bɔxi ma Mangɛ Alatala bɛ, naxan sabatixi Siyoni geya fari.<verse eid="ISA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 8:19" />Mixi ndee a falama wo bɛ, wo xa siga karamɔxɔɛe yire, naxee mixi faxaxie rawɔyɛnma makɔyikɔyi ra, wo xa gundo kolon. Kɔnɔ a mu lanma mixie xa e xa maxɔrinyie ti e Marigi Ala tan ma? A lanma mixi baloxi xa maxɔrinyi ti mixi faxaxi ma? <verse eid="ISA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 8:20" />Won xa won tuli mati Ala xa sɛriyɛ ra a seedeɲɔxɔya fixi naxan ma. Xa na mu a ra, ɲama luma dimi nan tun kui, <verse eid="ISA 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 8:21" />E bɔxi igirima kaamɛ nun kɔntɔfili nan na. Kaamɛ na xɔrɔxɔ e ma tɛmui naxɛ, e e ya ratema nɛ koore ma, e e xa mangɛ nun e Marigi Ala danka. <verse eid="ISA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 8:22" />E na gɛ na rabade, e fa e ya ragoro duniɲa ma, e mu sese toma fo tɔɔrɛ, dimi, nun bɔɲɛsatareya.<verse eid="ISA 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 8:23" />Kɔnɔ na dimi mu luma bɔxi ma abadan, tɔɔrɛ mu nɔma na ɲama ra. Sabulon nun Nafatali bɔxi halaki nɛ tɛmui dangixi, kɔnɔ na bɔxi naxan xili falama «ɲamanɛ xa Galile,» na fama nɛ nɔrɔde kelife baa dɛ ra, han Yurudɛn naakiri ma.<verse eid="ISA 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ISA 9" />
  <para style="s">Di naxan findima mangɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 9:1" />Ɲama naxan nu na a ɲɛrɛfe dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:1">e bara naiyalanyi xungbe to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:1">Tɔɔrɛ xa nɔɛ nu na naxee fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:1">naiyalanyi xungbe bara yanba e ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 9:2" />Alatala, i bara na ɲama xun nakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">i bara sɛɛwɛ xungbe fi e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">E sɛɛwaxi i ya ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">alɔ mixie sɛɛwama sansi xaba tɛmui ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:2">alɔ mixie sɛɛwama harige sɔtɔfe ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 9:3" />E sɛɛwaxi barima kote binye naxan nu dɛtɛnxi e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">i bara na ba naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">luxusinyi naxan nu e bɔnbɔma e fari ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:3">i bara na kana alɔ i Madiyankae rabira tɛmui naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 9:4" />E yaxuie xa sankiri naxee nu e maboronma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">e donma naxee nɔxɔxi wuli ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:4">nee birin bara wɔlɛ tɛ xɔɔra, e gan feo.<verse eid="ISA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 9:5" />Barima Ala bara a niya won xa di nde sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">a mangɛya fixi naxan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">Na di fama xilide yi ki nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">Marasima fisamante, Ala Sɛnbɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:5">Baba naxan buma abadan, Bɔɲɛsa Mangɛ.<verse eid="ISA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 9:6" />A xa mangɛya nun a xa bɔɲɛsa mu ɲɔnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">A dɔxɔma nɛ Dawuda xa kibanyi kui abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">A na mangɛya rabama tinxinyi nun nɔndi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">kelife yakɔsi ma han dan mu naxan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">Mangɛ Alatala fama na nan nabade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:6">barima a mu wama a firin nde xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 9:7" />Marigi nu bara kiiti ɲaaxi sa Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:7">a naxan dɔxɔ Isirayila ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 9:8" />Efiramikae nun Samarikae nu bara na kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:8">kɔnɔ e naxa a fala e xa yɛtɛ igboya kui,<verse eid="ISA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 9:9" />«Biriki banxi bara bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">kɔnɔ muxu fama a tide gɛmɛ masolixie nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">Sikomoro bilie bara sɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:9">kɔnɔ muxu fama sɛdiri bilie side e ɲɔxɔɛ ra.»<verse eid="ISA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 9:10" />Na wɔyɛnyi ma Alatala fama nɛ Resin yaxuie rageenide e xili ma,<verse eid="ISA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 9:11" />A fama nɛ Aramikae ra kelife sogetede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">A fa Filisitakae fan na keli sogegorode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">alako e xa Isirayilakae sɔntɔ a ɲaaxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">Hali na birin to raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">Alatala xa xɔnɛ mu gbilenxi e fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:11">a bɛlɛxɛ man itexi e xili ma,<verse eid="ISA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 9:12" />barima ɲama tan tondi nɛ a yɛtɛ ragbilende a bɔnbɔma ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:12">e mu Mangɛ Alatala fen.<verse eid="ISA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 9:13" />Na kui Alatala Isirayila xunyi nun a xuli bolonma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:13">a tugi bili nun kale xunxuri rabirama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 9:14" />Isirayila xunyi na a xa yareratie nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:14">a xuli na a xa namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛe nan na.<verse eid="ISA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 9:15" />Na yareratie bara ɲama ralɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:15">e bara e ifu.<verse eid="ISA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 9:16" />Na nan a ra, Alatala mu ɲɛlɛxinma e xa fonikee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">a mu kinikinima e xa kiridie nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">barima e birin yunubi ɲaaxie rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:16">wɔyɛn kobie nan tun minima e dɛ i.<verse eid="ISA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 9:17" />Gbaloe na fafe e ma alɔ tɛ naxan na fili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">a fa ɲooge ɲaaxi nun tunbe birin gan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:17">tuuri fa te koore ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 9:18" />Mangɛ Alatala xa xɔnɛ bara duniɲa rasɛrɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:18">adamadie bara lu alɔ tɛ naxee e boore gan, mixi yo mu kisi.<verse eid="ISA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 9:19" />E bara e boore muɲa naxan nu na e yirefanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">kɔnɔ e naxa lu kaamɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">E bara nde muɲa naxan nu na e kɔɔla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:19">kɔnɔ e mu wasa, kankan naxa din a boore ra.<verse eid="ISA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 9:20" />Manasikae bara Efiramikae tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">Efiramikae bara Manasikae tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">e firin bara din Yudaya ra.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 9:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">Hali na birin to raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">Alatala xa xɔnɛ mu gbilenxi e fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 9:20">a bɛlɛxɛ man itexi e xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ISA 10" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xɔnɔfe yarerati ɲaaxie ma</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 10:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na yareratie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:1">naxee yaamari ɲaaxie sɛbɛma, naxee tɔɔɲɛgɛ tima,<verse eid="ISA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 10:2" />alako e xa misikiinɛ tɔɔrɔ kiiti ɲaaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:2">e tinxintareya raba setaree ra naxan baloe bama kaaɲɛ ginɛe nun kiridie yi ra.<verse eid="ISA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 10:3" />Wo munse rabama dɛntɛgɛ sa lɔxɔɛ Alatala ya i?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:3">Wo wo xaxili tima nde ra alako wo xa ratanga?<verse eid="ISA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 10:4" />Wo birama nɛ geelimanie bun ma, wo bɔnɔ mixi faxaxie ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">Hali na birin to rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">Alatala xa xɔnɛ mu gbilenma wo fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:4">a bɛlɛxɛ man itema nɛ wo xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asiriya xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 10:5" />Ɲaxankatɛ na Asiriya bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:5">naxan findixi n ma wuri bɔnbɔ ti se ra n ma xɔnɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:5">N ma gbendegela na a ra.<verse eid="ISA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 10:6" />N e tan nan xɛɛma ɲamanɛ murutaxi xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">n e tan nan nasigama ɲama xili ma, naxan n naxɔnɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">alako e xa naafuli ba na ɲama yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:6">e fa e maboron taa kui alɔ boora.<verse eid="ISA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 10:7" />Kɔnɔ Asiriyakae xa natɛ tan nu na fe gbɛtɛ nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">E nu bara natɛ tongo e xa e xun nakana kerenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:7">alɔ e luma a raba ra duniɲa ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 10:8" />E xa mangɛ naxɛ, «N ma sɔɔri yareratie birin mu findixi mangɛe xa ra?<verse eid="ISA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 10:9" />Kalano taa mu sɔntɔ xɛ alɔ Karakemisi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">Xamata fan mu faxa xɛ alɔ Arapadi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:9">Samari mu kana xɛ alɔ Damasi?<verse eid="ISA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 10:10" />Xa n bara nɔ na bɔxie ra a nun e xa kuyee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:10">kuye naxee sɛnbɛ gbo Darisalamu nun Samari gbee bɛ,<verse eid="ISA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 10:11" />n mu na mɔɔli rabama xɛ Darisalamu fan nun a xa kuyee ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:11">N naxan nabaxi Samari nun a xa kuye ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:11">n mu nɔma xɛ na fan nabade Darisalamu ra xɛ?»<verse eid="ISA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 10:12" />«Kɔnɔ n tan Alatala na gɛ n ma wali birin nakamalide Siyoni geya fari nun Darisalamu, n fama nɛ n ya rafindide Asiriya mangɛ ma, n a xa yɛtɛ igboya sare ragbilen a ma, <verse eid="ISA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 10:13" />barima a luma a fala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">‹N bara yi birin naba n yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">n ma fahaamui nan a niya duniɲa bɔxi birin xa lu n yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">n bara sie xa naafuli tongo n yɛtɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:13">n bara nɔ mangɛ birin na, n findixi mangɛ sɛnbɛma nan na.<verse eid="ISA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 10:14" />N bara n bɛlɛxɛ itala sie xa bannaya tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">n fa naafuli tongo alɔ mixi xɔni xɛlɛe bama a tɛɛ kui ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:14">Mixi yo mu nɔ tɔnyi dɔxɔde n ma.›»<verse eid="ISA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 10:15" />«Bera kole a yɛtɛ matɔxɔma a rawalima bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">Sɛra a yɛtɛ matɔxɔma kamudɛri bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">Bɔnbɔ wuri nɔma mixi bɛlɛxɛ ratede?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:15">Luxusinyi nɔma mixi bɔnbɔde?<verse eid="ISA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 10:16" />Na kui Alatala Sɛnbɛma fama nɛ a xa sɔɔri xungbee xɔside,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:16">a fa e gan tɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 10:17" />Isirayila Marigi Alatala luma nɛ alɔ tɛ sɛniyɛnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:17">naxan e xa tunbe nun baagi birin ganma lɔxɔ keren.<verse eid="ISA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 10:18" />Isirayila xa fɔtɔnyi nun a xa xɛe xun fama nɛ kanade alɔ furema naxan na xɔsife.<verse eid="ISA 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 10:19" />Dimɛdi yati nɔma a xa wuri bili dɔnxɔɛe kɔntide naxee luma a xa fɔtɔnyie kui.»<verse eid="ISA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isirayila mixi dɔnxɔɛe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 10:20" />Na lɔxɔɛ Isirayila mixi dɔnxɔɛe mu e xaxili tima mixie ra sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:20">naxee nu bara nɔ e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:20">Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ e xaxili tima Alatala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:20">naxan findixi Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 10:21" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ mixi dɔnxɔɛe fama nɛ gbilende Ala Sɛnbɛma ma.<verse eid="ISA 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 10:22" />Isirayila, hali i xa ɲama sa gbo nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:22">alɔ mɛyɛnyi naxan na baa dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:22">dondoronti nan tun gbilenma e xɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:22">Alatala bara natɛ tongo tinxinyi kui Isirayilakae sɔntɔfe ra.<verse eid="ISA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 10:23" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma fama nɛ na natɛ rakamalide bɔxi birin kanafe ra.<verse eid="ISA 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 10:24" />Na kui Alatala Sɛnbɛma bara yi masenyi ti, a naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:24">«Wo tan, n ma ɲama naxan sabatixi Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:24">hali wo mu gaaxu Asiriyakae ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:24">naxee na wo bɔnbɔfe luxusinyi nun wuri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:24">alɔ Misirakae nu a rabama ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 10:25" />A gbe mu luxi n ma xɔnɛ xa gbilen wo fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:25">a fa e tan xun nakana.»<verse eid="ISA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 10:26" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma fama nɛ a xa luxusinyi itede e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:26">alɔ a naxan naba Madiyankae xa mangɛ Orebi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:26">A fama nɛ a xa yisuxuwuri itede baa xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:26">alɔ a raba Misira bɔxi ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 10:27" />Na lɔxɔɛ Ala wo xa kote binye bama nɛ wo tunki ma e naxan saxi wo xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:27">Wo xun nakelima nɛ han na kote birin ba wo xun ma.<verse eid="ISA 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 10:28" />Wo yaxuie soma nɛ Ayata, e dangi Migiron ra, e kote nde lu Mikimasi.<verse eid="ISA 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 10:29" />E dangima mɛnni nɛ, e yonkin Gebali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">Gaaxui Ramakae suxuma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:29">mixie e gima nɛ Sɔlu xa bɔxi ma Gibeya.<verse eid="ISA 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 10:30" />Bati Galimukae na wafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:30">«Layisakae, wo xa wo tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:30">Anatɔtikae, wo makinikini.»<verse eid="ISA 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 10:31" />Madamenakae na yesenfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:31">Gebimikae na e nɔxunfe.<verse eid="ISA 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 10:32" />Na lɔxɔɛ na yaxuie danma Nobo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:32">e e bɛlɛxɛ ramaxa Siyoni geya xili ma Darisalamu.<verse eid="ISA 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 10:33" />Marigi Alatala Sɛnbɛma mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">a na wuri bili salonyi bolonfe sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 10:33">A na wuri bili itexi rabirafe bɔxi ma.<verse eid="ISA 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 10:34" />A fama nɛ Liban fɔtɔnyi belebele fɔnde a xa bera ra.<verse eid="ISA 10:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ISA 11" />
  <para style="s">Al Masiihu xa mangɛya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 11:1" />Salonyi nde bulama nɛ Yisayi bɔnsɔɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:1">a sanke a niyama nɛ a xa bogi fanyi ramini.<verse eid="ISA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 11:2" />Alatala Xaxili goroma nɛ a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:2">a findi fahaamui, kolonyi, marasi, sɛnbɛ, nun Ala yaragaaxui ra.<verse eid="ISA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 11:3" />A sɛɛwama nɛ Alatala xa yaragaaxui kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:3">A mu kiiti sama fe toxi xa na mu a ra fe mɛxi tun xa ma.<verse eid="ISA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 11:4" />A misikiinɛe makiitima nɛ tinxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">a natɛ fanyi tongo setaree bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">A duniɲa makiitima nɛ a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:4">a yaamari fi mixi ɲaaxie xa sɔntɔ.<verse eid="ISA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 11:5" />A fe birin nabama tinxinyi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:5">a xa laayidi mu kanama feo.<verse eid="ISA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 11:6" />Na lɔxɔɛ, wulai bare nun yɛxɛɛ luma nɛ yire keren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">xulumase nun si, ninge yɔrɛ nun yɛtɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">e birin luma nɛ yire keren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:6">dimɛdi nde fa e dɛ madon.<verse eid="ISA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 11:7" />Ninge nun baratɛ e dɛ madonma nɛ yire keren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:7">e xa die sa yire keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:7">Yɛtɛ nun ninge birin fama sɛxɛ nan donde.<verse eid="ISA 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 11:8" />Na lɔxɔɛ diyɔrɛ berema nɛ tanbalunbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:8">dimɛdi a bɛlɛxɛ raso sagale yili kui.<verse eid="ISA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 11:9" />Fe xɔrɔxɔɛ yo mu sɔtɔma n tan Alatala xa geya sɛniyɛnxi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:9">duniɲa birin n kolonma nɛ alɔ yɛxɛe baa kolonma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 11:10" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Yisayi bɔnsɔɛ findima tɔnxuma nan na si birin bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:10">e fa e xun ti a ra binyɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 11:11" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala man a xɔnyɛ italama nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:11">a xa ɲama dɔnxɔɛ rakisife ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:11">naxee nu luma Asiriya, Misira, Patirosi, Kusi, Elama, Sinara, Xamata, nun baa surie ma.<verse eid="ISA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 11:12" />A tɔnxuma masenma nɛ si birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">A Isirayila nun Yudaya mixie malanma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:12">naxee nu rayensenxi duniɲa tunxun naani ma.<verse eid="ISA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 11:13" />Efirami bɔnsɔɛ xa tɔɔnɛ ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">Yuda bɔnsɔɛ xa gere masofe fan ɲɔnma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">Efirami bɔɲɛ xinbelima nɛ Yudaya mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:13">Yudaya fan gere luma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 11:14" />E lanma nɛ Filisitakae gerefe ma sogetede mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">e e yaxuie fan gere naxee na sogegorode mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">E nɔma nɛ Edonkae nun Mowabakae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:14">Amonikae fan lu e sagoe.<verse eid="ISA 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 11:15" />Alatala baa itaxun nɛ a xa ɲama bɛ e to keli Misira bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">A Efirati xure fan itaxunma nɛ a xa foye magaaxuxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:15">a fa findi kira ra, ɲama naxee igirima e xaraxi ra.<verse eid="ISA 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 11:16" />Alatala kira fima nɛ a xa ɲama dɔnxɔɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 11:16">alako e xa keli Asiriya, alɔ e benbae Isirayilakae mini Misira bɔxi ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 11:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ISA 12" />
  <para style="s">Marakisi Mangɛ xa matɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 12:1" />Na lɔxɔɛ wo fama nɛ a falade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">«Muxu bara i tan Alatala matɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">I nu bara xɔnɔ muxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">kɔnɔ i xa xɔnɛ bara gbilen muxu fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:1">i fa muxu madundu.<verse eid="ISA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 12:2" />Muxu Rakisima nan na Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">Muxu bara la i ra, sese mu muxu magaaxuma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">barima i tan Alatala nan na muxu sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">i tan nan na muxu xa kisi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:2">Na bara a niya muxu xa bɛɛti ba i matɔxɔfe ra.»<verse eid="ISA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 12:3" />Wo fama nɛ ye bade kisi dulonyi kui sɛɛwɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 12:4" />Na lɔxɔɛ, wo fama nɛ a falade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">«Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">wo xa a xili masen duniɲa bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:4">wo xa a xa wali fanyie fala ɲamanɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 12:5" />Wo xa Alatala matɔxɔ bɛɛtie ra a xa kaabanakoe xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:5">Wo xa duniɲa birin nakolon a xa nɔrɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 12:6" />Wo tan Siyonikae, wo xa wo xui ramini sɛɛwɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 12:6">barima Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ sɛnbɛ gbo wo tagi!»<verse eid="ISA 12:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ISA 13" />
  <para style="s">Babilɔn xa fe raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 13:1" />Alatala xa masenyi Amosi xa di Annabi Esayi bɛ Babilɔn xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 13:2" />Wo tɔnxuma raba geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">wo wo xui rate e yamarife ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:2">e xa kuntigie xa naadɛe igbusan.<verse eid="ISA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 13:3" />N bara yaamari fi n ma mixi sugandixie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:3">n bara n ma ɲalamae xili n ma xɔnɛ masende xunnakeli kui.<verse eid="ISA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 13:4" />Ɲama xui wunduma geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">ɲamae na e malanfe naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:4">Mangɛ Alatala na a xa sɔɔrie xilife gere ma,<verse eid="ISA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 13:5" />e kelixi yire makuye koore baanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:5">Alatala nun a xa mixie fama nɛ yi bɔxi ɲaxankatade a xa xɔnɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 13:6" />Wo xa gbelegbele tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:6">barima Alatala xa lɔxɔɛ bara makɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:6">a na fafe alɔ gbaloe naxan kelixi Ala Sɛnbɛma ma.<verse eid="ISA 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 13:7" />Mixie sɛnbɛ ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:7">limaniya ba e bɔɲɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 13:8" />Gaaxui nun tɔɔrɛ nɔma nɛ e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">e e kutun xɔnɛ bɛ alɔ ginɛ di furi na keli a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:8">Gaaxui belebele toma nɛ e yatagie ma.<verse eid="ISA 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 13:9" />Alatala xa lɔxɔɛ xɔrɔxɔɛ na fafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">a fama nɛ a xa xɔnɛ ra naxan bɔxi xun nakanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:9">naxan yunubitɔɛe sɔntɔma.<verse eid="ISA 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 13:10" />Tunbuie xa yanbɛ ɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:10">soge ifɔɔrɔma nɛ, kike mu yanbama sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 13:11" />N duniɲa ratɔnma nɛ a xa fe ɲaaxi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">n yunubitɔɛ ɲaxankata e xa yunubie xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">N yɛtɛ igboe xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:11">n funmalae xa nɔɛ rabira.<verse eid="ISA 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 13:12" />N adamadie xurunma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:12">alɔ xɛɛma fanyi xurunma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 13:13" />N tan Mangɛ Alatala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:13">n koore nun bɔxi rasɛrɛnma nɛ n ma xɔnɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 13:14" />Mixie luma nɛ e gi ra alɔ bole naxan na wula i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">e lu alɔ xuruse kantama mu naxan fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:14">E gbilenma nɛ e xɔnyi e kelixi dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 13:15" />E naxee suxuma kira ra, e fama nɛ e sɔxɔde tanbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:15">e fa faxade santidɛgɛma ra.<verse eid="ISA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 13:16" />E xa die sɔntɔma nɛ a ɲaaxi ra e ya xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:16">e xa banxie kasara, e xa ginɛe masa e ya xɔri.<verse eid="ISA 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 13:17" />N na birin nabama Medekae nan saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:17">gbeti nun xɛɛma mu naxee madaxuma.<verse eid="ISA 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 13:18" />E xa xalie fonikee rabirama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:18">e mu kinikinima diyɔrɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:18">e mu kinikinima dimɛdie ma.<verse eid="ISA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 13:19" />Alatala nan Babilɔn xa fe xun nakanama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">alɔ a rabaxi Sodoma nun Gomora ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">Babilɔn, naxan xa nɔrɛ gbo duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:19">a birama nɛ a xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kui.<verse eid="ISA 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 13:20" />Mixi yo mu sabatima mɛnni sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:20">Hali biyaasilae nun xuruse dɛmadonyie mu yonkinma naa.<verse eid="ISA 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 13:21" />Wulai subee gbansan nan luma naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">Wulai baree nun xundie nan xima naa banxi kanaxie kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">Wulai sie toma nɛ naa tuganfe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:21">Sikɔtɛ toma nɛ naa e tuganma.<verse eid="ISA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 13:22" />Xulumasee nan luma e xui ramini ra mangɛ banxie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">wulai baree e ɲɛrɛ na longori birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">Babilɔn ɲaxankata tɛmui bara a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 13:22">a gbe mu luxi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ISA 14" />
  <para style="s">Babilɔn xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 14:1" />Alatala kinikinima nɛ Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ ma, a fa e rasabati e xɔnyi Isirayila bɔxi ma. Xɔɲɛe fan kafuma nɛ e ma, e lu lanyi kui Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. <verse eid="ISA 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 14:2" />Sie e malima nɛ sabatide e xɔnyi, na sie fa findi Isirayila xa konyie ra. Mixi naxee nu bara e suxu, e tan yati bara findi Isirayila xa konyie ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 14:3" />Alatala na malabui fi wo ma wo xa tɔɔrɛ nun fe xɔrɔxɔɛ xa fe ra tɛmui naxɛ, a fa wo ramini wo xa konyiɲa wali xɔrɔxɔɛ kui naxan nu bara dɔxɔ wo ma, <verse eid="ISA 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 14:4" />wo fama nɛ yi masenyi tide Babilɔn mangɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:4">«Munse ɲaxankatɛ kanyi ralɔɛxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:4">A tɔɔrɛ naxan dɔxɔxi mixie ma, na ɲɔnxi di?<verse eid="ISA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 14:5" />Alatala bara mixi ɲaaxi xa wuri bɔnbɔ ti se ibolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:5">a bara mangɛ kobi xa munyaati igira,<verse eid="ISA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 14:6" />naxan nu ɲamae bɔnbɔma a xa bɔɲɛ te ra, naxan mu danma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:6">naxan nu nɔɛ dɔxɔma ɲamanɛe ma a xa xɔnɛ kui.»<verse eid="ISA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 14:7" />«Yakɔsi duniɲa na malabui nun xaxilisa nan kui fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:7">birin na e xui itefe sɛɛwɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 14:8" />Hali wuri bili naxee na Liban, e na ɲɛlɛxinfe i xa fe danyi ra, e nu fa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:8">‹Kafi i bira, mixi yo mu muxu fɔnma sɔnɔn.›<verse eid="ISA 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 14:9" />Aligiyama na a yailanfe i fafe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">Kuntigie furee rakelima nɛ i ya ra aligiyama dimi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:9">si mangɛe birin nakelima nɛ e xa kibanyie kui,<verse eid="ISA 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 14:10" />i rasɛnɛfe yi wɔyɛnyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">‹I fan sɛnbɛ bara kana alɔ muxu tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:10">won birin bara lu yire keren.<verse eid="ISA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 14:11" />I xa yɛtɛ igboya bara ragoro gaburi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:11">i xa sigie bara dundu, kulie bara lu i xa sade ma.›»<verse eid="ISA 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 14:12" />«I bara bira kelife koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">i tan naxan nu yanbama alɔ subaxɛ looloe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:12">E bara i rabira bɔxi, i tan naxan nu nɔxi ɲamanɛe ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 14:13" />I nu a fala nɛ i bɔɲɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">‹N tan tema nɛ han ariyanna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">n findi naa mangɛ ra, n dɔxɔ n ma kibanyi kui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:13">malanyi ya ma naxan nabama na geya sɛniyɛnxi fari.<verse eid="ISA 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 14:14" />N tema nɛ nuxui fari, n lu alɔ Ala Sɛnbɛma.›»<verse eid="ISA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 14:15" />«Kɔnɔ i xa nate bara kana, e bara i ragoro kelife koore ma han gaburi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:15">i xa lu yili tilinxi kui aligiyama.<verse eid="ISA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 14:16" />Faxa mixi naxee i toma naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">nee e ya banbanma nɛ i ra, e fa a maɲɔxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">‹Yi nan findixi na mixi ra naxan nu duniɲa imaxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:16">naxan nu mangɛya kanama,<verse eid="ISA 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 14:17" />naxan nu duniɲa findima gbengberenyi ra a xa taae kanafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:17">naxan nu tondima a xa geelimanie bɛɲinde?›»<verse eid="ISA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 14:18" />«Ɲamanɛ mangɛe birin nagataxi e xa gaburi binyɛ nan kui,<verse eid="ISA 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 14:19" />kɔnɔ i tan mu ragataxi i xa gaburi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">alɔ salonyi naxan sɛgɛma wuri ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">alɔ sɔɔri naxan faxaxi santidɛgɛma ra a lu a booree furee ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:19">e birin fa goro aligiyama yili kui.<verse eid="ISA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 14:20" />Binyɛ yo mu luma i xa ɲɔn fe kui alɔ e tan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">barima i bara i xa bɔxi tuxunsan, i bara i xa ɲama sɔntɔ.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 14:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:20">«Mixi ɲaaxi xa die xili nɛɛmuma nɛ duniɲa ra.<verse eid="ISA 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 14:21" />E xa die kɔn xa raxaba e babae xa yunubie xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:21">e naxa e ikeli fa, e bɔxi sɔtɔ e taae tima dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 14:22" />N tan Alatala Sɛnbɛma kelima nɛ e xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">n Babilɔn xili nun a bɔnsɔɛ dɔnxɔɛ raɲɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:22">e xa di yo mu luma naa.<verse eid="ISA 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 14:23" />N e xɔnyi findima xundi yire nan na ye ɲaaxi luma dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">N nee xun nakanama feo.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:23">Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asiriya xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 14:24" />Mangɛ Alatala bara a kali yi masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">«N natɛ naxan tongoxi a fama kamalide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:24">n waxɔnfe mu kanama.<verse eid="ISA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 14:25" />N Asiriya butuxunma nɛ n ma bɔxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">n e boronma nɛ n ma geyae fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">E xa nɔɛ bama nɛ n ma ɲama fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:25">n e xa kote bama nɛ n ma mixie xun.»<verse eid="ISA 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 14:26" />Natɛ nan na ki naxan tongoxi duniɲa birin xili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:26">Alatala Sɛnbɛma bɛlɛxɛ nan na ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:26">a naxan italaxi ɲamanɛe birin xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 14:27" />Alatala bara na natɛ tongo. Nde na kanama?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:27">Alatala nan bɛlɛxɛ italaxi. Nde na isoma?<verse eid="ISA 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filisita xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 14:28" />Mangɛ Axasi faxa ɲɛ naxan na, Ala yi masenyi nan ti,<verse eid="ISA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 14:29" />«Filisitakae, wo naxa sɛɛwa wo yaxuie birafe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">Kelife bɔximase nde ma, bɔximase gbɛtɛ nan barima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:29">naxan xulun, a xɔnɔ na singe bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 14:30" />Na kui, misikiinɛe fama nɛ balode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">tɔɔrɔmixie malabuma nɛ xaxilisa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">kɔnɔ wo tan Filisitakae, n wo faxama nɛ kaamɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:30">n wo bɔnsɔɛ dɔnxɔɛ sɔntɔma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 14:31" />Wa xui xa mini wo ya ma, limaniya xa ba wo yi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">Tuuri fɔɔrɛ na tefe kɔɔla biri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:31">sɔɔri yo mu baxi e ra.»<verse eid="ISA 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 14:32" />Yaabi mundun fima sie xa xɛɛrae ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">E a falama nɛ, «Alatala nan Siyoni xa fe mabanbanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 14:32">a a xa ɲama tɔɔrɔxi kanta.»<verse eid="ISA 14:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ISA 15" />
  <para style="s">Mowaba xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 15:1" />Masenyi nan ya Mowaba xa fe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">A xa taa Ari xun bara rakana kɔɛ keren kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:1">A xa taa Kiri xun bara rakana kɔɛ keren kui.<verse eid="ISA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 15:2" />Dibonkae sigama nɛ wade e xa kuyee yire.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">Mowabakae na wafe e xa taae Nebo nun Medeba xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:2">e e xunyi bii, e e dɛ xabee maxaba sunnunyi kui.<verse eid="ISA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 15:3" />E ɲɔnyi dugie ragoroma e ma kira ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:3">E birin wama nɛ e xui itexi ra e xa banxie kɔn na nun e xa taa malandee kui.<verse eid="ISA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 15:4" />Xɛsibɔnkae nun Eleyalekae na gbelegbelefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">e wa xui sa mɛma han Yahasi taa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">Mowaba sɔɔrie na gbelegbelefe na nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:4">limaniya bara ba e yi ra.<verse eid="ISA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 15:5" />N bɔɲɛ fan na wafe Mowabakae xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">E xa mixie e gima nɛ han Sowari taa, han Egelati Selisiya taa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">E tema nɛ wa ra Luxiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:5">e wa Xoronayimi kira ra,<verse eid="ISA 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 15:6" />barima Nimirin xure bara xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:6">fiilie bara xara, sansie bara kana, burɛxɛ xinde yo mu na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 15:7" />Na bara a niya e xa e xa se dɔnxɔɛe xanin konde yire xure fɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 15:8" />Mowaba wa xui mɛma nɛ naaninyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:8">han Egelayimi, han Beera Elimi.<verse eid="ISA 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 15:9" />Dimɔn xuree ragbeelixi wuli ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">kɔnɔ n mu gɛxi sinden.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">Gbaloe dinma nɛ Mowabakae birin na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 15:9">naxee e gima, nun naxee luma e xa bɔxi ma.<verse eid="ISA 15:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ISA 16" />
  <para style="s">Mowabakae dɛmɛri fenfe Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 16:1" />Wo xa yɛxɛɛ kontonyi nde rasanba bɔxi mangɛ xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:1">kelife Sela naxan na Mowaba wula i, han Siyoni geya tofanyi.<verse eid="ISA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 16:2" />Mowaba ginɛe e gima nɛ Arinon xure igiridee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:2">kɔnɔ e luma nɛ alɔ xɔni naxee kerixi e tɛɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 16:3" />Mowabakae naxɛ, «Darisalamukae, wo xa wo bore to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">wo xa natɛ nde tongo muxu xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">Wo xa muxu nɔxun wo xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:3">wo naxa muxu yanfa won yaxuie ma.<verse eid="ISA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 16:4" />Wo xa Mowabakae ratanga kasarati ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">naxee kantari fenma wo xɔnyi, wo xa e makanta.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 16:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">Kasarati fama sigade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:4">a xa natɛ mu kamalima bɔxi kanafe ra.<verse eid="ISA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 16:5" />Mangɛ kibanyi fama nɛ mabanbande dugutɛgɛya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">Tinxintɔɛ nde naxan fatanxi Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">naxan kiiti sama nɔndi ra tinxintɔɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:5">a fama nɛ a magorode a xa kibanyi kui.<verse eid="ISA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 16:6" />Muxu bara Mowabakae xa yɛtɛ igboɲa kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">A ɲɔxɔ a ma a fisa mixi birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">A a yɛtɛ matɔxɔma tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:6">kɔnɔ nɔndi yo mu na na matɔxɔɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 16:7" />Yakɔsi Mowabakae na wafe e xa bɔxi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:7">e na sunnunyi kui Kire Xareseti xa daxamui kanɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 16:8" />Xɛsibɔn nun Sibima wɛni bilie bara kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">Ɲamanɛ mangɛe bara nee birin kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:8">naxee nu sigama Yaasɛri taa mabiri, han gbengberenyi ma, han baa dɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 16:9" />Na kui n fan wama nɛ Yaasɛri sɛɛti ma Sibima wɛni xɛ xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">N yaye Xɛsibɔn nun Eleyale lima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:9">barima wo mu sɛɛwɛ xui raminima sɔnɔn wo xa xɛe nun wo xa wɛni bogie xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 16:10" />Sɛɛwɛ xui bara ɲɔn wo xa sansi yiree.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Ɲɛlɛxin xui mu mɛma wo xa wɛni xɛe yire sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">Wɛni yailanmae mu wɛni bogi bunduma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:10">e mu ɲɛlɛxin sigi sama na wali xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 16:11" />N bɔɲɛ na tɔɔrɔfe Mowaba xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:11">n sondonyi na wafe Kiri Xareseti xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 16:12" />Mowabakae bara mini sigafe ra e xa kuyee yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">e xa sa e xa alae makula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 16:12">kɔnɔ na fan findima fe fufafu nan na.<verse eid="ISA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 16:13" />Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki Mowaba xa fe ra, naxan masenxi tɛmui dangixi. <verse eid="ISA 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 16:14" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi Alatala naxɛ, «Beenun ɲɛ saxan xa kamali, alɔ a kamalima walikɛ bɛ a xa lanyi kui ki naxɛ, Mowabakae xa xunnakeli ɲɔnma nɛ, a xa ɲama mabere. Mixi dondoronti nan natangama gbaloe ma.»<verse eid="ISA 16:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ISA 17" />
  <para style="s">Damasi xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 17:1" />Masenyi nan ya Damasi xa fe ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:1">Damasi taa xun nakanama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 17:2" />Aroweri taae rabɛɲinma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">e findi fiili ra xuruse dɛ madonma dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:2">Mixi yo mu luma naa naxan xurusee tɔɔrɔma.<verse eid="ISA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 17:3" />Efirami taa makantaxi xun nakanama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Damasi mu findima mangataa ra sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:3">Arami mixi dɔnxɔɛe luma nɛ alɔ Isirayilakae.<verse eid="ISA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 17:4" />«Na lɔxɔɛ Yaxuba xa dariyɛ xurunma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:4">a fate xɔsima nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 17:5" />A luma nɛ alɔ xɛɛ xaba tɛmui Refa gulunba kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:5">Sansie tixi, e xabamae fa e xaba.<verse eid="ISA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 17:6" />Bogi keren keren nan luma a sansi kɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">alɔ Oliwi bogi keren keren luma a bili kɔn na ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">firin xa na mu a ra saxan lu a kɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">naani xa na mu a ra suuli to salonyi keren ma.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:6">Isirayila Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 17:7" />Na lɔxɔɛ mixie fama nɛ Daali Marigi tode, naxan findixi Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra. <verse eid="ISA 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 17:8" />E mu e ya rafindima kuyee ma sɔnɔn, e bɛlɛxɛ naxee yailanxi. E mu sigama surayi gande e xa wuri masolixie yire, e bɛlɛxɛ sole naxee rafalaxi.<verse eid="ISA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 17:9" />Na lɔxɔɛ e xa taa sɛnbɛmae rabɛɲinma nɛ, e findi fɔtɔnyi ra geya fari, alɔ Amori xa taae rabɛɲin ki naxɛ Isirayilakae ya ra. A birin kanama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 17:10" />Wo bara nɛɛmu wo Rakisima Ala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">naxan findixi wo kantama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:10">Wo bara sansi fanyi si naxan kelixi yire makuye.<verse eid="ISA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 17:11" />Wo to e si, e naxa bula wo ya xɔri na kuye iba gɛɛsɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">E naxa fuga keren na, kɔnɔ a xaba tɛmui wo mu bogi yo toma naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:11">Wo luma tɔɔrɛ nan tun kui.<verse eid="ISA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 17:12" />Ɲaxankatɛ xungbe nan na ki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">Ɲama gbegbe na wundufe alɔ baa mɔrɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:12">e na sɔnxɔɛ ratefe alɔ susui belebele.<verse eid="ISA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 17:13" />Kɔnɔ hali e wundu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">e e gima nɛ Alatala xa xaaɲɛ ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">e siga yire makuye alɔ foye maale lagi xaninma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">alɔ foye sɛxɛ xaninma ki naxɛ geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:13">alɔ turunnaadɛ xube rakelima ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 17:14" />E fama gere ra nunmare tɛmui nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">kɔnɔ beenun kuye xa iba, sese mu luma naa sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">Naxee dusuma won xun na, e fu won ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">nee xa fe rabama na ki nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 17:14">Naxee baganma won ma, e won ma naafuli tongo, e xa fe raɲɔnma na ki nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 17:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ISA 18" />
  <para style="s">Kusi xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 18:1" />Wo tan naxee na Kusi xuree naakiri ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:1">xɔni gabutenyi xui mɛma dɛnnaxɛ,<verse eid="ISA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 18:2" />naxee xɛɛrae xɛɛma kunkui kui baa ma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 18:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">N tan bara xɛɛrae xulunxie xɛɛ na si ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">si bɔnsɔɛ kuye rayabuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">naxan magaaxu kabi e fɔlɛ gere xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:2">naxan sabatixi bɔxi ma xure wuyaxi na dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 18:3" />Wo tan duniɲa mixi birin, naxee sabatixi wo xa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">wo na tɔnxuma to geya fari, wo wo ya ti na ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:3">Wo na sare xui mɛ, wo wo tuli mati na ra,<verse eid="ISA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 18:4" />barima Alatala yi nan masenxi n bɛ, a naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">«N magoroxi n xɔnyi xaxilisa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">alɔ wuyenyi luxi sansi ma sogofure tɛmui ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:4">alɔ nuxui na ti xɛ xun ma ɲɛmɛ ra.»<verse eid="ISA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 18:5" />Beenun sansi xaba tɛmui xa a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">sansi na gɛ fugade, kɔnɔ a bogi mu minixi sinden,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">Alatala fama nɛ sansi fuge bolonde finɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:5">a fa salonyie yati masɛgɛ.<verse eid="ISA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 18:6" />A bogi nan luma xɔnie nun wulai sube bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:6">e naxan donma sogofure nun ɲɛmɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 18:7" />Na tɛmui si sɛnbɛma nde fama nɛ hadiya ra Mangɛ Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">si bɔnsɔɛ kuye, rayabuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">naxan magaaxu yire birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">naxan xa xui fala xɔnɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">E fama na hadiya ra Siyoni geya nan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 18:7">Alatala Sɛnbɛma xili matɔxɔma dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 18:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ISA 19" />
  <para style="s">Misira xa ɲaxankatɛ nun e xa kisi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 19:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na Misira bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">Alatala na fafe Misirakae xili ma nuxui fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">E xa kuyee na sɛrɛnfe a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:1">gaaxui bara lu e bɔɲɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 19:2" />N Misirakae radinma nɛ e boore ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:2">kankan nu fa a ngaxakerenyi nun a dɛ fan boore gere taa nun mangɛya xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 19:3" />Limaniya bama nɛ Misirakae yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">n e xa natɛ birin kana nɛ e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">E marasi fenma nɛ e xa alae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:3">e e benba faxaxie maxandi sematoee nun duuree saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 19:4" />N Misirakae soma nɛ mangɛe yi ra naxee xa fe maxɔrɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:4">naxee xa yaamari findi tɔɔrɛ ra ɲama bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:4">Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa masenyi nan ya.<verse eid="ISA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 19:5" />Baa nun xuree ye xɔrima nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 19:6" />Ye naxan luma xureguli, a bɔrɔma nɛ, a xiri ɲaaxi fa te.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:6">Sansi birin naxee na xure dɛ ra e lisima nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 19:7" />Hali naxee na Nili xure xungbe dɛ ra, a soma baa ma dɛnnaxɛ, e fan lisima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:7">Xɛ naxee na xure dɛ ra, e xarama nɛ, foye fa a birin xanin.<verse eid="ISA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 19:8" />Yɛxɛ suxui birin wama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:8">naxee kɔnyi nun yɛlɛ wolima xure ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 19:9" />Naxee gɛsɛ rawalima, e fan luma nɛ tɔɔrɛ kui, limaniya ba e yi ra.<verse eid="ISA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 19:10" />Naxee dugie rawalima, e xun nakanama nɛ, e bɔɲɛ raɲaaxu e ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 19:11" />Sowan mangɛe mu sese fahaamuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">Firawuna xa marasie mu xaxili fanyi yo sɔtɔxi yi fe kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">Mixi a falama di Firawuna bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">«Muxu tan findixi lɔnnilae nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:11">mangɛ forie xa die nan muxu ra?»<verse eid="ISA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 19:12" />Wo xa lɔnnilae na minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:12">E xa wo rakolon Mangɛ Alatala fama naxan nabade Misira ra.<verse eid="ISA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 19:13" />Sowan mangɛe findixi xaxilitare nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">Nofa mangɛe mu gɛxi fahaamui sɔtɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:13">Misira bɔnsɔɛ yareratie na Misirakae ralɔɛfe nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 19:14" />Marigi bara e xaxili ya iso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">alako e xa Misirakae ralɔɛ e xa fe birin kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 19:14">e fa lu alɔ siisila naxan birama a xa bɔxunyi ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 19:15" />Misirakae mu nɔma sese ra e xa mangɛe nun e xa kuntigie saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 19:16" />Na lɔxɔɛ Misirakae na Mangɛ Alatala xa sɛnbɛ to, e sɛrɛnma nɛ gaaxui kui alɔ ginɛe. <verse eid="ISA 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 19:17" />Yudaya xili nan fama Misirakae magaaxude a ɲaaxi ra, fe ma Alatala Sɛnbɛma naxan natɛxi e xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 19:18" />Na lɔxɔɛ taa suuli nan luma Misira bɔxi ma, naxee Kanaan xui falama, e man lu Alatala Sɛnbɛma yi ra. Na taa nde fama nɛ xilide Heresi.<verse eid="ISA 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 19:19" />Na lɔxɔɛ sɛrɛxɛbade keren luma nɛ Alatala bɛ Misira bɔxi tagi, tɔnxuma gɛmɛ fan tima nɛ a bɛ Misira naaninyi ra. <verse eid="ISA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 19:20" />Na findima Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa tɔnxuma nun seedeɲɔxɔya nan na Misira bɛ. E na e xui rate Alatala ma, a marakisima xɛɛma nɛ e ratangade e xa ɲaxankatamae ma.<verse eid="ISA 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 19:21" />Na lɔxɔɛ Alatala a yɛtɛ masenma nɛ Misirakae bɛ, e fa a kolon Ala ra. E fama a batude sɛrɛxɛ nun sansi xɔri hadiya nan na, e kɛrɛ tongo a bɛ e naxan nakamalima. <verse eid="ISA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 19:22" />Alatala gbaloe ragoroma nɛ Misirakae ma, kɔnɔ e na e yɛtɛ ragbilen a ma, Alatala man kinikinima nɛ e ma a xa hinnɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 19:23" />Na lɔxɔɛ kira luma nɛ Misira nun Asiriya tagi. Asiriyakae sigama nɛ Misira, Misirakae fan siga Asiriya. E malanma nɛ yire keren Alatala batufe ra.<verse eid="ISA 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 19:24" />Na lɔxɔɛ Isirayila, Misira, nun Asiriya, barakɛ luma nɛ e saxanyi birin ma duniɲa. <verse eid="ISA 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 19:25" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma dubama nɛ e bɛ, a a masen, «Barakɛ xa lu n ma ɲama Misira ma, barakɛ xa lu n ma daalise Asiriya bɛ, barakɛ xa lu n kɛ tongoma Isirayila bɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ISA 20" />
  <para style="s">Tɔnxuma Misira nun Kusi xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 20:1" />Asiriya mangɛ Saragɔn to a xa sɔɔri mangɛ xɛ Asidodi taa gerede, a fa nɔ a ra, a a suxu, <verse eid="ISA 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 20:2" />Alatala naxa yaamari nde fi Amosu xa di Annabi Esayi ma. A naxɛ, «I xa i xa sunnunyi dugi nun i xa sankiri ba, i lu na ki fa.» Esayi naxa a rabatu, a fa a ɲɛrɛ a mageli ra.<verse eid="ISA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 20:3" />Ɲɛ saxan to dangi, Alatala naxa a masen, «N ma konyi Esayi a ɲɛrɛxi a mageli nan na yi ɲɛ saxan bun ma tɔnxuma ki ma Misira nun Kusi xa fe ra. <verse eid="ISA 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 20:4" />Asiriya mangɛ fama Misiraka nun Kusika mixi suxuxie xaninde na ki nɛ. Dimɛdie nun forie birin sigama e mageli nan na yaagi kui. <verse eid="ISA 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 20:5" />Mixi naxee xaxili nu tixi Misira nun Kusi ra, e luma gaaxui nun yaagi nan kui. <verse eid="ISA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 20:6" />Na lɔxɔɛ naxee nu sabatixi baa dɛ ra e a falama nɛ, ‹Fe mato naxan nabaxi Misirakae nun Kusikae ra. Muxu xaxili nu tixi e tan nan na e xa muxu ratanga Asiriya ma. Yakɔsi muxu fa ratangama di fa?›»<verse eid="ISA 20:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ISA 21" />
  <para style="s">Babilɔn xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 21:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ masenyi nan ya gbengberenyi bɛ naxan na baa dɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">Mixi magaaxuxie na fafe alɔ turunnaadɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:1">kelife Negewi gbengberenyi ma fe xɔrɔxɔɛ kelima dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 21:2" />N bara laamatunyi magaaxuxi to.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">«Yanfante na yanfɛ tife, kasarati na kasarɛ tife.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">Elama, gere ti a bɛ. Mediya, a rabilin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:2">N fama tɔɔrɛ dande Babilɔn findixi naxan saabui ra.»<verse eid="ISA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 21:3" />«Na kui n fate yati na tɔɔrɔfe alɔ ginɛ di furi na keli a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:3">N naxan to, n naxan mɛ, na bara n kaaba.<verse eid="ISA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 21:4" />N bɔɲɛ na tɔɔrɔfe, n na sɛrɛnfe gaaxui kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">N nu na bɔɲɛsa mamɛfe alako n xa malabui sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:4">kɔnɔ yakɔsi na bara findi fe magaaxuxi ra n bɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 21:5" />«Donse yailan, won xa won dɛgɛ yire keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:5">Sɔɔri yareratie wo wo xa kanta see yailan.»<verse eid="ISA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 21:6" />Alatala a masen nɛ n bɛ, a naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:6">«Yire makantɛ ti, alako a fe naxan toma a xa na masen wo bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 21:7" />A fama nɛ sɔɔrie tode firin firin na, soee, sofalee, nun ɲɔxɔmɛe fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:7">A xa e mato a fanyi ra.»<verse eid="ISA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 21:8" />A mu bu, yire makantɛ naxa a xui ramini alɔ yɛtɛ xaaɲɛ, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:8">«Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ n tima naa fe matode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:8">kɔɛ yo kɔɛ n mamɛ tima naa.<verse eid="ISA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 21:9" />N sɔɔri ragie toma fa ra firin firin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">E naxɛ, ‹Babilɔn bara bira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:9">e xa kuyee birin saxi bɔxi ma xuntun xuntunyi ra.›<verse eid="ISA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 21:10" />Wo tan n ma ɲama naxan bara bɔnbɔ alɔ maale naxan na lonyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:10">Isirayila Marigi Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa masenyi nan yi ki.»<verse eid="ISA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Duma xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 21:11" />Ɲaxankatɛ na Dumakae bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">Mixi nde n xilima kelife Seyiri, a naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">«Yire kantama, munse rabaxi yi kɔɛ ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:11">Munse dangixi naa?»<verse eid="ISA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 21:12" />Yire kantama fa a yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">«Kuye na ibafe, kɔnɔ kɔɛ man soma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">Xa wo wama na kolonfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">wo man xa fa n maxɔrin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:12">Iyo, wo man xa fa.»<verse eid="ISA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arabu xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 21:13" />Ɲaxankatɛ na Arabue bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:13">Wo tan Dedanka naxee yonkinma kɔɛ ra Arabu wula i,<verse eid="ISA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 21:14" />wo xa fa ye ra mixie bɛ ye xɔli na naxee ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:14">Temakae wo xa fa taami ra mixi bɛ<verse eid="ISA 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 21:15" />naxee na e gife santidɛgɛma ya ra naxan wama e faxafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 21:15">naxee na e gife xali ya ra naxan wama e sɔntɔfe.<verse eid="ISA 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 21:16" />Alatala yi nan masenxi n bɛ, «Ɲɛ keren nan tun luxi Kedari xa fe xa dan, alɔ walikɛ ɲɛ kɔntima ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ISA 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 21:17" />Kedari xa sɔɔrie xa xalie xurunma nɛ.» Alatala nan xui a ra, Isirayila Marigi Ala.<verse eid="ISA 21:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ISA 22" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 22:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na gulunba bɛ toe tima dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:1">Munse a niyaxi wo birin texi wo xa banxie fari?<verse eid="ISA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 22:2" />Singe wo nu xulunyi rabama, wo nu wo xui ite ɲɛlɛxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">kɔnɔ yakɔsi wo xa fe na di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">Wo xa mixie mu faxa santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:2">e mu faxa gere kui.<verse eid="ISA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 22:3" />Wo xa mangɛe nan tun e gixi e siga yire makuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:3">Mixi naxee luxi, nee bara suxu gere yo mu so.<verse eid="ISA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 22:4" />Na kui n naxa a fala, «Wo n lu na, n xa wa a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:4">Wo naxa kata n madundufe ra n ma ɲama xa kasarɛ ma.»<verse eid="ISA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 22:5" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa lɔxɔɛ ya isoxi nan nu a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">kasarɛ nun tɔɔrɛ nu gboxi tɛmui naxɛ gulunba kui toe tima dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:5">Tɛtɛ nu birama, sɔnxɔɛ nu tema geya fari.<verse eid="ISA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 22:6" />Elamakae e xa xali sase gbakuma e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:6">e nu sigama sɔɔri ragisee kui nun soe fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:6">Kirikae e xa wure lefae mabama.<verse eid="ISA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 22:7" />Sɔɔri nu bara wuya wo xa gulunba fanyie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:7">e nu wuya wo xa taa naadɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 22:8" />Sese mu luxi wo nun wo yaxuie tagi sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:8">Na lɔxɔɛ wo naxa geresosee tongo naxan nu nu mangɛ xa banxi kui.<verse eid="ISA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 22:9" />Wo naxa a to yale gbegbe nu bara ti Dawuda xa taa tɛtɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:9">Wo naxa ye ragata yire nde lanbanyi.<verse eid="ISA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 22:10" />Wo naxa Darisalamu banxie mato, wo fa nde rabira alako wo xa tɛtɛ sɛnbɛ so.<verse eid="ISA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 22:11" />Wo naxa ye ragatade yailan tɛtɛ firinyie tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">ye sama naxan kui kelife ye ragatade fori.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">Kɔnɔ wo mu wo ya rafindixi Ala ma naxan nu bara na fori yailan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:11">Wo mu la a yailanma ra naxan nu bara natɛ tongo na wali xa fe ra kafi a rakuya.<verse eid="ISA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 22:12" />N Marigi Alatala nu bara xili ti na lɔxɔɛ ɲama xa wa sunnunyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:12">wo xa wo xunyie bi, wo xa sunnunyi dugi ragoro wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 22:13" />Kɔnɔ wo mu tin na ra, wo naxa xulunyi ti ɲɛlɛxinyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">wo ninge nun yɛxɛɛ faxa wo naxee donma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">wo wɛni min a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:13">«Won xa won dɛge, won xa wo min, barima tina won faxama nɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 22:14" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma bara a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:14">«Wo xa yi yunubi tan mu xafarima han wo faxa lɔxɔɛ.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:14">Mangɛ Alatala xui nan yi ki.<verse eid="ISA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 22:15" />N Mangɛ Alatala naxa a masen n bɛ, a naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:15">«Siga mangɛ banxi xunyi Sebina yire, a fala a bɛ,<verse eid="ISA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 22:16" />‹I gbe na munse ra be?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:16">Nde na i bɛ be naxan a niyama i xa gaburi tofanyi ge yi geya fari?<verse eid="ISA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 22:17" />A gbe mu luxi, Alatala xa i suxu, a xa i woli yire makuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:17">A i maxirima nɛ alɔ kote,<verse eid="ISA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 22:18" />a i woli bɔxi belebele nde ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">I tan nun i xa sɔɔri ragise fanyie xa fe ɲɔnma mɛnni nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:18">i tan naxan i xa mangɛ bɔnsɔɛ rayaagi.<verse eid="ISA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 22:19" />N i kerima nɛ i xa walide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 22:19">n i tide bama nɛ i yi ra.›»<verse eid="ISA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 22:20" />«Na lɔxɔɛ n Xilikiya xa di Eliyakimi xilima nɛ, a xa n ma wali raba. <verse eid="ISA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 22:21" />N i xa mangɛ guba ragoroma nɛ a ma, n i xa bɛlɛti xiri a tagi, n fa i xa mangɛya fi a ma. A findima Darisalamukae nun Yudayakae baba nan na. <verse eid="ISA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 22:22" />N Dawuda xa mangɛya saabi soma nɛ a yi ra. A na naadɛ nde rabi, mixi yo mu a balanma. A na naadɛ nde balan, mixi yo mu a rabima. <verse eid="ISA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 22:23" />A fama nɛ binyɛ ra a baba bɔnsɔɛ bɛ. N a tima nɛ alɔ wuri di naxan banbanxi a fanyi ra banxi bili ma, <verse eid="ISA 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 22:24" />a baba bɔnsɔɛ xa fe birin gbakuma naxan na, fe xunxurie nun fe xungbee.»<verse eid="ISA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 22:25" />Mangɛ Alatala man naxa a masen, «Kɔnɔ lɔxɔɛ nde na wuri di naxan nu banbanxi a fanyi ra banxi bili ma, a fama nɛ bolonde, a bira a nun fe naxan birin nu gbakuxi a ra.» Alatala xui nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 22:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ISA 23" />
  <para style="s">Tire xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 23:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na Tirekae bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">«Tarasisi kunkui kanyie, wo xa wo wa xui ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">barima Tire bɔxi xun bara rakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">Banxi mu luma naa sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">wafu birin bara kana.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:1">Sipirika ndee xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 23:2" />Wo wo sabari, wo tan naxee sabatixi baa dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:2">wo tan naxee findixi yulɛe ra Sidɔn taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:2">wo tan naxee bara naafuli sɔtɔ yulɛya ra wafu dɛ saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 23:3" />Baa bara a niya wo xa sansi xɔri sɔtɔ kelife Sixori.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">Daxamui naxan mini Nili xure dɛ ra, na nan findixi bannaya ra wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:3">Ɲamanɛe xa makiti xungbe raba nɛ wo xɔnyi.<verse eid="ISA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 23:4" />Sidɔnkae, wo yaagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">wo tan naxee xa nɔɛ nu na baa xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">Xui nde minima kelife baa ma, a naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">«N luxi nɛ alɔ di baritare,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">naxan mu di bari xɔnɛ kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">naxan mu di yo barima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:4">naxan mu di yo ramɔma, xɛmɛ xa na mu a ra ginɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 23:5" />Misirakae na na xibaaru mɛ Tire xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:5">e fama nɛ gaaxude.<verse eid="ISA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 23:6" />Wo xa siga Tarasisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:6">Wo tan naxee na baa dɛ ra, wo xa wo wa xui ite.<verse eid="ISA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 23:7" />Singe wo xa taa nu na ɲɛlɛxinyi nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:7">kɔnɔ yakɔsi nde wo xa mixie xaninxi yire makuye?<verse eid="ISA 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 23:8" />Nde yi natɛ tongoxi Tire xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">a tan naxan nu mangɛ tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">a tan naxan xa yulɛe nu findixi kuntigie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:8">a tan naxan xa yulɛe nu binyaxi duniɲa birin ma?<verse eid="ISA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 23:9" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma nan yi natɛ tongoxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">alako yɛtɛ igboya xa kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:9">xili xungbe kanyie xa magoro.<verse eid="ISA 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 23:10" />Tarasisikae, wo xa bɔxi rawali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:10">alɔ a rabama Nili xure dɛ ra ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:10">barima Sidɔn nun Tire xa wafue mu na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 23:11" />Alatala bara a bɛlɛxɛ itala baa xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">a bara mangɛyae rasɛrɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:11">A bara yaamari fi Fenisiya xa yire makantaxie xa kana.<verse eid="ISA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 23:12" />A naxɛ, «I tan Sidɔn taa tofanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">i mu luma bere ra sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">e fama nɛ i xun nakanade feo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">Hali wo wo gi Sipiri suri ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:12">wo mu bɔɲɛsa sɔtɔma.<verse eid="ISA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 23:13" />Kalide bɔxi mato ba. E xun bara rakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">Asiriyakae bara sa wulai subee sagoe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">E bara e xa yire makantaxie rabilin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:13">e fa e gere han sese mu luxi sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="ISA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 23:14" />«Tarasisi kunkui kanyie, wo xa wo wa xui ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:14">barima wo xa wafu makantaxi xun bara rakana.»<verse eid="ISA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 23:15" />Tire luma nɛɛmui nan kui han ɲɛ tongo solofere, mangɛ keren xa bui xasabi. Ɲɛ tongo solofere raɲɔnyi, fe fama rabade Tire bɛ alɔ a falaxi sigi kui langoe ginɛ xa fe ra ki naxɛ,<verse eid="ISA 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 23:16" />«I tan langoe ginɛ, birin nɛɛmuxi naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">i xa kɔra bɔnbɔ a fanyi ra taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 23:16">i xa sigi sa alako mixie xa ratu i xa fe ma.»<verse eid="ISA 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 23:17" />Ɲɛ tongo solofere raɲɔnyi, Marigi a ya rafindima nɛ Tire ma. A gbilenma nɛ a xa langoeɲa fori ma, a a yɛtɛ sa duniɲa mangɛyae birin sagoe kɔbiri xa fe ra. <verse eid="ISA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 23:18" />Kɔnɔ a xa geeni fama rawalide Alatala xa fe nan kui. A mu nɔma na ragatade a yɛtɛ bɛ, a luma mixie nan bɛ naxee birama Alatala fɔxɔ ra, alako e xa donma fanyie nun baloe gbegbe sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 23:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ISA 24" />
  <para style="s">Duniɲa xa ɲaxankatɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 24:1" />Alatala fama nɛ duniɲa kanade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:1">sese mu lu bɔxi ma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:1">adamadie yensenma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 24:2" />Mixi birin luma tɔɔrɛ nan kui:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">sɛrɛxɛdubɛ nun ɲama, kuntigi nun konyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">ginɛ banxi kanyi nun konyi ginɛ, yulɛ nun saresoe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:2">yefu ti nun setare, doni tongoe nun doni kanyi.<verse eid="ISA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 24:3" />Duniɲa fama nɛ kanade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:3">a isee birin ɲɔnma nɛ a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:3">Alatala xui nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 24:4" />Duniɲa tuxunsanma nɛ, a ixarama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:4">kuntigie yati halakima nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 24:5" />Duniɲa mixie bara duniɲa kɔsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">e bara e kobe so sɛriyɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">e Ala xa yaamarie matandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:5">e a xa saatɛ kana.<verse eid="ISA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 24:6" />Na nan a ra Alatala duniɲa halakima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">na kote dusu adamadie xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:6">duniɲa mixie mu gbo sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 24:7" />Xɛ xaba tɛmui sansie xurunma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:7">xɛ xabae nimisa.<verse eid="ISA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 24:8" />Sanbanyi nun kɔra xui danma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:8">xulunyi yensen.<verse eid="ISA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 24:9" />Mixie mu e sɛɛwama sigi xui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:9">donse yati mu rafanma e ma.<verse eid="ISA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 24:10" />Taa kanaxi luma na ki nɛ tun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:10">a banxie birin balan.<verse eid="ISA 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 24:11" />Sɔnxɔɛ tema nɛ taa kui minse nun donse xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:11">Sɛɛwɛ bara ɲɔn, ɲɛlɛxinyi bara siga.<verse eid="ISA 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 24:12" />Sɔntɔɛ nan tun luma taa kui fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:12">taa naadɛ kana feo.<verse eid="ISA 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 24:13" />Na ɲaxankatɛ na ɲɔn duniɲa bɛndɛ fuɲi fari ɲamanɛe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">na luma nɛ alɔ oliwi bili naxan imaxama alako a bogie xa ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:13">na luma nɛ alɔ sansi tɔnsɔɛ keren keren naxee luma xɛ ma xɛ xabae dangi xanbi.<verse eid="ISA 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 24:14" />Kɔnɔ naxee na sogegorode biri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:14">nee e xui itema nɛ sɛɛwɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:14">e bɛɛti ba Alatala matɔxɔfe ra.<verse eid="ISA 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 24:15" />Naxee na sogetede biri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">nee Alatala matɔxɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:15">e Isirayila Marigi Alatala xili matɔxɔ baa surie ma.<verse eid="ISA 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 24:16" />Kelife duniɲa tunxun naanie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">won bɛɛti mɛma nɛ naxan a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">«Nɔrɛ kanyi nan Tinxintɔɛ ra.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 24:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Kɔnɔ n tan naxa e yaabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">«N xun nakanafe, n fate na bafe n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Ɲaxankatɛ na n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:16">Tinxintaree bara n yanfa a ɲaaxi ra.»<verse eid="ISA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 24:17" />Gbaloe nan wo lima, wo tan duniɲa mixie.<verse eid="ISA 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 24:18" />Naxan na a gi na gbaloe ya ra, a birama yili nan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">Naxan na te na yili kui, yɛlɛ nan dusuma a xun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">Koore walaxɛ birama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:18">bɔxi fan sɛrɛn.<verse eid="ISA 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 24:19" />Duniɲa kanama nɛ, a ibɔɔ, a sɛrɛn.<verse eid="ISA 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 24:20" />A dagalanma nɛ alɔ siisila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">a imaxa alɔ bage turunnaadɛ mini tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">barima a xa yunubie bara gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:20">A birama nɛ, a mu kelima sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 24:21" />Na lɔxɔɛ Alatala koore daalie nun duniɲa mangɛe ɲaxankatama nɛ e xa walie ma.<verse eid="ISA 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 24:22" />E fama nɛ malande yire keren alɔ geelimanie naxee na geeli kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:22">E buma nɛ naa han e fa kiiti.<verse eid="ISA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 24:23" />Kike nun soge lɔɛma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">Mangɛ Alatala yaamari tima nɛ Siyoni geya fari Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 24:23">forie ya i a nɔrɛ fanyi bun ma.<verse eid="ISA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ISA 25" />
  <para style="s">Tɔɔrɔmixi xa kantari na Ala nan na</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 25:1" />Alatala, n Marigi na i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">N i xili matɔxɔma nɛ i xa fe makaabaxie xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:1">i naxee natɛxi kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye dugutɛgɛɲa kui.<verse eid="ISA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 25:2" />I bara muxu yaxuie xa taa makantaxi rabira,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:2">a findi gɛmɛ yensenxie ra naxan mu tima sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 25:3" />Na nan a ra ɲama sɛnbɛmae i matɔxɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:3">si ɲaaxie fa i binyade.<verse eid="ISA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 25:4" />I findixi misikiinɛ xa kantari nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">yire makantaxi tɔɔrɔmixi luma dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">I luxi alɔ banxi fanyi turunnaadɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">alɔ bage naxan tixi soge ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:4">Si ɲaaxi maniyaxi turunnaadɛ nan na naxan bɔnbɔma banxi ra,<verse eid="ISA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 25:5" />a lu alɔ wuyenyi naxan na gbengberenyi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">I ɲamanɛ xa sɔnxɔɛ raxinbelima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">alɔ nuxui niini nde bama soge xa wuyenyi ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:5">Na ɲama ɲaaxi xa sigi sa danma na ki nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 25:6" />Yi geya fari, Alatala Sɛnbɛma fama nɛ xulunyi belebele tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:6">ɲama birin xa minse nun donse ɲɔxunmɛe li naa.<verse eid="ISA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 25:7" />Yi geya fari, Alatala fama nɛ mafelenyi bade bɔnsɔɛ birin ma,<verse eid="ISA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 25:8" />a saya xa fe kanama nɛ abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">Won Marigi Alatala yaye mafurukuma nɛ yatagi birin ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">a a xa ɲama xa yaagi birin ba duniɲa ya xɔri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:8">Alatala xui nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 25:9" />Na lɔxɔɛ e a falama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">«Won Marigi Ala nan yi ki won won xaxili tixi naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">A bara won nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">Alatala nan yi ki won won xaxili tixi naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:9">Won xa sɛɛwa a xa kisi ra.»<verse eid="ISA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 25:10" />Alatala xɔnyɛ luma nɛ yi geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:10">kɔnɔ Mowabakae maboronma nɛ alɔ sɛxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 25:11" />E katama nɛ e xa e ba a yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:11">kɔnɔ Alatala e xa yɛtɛ igboya ragoroma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:11">a e sɛnbɛ birin ɲɔn.<verse eid="ISA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 25:12" />A e xa yire makantaxie rabirama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:12">a na birin butuxun han a findi xube ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 25:12">A e xa yɛtɛ igboya ragoroma nɛ feo.<verse eid="ISA 25:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ISA 26" />
  <para style="s">Taa sɛnbɛma xa bɛɛti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 26:1" />Na lɔxɔɛ e yi bɛɛti nan bama Yudaya bɔxi ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">Ala bara taa sɛnbɛma fi won ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:1">naxan xa tɛtɛ findima kisi ra won bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 26:2" />Naadɛ xa rabi, ɲama tinxinxi xa so,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:2">ɲama naxan mu lanlanteya kana.<verse eid="ISA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 26:3" />Mixi naxan ɲanige fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:3">a findima bɔɲɛsa kanyi nan na, barima a laxi i ra.<verse eid="ISA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 26:4" />Wo wo yɛtɛ taxu Alatala ra tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:4">barima Alatala nan na Ala ra naxan na abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:4">naxan sɛnbɛ gbo alɔ fanye.<verse eid="ISA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 26:5" />A bara yɛtɛ igboe ragoro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:5">a e xa taa itexi igoro, a findi xube ra,<verse eid="ISA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 26:6" />misikiinɛe nun setaree naxan iboronma.<verse eid="ISA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 26:7" />I tan Alatala tinxinxi, i tinxintɔɛ xa fe sɔɔnɛyama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 26:8" />Muxu ɲɛrɛma i xa sɛriyɛ nan ma, muxu xaxili tixi i ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:8">Muxu i xili matɔxɔma muxu bɔɲɛ birin na.<verse eid="ISA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 26:9" />Muxu nii yati hayi na i ma kɔɛ ra, a i fenma gɛɛsɛgɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">I na i xa kiiti sa duniɲa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:9">na nan duniɲa mixie matinkanma tinxinyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 26:10" />Kɔnɔ mixi ɲaaxie tan, hali e kinikini e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">e mu birama tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">Hali ɲama birin birama tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">e tan tondima nɛ gbilende fe ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:10">e mu gaaxuma Alatala xa mangɛya ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 26:11" />Alatala, i sɛnbɛ gbo, kɔnɔ e mu na toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">I xanunteya naxan saxi i xa ɲama ma, a niya e xa na to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:11">na xa findi e bɛ yaagi ra, i xa tɛ fa e gan.<verse eid="ISA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 26:12" />Alatala, i bara bɔɲɛsa fi muxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:12">barima i tan nan muxu xa wali birin nakamalima muxu bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 26:13" />Muxu Marigi Alatala, marigi gbɛtɛe bara nɔɛ dɔxɔ muxu ma bafe ra i tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:13">kɔnɔ muxu i tan nan keren batuma.<verse eid="ISA 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 26:14" />Na marigie bara faxa, e mu baloma sɔnɔn, e nii mu kelima abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">I bara keli e xili ma, i e sɔntɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:14">I bara e xa fe birin nalɔɛ.<verse eid="ISA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 26:15" />Alatala, i bara i xa ɲamanɛ ragbo yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">i bara e xa bɔxi naaninyie masara, bɔxi xa gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:15">I bara matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ na fe kui.<verse eid="ISA 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 26:16" />Alatala, e nu na i fenfe i xa ɲaxankatɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:16">e fa i maxandi.<verse eid="ISA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 26:17" />E nu e xui itema i ma alɔ ginɛ naxan na di barife tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 26:18" />Muxu bara tɔɔrɔ na di barife kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">kɔnɔ na fe findixi fufafu nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">Muxu mu wali yo rabaxi naxan findixi kisi ra duniɲa bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:18">e mu kisi sɔtɔ muxu saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 26:19" />Kɔnɔ i tan nan faxa mixie rakelima faxɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">«Wo tan naxee saxi bɛndɛ bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">wo xa keli, wo xa sɛɛwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">Wo luxi nɛ alɔ xini soge naxan ralɔɛma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:19">Wo fan nalɔɛma na ki nɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 26:20" />N ma ɲama, wo xa gbilen wo xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">wo xa naadɛ balan saabi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:20">Wo xa wo nɔxun dondoronti han yi xɔnɛ xa dangi sinden.<verse eid="ISA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 26:21" />Alatala fama nɛ kelife a xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">a fa duniɲa mixie ratɔn e xa yunubie xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">Bɔxi wuli dɛntɛgɛma nɛ a naxan minxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 26:21">a mu mixi faxaxie ragatama sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ISA 27" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa kisi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 27:1" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala ninginangɛ magaaxuxi ɲaxankatama nɛ a xa santidɛgɛma xungbe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">Na xili Lewitan, a sabatixi baa nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">A suxufe xɔrɔxɔ, barima a salaxun a gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:1">kɔnɔ Alatala a sɔntɔma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 27:2" />Na lɔxɔɛ, wo xa bɛɛti ba n ma wɛni bili fanyie xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 27:3" />N tan Alatala nan na a kantama ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">N ye sama nɛ a ma tɛmui birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:3">N a kantama nɛ kɔɛ nun yanyi ra alako mixi yo naxa a tɔɔrɔ.<verse eid="ISA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 27:4" />N xɔnɔ xɔnɔ, kɔnɔ xa n sa tunbee li naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:4">n e gerema nɛ, n tɛ din e ra.<verse eid="ISA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 27:5" />Xa a sa li e naxa fa n yire lanyi xiride,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:5">n tinma nɛ a ra a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 27:6" />Lɔxɔɛ na fafe, Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ a sanke sɔrɔnma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ a salonyie nun a fugee ramini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:6">a duniɲa rafe a bogie ra.<verse eid="ISA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 27:7" />Alatala Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ bɔnbɔ nɛ, alɔ a e yaxuie bɔnbɔ ki naxɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:7">A e faxa nɛ, alɔ a e faxa ki naxɛ?<verse eid="ISA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 27:8" />A xa xɔnɛ naxa din e ra, a e xanin alɔ foye xungbe.<verse eid="ISA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 27:9" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ xa yunubie xafari na ki nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">Na kui, e naxa kuye sɛrɛxɛbadee kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">e naxa Asera wuri masolixie ba e xa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:9">e naxa kuye xa surayi gansee kana.<verse eid="ISA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 27:10" />Taa sɛnbɛmae bara kiro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">e findi nɛ yire rabɛɲinxi ra alɔ gbengberenyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">Ningee nu luma naa e dɛmadonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:10">e e sa, e mɛnni wuri burɛxɛ birin don.<verse eid="ISA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 27:11" />Wuri salonyie na xara, ginɛe nu e gan tɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">Ɲama xaxilitare nan nu a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">E daali mangɛ mu kinikinixi e ma na nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 27:11">Naxan e daaxi, na mu hinnɛxi e ra.<verse eid="ISA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 27:12" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala wuri bilie imaxama nɛ, keli Efirati xure dɛ ra han Misira xure dɛ ra. A wo tan Isirayila xa die birin matongoma nɛ keren keren.<verse eid="ISA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 27:13" />Na lɔxɔɛ, feri xungbe fema nɛ, alako mixi naxee nu lɔɛxi Asiriya bɔxi ma, a nun naxee nu yensenxi Misira bɔxi ma, e birin gbilenma nɛ, e fa suyidi Alatala bɛ geya sɛniyɛnxi fari Darisalamu.<verse eid="ISA 27:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ISA 28" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankatɛ na Samari bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 28:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na Efirami taa yɛtɛ igboe siisilae bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">naxan tixi gulunba koore ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:1">kɔnɔ a xa tofanyi luxi nɛ alɔ sansi fuge lisixi.<verse eid="ISA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 28:2" />Sɛnbɛmae nan fafe yi ki Marigi xili ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">naxan luxi alɔ turunnaadɛ foye xungbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:2">alɔ balabalan tunɛ naxan sɛnbɛ Samari xun nagoroma.<verse eid="ISA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 28:3" />Efirami taa yɛtɛ igboe siisilae birama nɛ, e maboron.<verse eid="ISA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 28:4" />Na sansi fuge lisixi naxan tixi gulunba koore ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:4">a luxi nɛ alɔ xɔrɛ bogi mɔxi naxan donma kerenyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 28:5" />Na lɔxɔɛ, Alatala Sɛnbɛma luma nɛ alɔ mangɛ katanyi tofanyi a xa ɲama dɔnxɔɛe bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 28:6" />A xaxili tinxinxi fima nɛ kiitisae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:6">a sɛnbɛ fi sɔɔrie ma naxee na gere kui.<verse eid="ISA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 28:7" />Kɔnɔ wo xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe nun namiɲɔnmɛe bara lɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">Beere e dagalanma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">e daxu laamatunyi to tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:7">e mu fata fe tagi rabade.<verse eid="ISA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 28:8" />E tixi e yɛtɛ xa bɔxunyi tagi, e birin nɔxɔxi a ɲaaxi ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 28:9" />«Ala wama e xaranfe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">A fahaamui fima e ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:9">E luxi alɔ diyɔrɛ naxee dɛ baxi e nga xiɲɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 28:10" />Fo a xa wɔyɛn e bɛ diyɔrɛ daaxi.»<verse eid="ISA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 28:11" />Alatala fama a masende yi ɲama bɛ xɔɲɛ saabui ra,<verse eid="ISA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 28:12" />«Malabude nan yi ki, wo xa wo malabu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Yire raxaraxi na a ra.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:12">Kɔnɔ e mu tin e tuli matide a ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 28:13" />Na kui Alatala fama nɛ masenyi tide e bɛ diyɔrɛ daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:13">alako e xun xa rakana, yaxuie xa e suxu, e e xanin.<verse eid="ISA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 28:14" />Awa, wo tan mixi mayelee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:14">wo tan naxee Darisalamu yamarima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:14">wo wo tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 28:15" />Wo naxɛ, «Muxu nun saya bara saata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">muxu nun gaburi bara lanyi xiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">Gbaloe yo mu muxu lima won ma kantari kui.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:15">Kɔnɔ e na e nɔxunfe wule xanbi ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 28:16" />Alatala e yaabima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">«N bara gɛmɛ hagigɛ dɔxɔ Siyoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">gɛmɛ fanyi naxan mu kanama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:16">Limaniya mu bama mixi yi ra naxan a taxuma na gɛmɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 28:17" />N bara tinxinyi ti sɛriyɛ ra, n bara nɔndi sa kiiti ki ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">Wo xa wule naxee findixi wo xa kantari ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:17">banbaranyi fama nɛ e xaninde.<verse eid="ISA 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 28:18" />Wo xa saatɛ, wo nun saya ra, a kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">wo xa lanyi, wo nun gaburi ra, a fulunma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:18">Gbaloe nɔma nɛ wo ra a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 28:19" />Fe xɔrɔxɔɛ na wo li, a wo xun nakanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">gɛɛsɛgɛ yo gɛɛsɛgɛ, fɛɛɲɛn yo fɛɛɲɛn, kɔɛ yo kɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:19">Wo na so yi fe kui, wo ifuma nɛ gaaxui ra.»<verse eid="ISA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 28:20" />«Wo xa sade xurun, wo mu nɔma wo sade a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:20">Wo xa xinbeli dugi xurun, a mu wo kantama xinbeli ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 28:21" />Alatala kelima nɛ alɔ a keli Perasimi geya fari ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">a xɔnɔma nɛ alɔ a xɔnɔ Gabayon gulunba kui ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:21">alako a xa a xa wali makaabaxi raba.<verse eid="ISA 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 28:22" />Na kui wo ba mayele tife,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">alako a naxa fa gbilen wo xiri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:22">barima Ala bara a xa natɛ masen n bɛ bɔxi kanafe ra.»<verse eid="ISA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 28:23" />«Wo wo tuli mati n xui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:23">wo wo tuli mati n ma masenyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 28:24" />Xɛ sa xɛ buxama tɛmui birin?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:24">A bɛndɛ ramaxama lɔxɔɛ birin?<verse eid="ISA 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 28:25" />A na gɛ bɔxi buxade, a mu sansi garansanma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:25">A mu sansi xɔri birin wolima a ki ma?<verse eid="ISA 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 28:26" />A Marigi Ala a xaran a si ki ra.<verse eid="ISA 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 28:27" />Sansi mɔɔli nde mu bɔnbɔma wure ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:27">a bɔnbɔma wuri nan na.<verse eid="ISA 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 28:28" />Sansi mɔɔli gbɛtɛ nɔma bɔnbɔde wure ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:28">kɔnɔ a mu radangima a i.<verse eid="ISA 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 28:29" />Na wali ki birin fatanxi Alatala Sɛnbɛma nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 28:29">A xa walie makaaba, a xa fe fanyie gbo.»<verse eid="ISA 28:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="ISA 29" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankatɛ na Darisalamu bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 29:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na Ariyɛli taa bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:1">mangɛ Dawuda nu sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:1">Wo xa nu wo xa salie raba ra ɲɛ yo ɲɛ alɔ wo darixi a ra ki naxɛ,<verse eid="ISA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 29:2" />kɔnɔ n fama nɛ Ariyɛli xa tɛtɛ rabilinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:2">a fa tɔɔrɔ gere kui, a xa lu alɔ sɛrɛxɛbade naxan dɛxɛxi.<verse eid="ISA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 29:3" />N fama nɛ wo rabilinde n ma sɔɔrie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:3">muxu xa wali raba wo xa tɛtɛ kanade.<verse eid="ISA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 29:4" />Wo xa fe fama nɛ magorode han a lu alɔ wo xui na minife bɔxi nan bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:4">Wo xa wɔyɛnyi makɔlikɔlima nɛ kelife gaburi kui.<verse eid="ISA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 29:5" />Wo yaxuie wuyama nɛ alɔ xubutanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:5">e xa sɔɔrie luma nɛ alɔ maale lagi foye ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:5">Kɔnɔ na tɛmui ya magirɛ keren kui,<verse eid="ISA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 29:6" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma fama nɛ sesarinyi nun galanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:6">bɔxi sɛrɛnma nɛ, turunnaadɛ goroma nɛ, tɛ minima nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 29:7" />Na tɛmui Ariyɛli yaxuie lɔɛma nɛ keren na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">e fa lu alɔ xiye ɲaaxi mixi raxunuma tɛmui naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:7">Na sɔɔrie nun e xa gereso wali birin ɲɔnma nɛ feo.<verse eid="ISA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 29:8" />A luma nɛ alɔ kaamɛtɔɛ naxan xiye sa a na a dɛgefe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">kɔnɔ a fa xunu kaamɛ ra a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">A luma nɛ alɔ mixi naxan xiye sa a na ye minfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">kɔnɔ a fa xunu ye xɔli ra a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:8">A luma na ki nɛ na sɔɔri gali xa fe ra naxan na Siyoni mixie gerefe.<verse eid="ISA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 29:9" />A xa findi wo bɛ tɛrɛnna ra, wo dɛ xa ixara.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">Wo wo yae raxi, wo xa findi dɔnxuie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:9">Wo na dagalanfe siisi daaxi, kɔnɔ beere mu a ra.<verse eid="ISA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 29:10" />Alatala nan wo raxixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:10">a bara wo xa namiɲɔnmɛe yae balan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:10">a bara wo xa sematoe xunyi makoto.<verse eid="ISA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 29:11" />Yi laamatunyi luxi nɛ alɔ sɛbɛli matɔnxumaxi. Na soma mixi nan yi naxan fata a xarande alako a xa a xaran, kɔnɔ a fa a yaabi, «N mu nɔma a xarande wo bɛ, barima a balanxi tɔnxuma ra.» <verse eid="ISA 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 29:12" />Xa na mu a ra, a luxi alɔ sɛbɛli naxan soma mixi xarantare yi ra alako a xa a xaran, kɔnɔ a fa a yaabi, «N tan mu fata a xarande.»<verse eid="ISA 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 29:13" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">«Yi ɲama bara fa, e xa n matɔxɔ e dɛ ra, kɔnɔ e bɔɲɛ tan makuya n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:13">E xa batui findixi adamadie xa yaamari ratinmɛfe nan tun na.<verse eid="ISA 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 29:14" />Na nan a toxi n man yi ɲama dɛ ixarama nɛ kaabanakoe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">Lɔnnilae xa lɔnni mu gɛma na kolonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:14">fe kolonyie mu soma na fe kui.<verse eid="ISA 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 29:15" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixie bɛ naxee e nɔxunma Alatala ma natɛ kobi rabafe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">E to e xa walie rabama dimi nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:15">e maɲɔxun, ‹Nde muxu toxi? Nde a kolon muxu naxan nabama?›<verse eid="ISA 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 29:16" />Wo xa daxuɲa sɛnbɛ gbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Bɛndɛ nɔma lude alɔ a yailanma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Se yailanxi nɔma a falade a yailanma bɛ, a mu n yailanxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:16">Fɛɲɛ nɔma a falade a yailanma bɛ, a xaxili mu fan?»<verse eid="ISA 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 29:17" />A gbe mu luxi Liban wondi xa masara xɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:17">xɛ fan xa masara wondi ra.<verse eid="ISA 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 29:18" />Na lɔxɔɛ, tuli xɔrie kitaabui xaranmae xui mɛma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:18">dɔnxuie fan minima nɛ dimi xɔɔra, e se to.<verse eid="ISA 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 29:19" />Yɛtɛ magoroe sɛɛwama nɛ Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:19">misikiinɛe sɛɛwama nɛ Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 29:20" />Funmala mu luma naa sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:20">mixi mayele lɔɛma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:20">Fe kobi rabae lɔɛma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 29:21" />E mixi tɔɔɲɛgɛma wule ra, e gantanyi italama tinxintɔɛe bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 29:22" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ Marigi xa masenyi nan ya naxan Iburahima xun saraxi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">«To dangi xanbi, Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ mu yaagima sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:22">a bɔɲɛ mu raɲaaxuma a ma.<verse eid="ISA 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 29:23" />A xa die na n ma walie to e tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">e n xili binyama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">e e magoroma nɛ Yaxuba xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:23">e gaaxuma nɛ Isirayila Marigi Ala ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 29:24" />Mixi ifuxi fahaamui sɔtɔma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 29:24">sɔnxɔɛ ratee tinma nɛ lɔnni ra.»<verse eid="ISA 29:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="ISA 30" />
  <para style="s">Ɲaxankatɛ bɔnsɔɛ murutɛla bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 30:1" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">«Ɲaxankatɛ na bɔnsɔɛ murutɛla bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">E natɛe tongoma, naxee mu kelixi n tan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">E saatɛe xirima, n Xaxili mu e yamarixi naxee ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:1">Na kui e yunubi xun masama tun.<verse eid="ISA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 30:2" />E sigama Misira, e e yɛtɛ taxu mɛnni mangɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">E wama lufe a xa kantɛ bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:2">E na birin naba n tan xanbi.<verse eid="ISA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 30:3" />Misira mangɛ xa kantɛ findima yaagi nan na wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:3">lufe a xa niini bun ma na wo tɔɔrɔma nɛ tun.<verse eid="ISA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 30:4" />Hali wo kuntigie xɛɛ Sowan nun Xanɛsi Misira bɔxi ma,<verse eid="ISA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 30:5" />e birin fama lude yaagi nan kui na ɲama xa fe ra naxan mu e malima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:5">E mu wo dɛmɛnma, e wo rayaagima tun.»<verse eid="ISA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 30:6" />Ɲaxankatɛ na Negewi gbengberenyi subee bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">E bɔxi xɔrɔxɔɛ nan igirima yɛtɛe nun bɔximasee na dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">e xa bannaya xaninfe ra sofalee nun ɲɔxɔmɛe fari ɲama xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:6">naxan mu fata e malide fefe ma.<verse eid="ISA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 30:7" />Misira xa mali findima fe fufafu nan tun na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:7">Na nan a ra, n naxa yi xili sa a xun ma: Turunnaadɛ taganxi.<verse eid="ISA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 30:8" />Yi fe sɛbɛ walaxɛ ma e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:8">a sɛbɛ buki ma alako a xa findi seede ra abadan.<verse eid="ISA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 30:9" />Ɲama murutɛla nan a ra, naxan a booree madaxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:9">naxan mu wama a tuli matife Alatala xa sɛriyɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 30:10" />E a falama sematoe bɛ, «Wo naxa laamatunyie to.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">E a falama namiɲɔnmɛe bɛ, «Wo naxa masenyi tinxinxi ti.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">E naxɛ, «Wo xa masenyi ɲɔxunmɛe ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:10">wo xa wɔyɛn fanyi fala, hali nɔndi mu a ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 30:11" />Wo xa keli yi kira xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:11">wo xa Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ masenyi lu naa.»<verse eid="ISA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 30:12" />Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ xa yaabi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">«Wo to tondi yi masenyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:12">wo fa la tɔɔrɛ nun madaxui ra,<verse eid="ISA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 30:13" />yi yunubi luma nɛ wo bɛ alɔ tɛtɛ kanaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:13">naxan birama tɛrɛnna ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 30:14" />A kanama nɛ alɔ fɛɲɛ kanaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:14">hali tɛ kɔ se, xa na mu a ra ye base mu mini a kui.»<verse eid="ISA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 30:15" />Marigi Ala naxan findixi Isirayila Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra, a xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">«Xa wo gbilen n ma, wo fa wo raxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">n wo rakisima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">Xa wo dɔxɔ, wo fa wo taxu n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">n sɛnbɛ fima nɛ wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:15">Kɔnɔ wo mu tin na ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 30:16" />Wo naxɛ, ‹Ade, muxu tan muxu gima soee nan fari.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">Awa yire, wo fama gide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">Wo naxɛ, ‹Muxu tan muxu gima soe xulunxie nan fari.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:16">Awa yire, kɔnɔ wo kerimae xulun wo bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 30:17" />Wo wulu keren, wo gima nɛ wo yaxui keren ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">Xa yaxui suuli na a ra, wo birin wo gima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:17">wo fa lu alɔ geya wuri keren gbansan tixi naxan fari.»<verse eid="ISA 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 30:18" />Kɔnɔ na kui Alatala na mamɛ tife alako a xa hinnɛ wo ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">A fama nɛ kelide, a kinikini wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">barima Alatala tinxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:18">Sɛɛwɛ na mixi bɛ, naxan a xaxili tixi a ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 30:19" />Siyonikae, wo tan naxee sabatixi Darisalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">wo mu yaye raminima sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">Wo na a xili, a hinnɛma nɛ wo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:19">a na wo xui mɛ, a wo yaabima nɛ keren na.<verse eid="ISA 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 30:20" />Hali wo Marigi a niya wo xa lu fe xɔrɔxɔɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:20">wo karamɔxɔɛe mu e nɔxunma wo ma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:20">wo fama nɛ e tode wo yae ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 30:21" />Wo na siga yirefanyi ma, wo na siga kɔɔla ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:21">wo fama nɛ masenyi mɛde wo xanbi ra naxan a falama wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:21">«Kira fanyi nan ya, wo xa wo ɲɛrɛ a xɔn ma.»<verse eid="ISA 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 30:22" />Na kui wo xa kuye naxee yailanxi gbeti nun xɛɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:22">wo fama nɛ nee wolide alɔ se sɛniyɛntaree,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:22">wo fa a fala, «Wo keli be!»<verse eid="ISA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 30:23" />Na tɛmui Alatala tunɛ rafama nɛ wo xa sansie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:23">wo xa bɔxi daxamui gboma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:23">Na tɛmui wo xa xurusee sigama nɛ e dɛmadonde fiili xungbee ma.<verse eid="ISA 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 30:24" />Ninge nun sofale naxee xɛ buxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:24">e fama se fanyi nan donde naxan nafalaxi e bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 30:25" />Xuree wuyama nɛ wo xa geyae fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:25">Na tɛmui faxɛ xungbe nan tima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:25">yire sɛnbɛma itexie rabirama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 30:26" />Alatala fama nɛ a xa ɲama xa maxɔnɛe nun fie rayalande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">Na lɔxɔɛ kike yanbama nɛ alɔ soge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:26">soge xa yanbɛ fan xun masama nɛ dɔxɔ solofere.<verse eid="ISA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 30:27" />Alatala na fafe kelife yire makuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">a xɔnɔxi a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, a fama nɛ tuuri belebele kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:27">Tɛ minima nɛ a kɛrɛ kui xɔnɛ xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 30:28" />A ɲɛngi luxi nɛ alɔ banbaranyi naxan tema han mixi kɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">A ɲamanɛe suxuma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">a karafoe sa e ma, a se nde raso e banganyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:28">a e xanin yire e mu wama sigafe dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 30:29" />Kɔnɔ wo tan bɛɛti bama nɛ na lɔxɔɛ alɔ sali tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">wo bɔɲɛe sɛɛwama nɛ alɔ mixi naxee xule fema sigafe ra Alatala xa geya fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:29">Alatala naxan luxi alɔ fanye Isirayila bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 30:30" />Alatala a xui xaaɲɛ raminima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:30">a a sɛnbɛ masenma nɛ xɔnɛ belebele nun tɛ kasarɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:30">A fama nɛ sesarinyi, galanyi, tunɛ xungbe, turunnaadɛ, nun balabalanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 30:31" />Alatala xui fama nɛ Asiriyakae butuxunde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:31">a e rabira a xa mangɛya ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 30:32" />A na e bɔnbɔ wuri xɔrɔxɔɛ ra tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:32">a xa ɲama bɛɛti bama nɛ maxasee nun kɔrae xui ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 30:33" />Tɛ yire bara yailan mangɛ xili ma a rakuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">A tilin, a igbo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">Yege gbegbe malanxi na tɛ belebele xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 30:33">Alatala ɲɛngi luxi nɛ alɔ tɛ ɲaaxi naxan ganma a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="ISA 31" />
  <para style="s">Misira xa mali</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 31:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">wo tan naxee wo yɛtɛ taxuma Misira ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">wo tan naxee lama e xa sɔɔri ragise wuyaxie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">wo tan naxee e xa soe ragimae matoma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">Wo mu Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:1">wo mu wama Alatala xa mali xɔn ma.<verse eid="ISA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 31:2" />Kɔnɔ Ala xaxili nan gbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">a fata ɲaxankatɛ ragorode mixie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">A xui mu kanama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">A kelima ɲama ɲaaxi xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:2">naxee mixi kobie malima.<verse eid="ISA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 31:3" />Misirakae mu findixi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">adamadie nan tun na e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">E xa soee mu findixi xaxili xa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">sube nan tun na e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">Alatala na keli tɛmui naxɛ mixie xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">naxan mali tima yo, naxan mali fenma yo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:3">a e birin halakima nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 31:4" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">«Yɛtɛ na yirindin a xa sube suxuxi xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">hali xuruse dɛmadonyi gbegbee katama nɛ a keride,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">a mu gaaxuma e xa sɔnxɔɛ rate ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">a mu kelima na sube xun ma fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:4">Alatala Sɛnbɛma fan goroma nɛ gere sode Siyoni geya fari na ki nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 31:5" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma Darisalamu makantama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">alɔ xɔni a gabutenyie italama a yɔrɛe xun ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:5">a e kanta, a e rakisi, a a ti e xun ma.»<verse eid="ISA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 31:6" />Isirayilakae, wo xa gbilen Ala ma wo bara wo makuya naxan na. <verse eid="ISA 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 31:7" />Na lɔxɔɛ wo fama nɛ wo xa kuyee rabɛɲinde wo naxee yailanxi gbeti nun xɛɛma ra yunubi xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 31:8" />«Asiriyakae fama nɛ sɔntɔde santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">naxan mu fatanxi ɲɛngi kanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:8">E e gima nɛ na ya ra, e xa fonikee xaninma nɛ konyiya kui.<verse eid="ISA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 31:9" />E xa yire makantaxi birama nɛ gaaxui kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">limaniya bama nɛ e xa sɔɔri mangɛe yi ra gere fa tɛmui.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 31:9">naxan na gere tɛ radɛxɛma Siyoni geya ma Darisalamu kui.<verse eid="ISA 31:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="ISA 32" />
  <para style="s">Mangɛya tinxinxi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 32:1" />Mangɛ fama nɛ mangɛya raɲɛrɛde tinxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:1">a xa kuntigie kiiti sama nɛ sɛriyɛ ki ma.<verse eid="ISA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 32:2" />Kankan luma nɛ alɔ banxi fanyi turunnaadɛ dinma naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">alɔ xure naxee ye xaninma gbengberen yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:2">alɔ gɛmɛ niini bɔxi ixaraxi ma.<verse eid="ISA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 32:3" />Na tɛmui ya naxee se fenma, nee se igbɛma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:3">Tuli naxee e matima, nee fe mɛma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 32:4" />Xaxilitaree fama nɛ fahaamui sɔtɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:4">boboe nɛnyi fama nɛ kelide, nee fa wɔyɛn a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 32:5" />Mixi kobi mu xilima kuntigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:5">mixi tinxintare mu binyɛ sɔtɔma sɔnɔn,<verse eid="ISA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 32:6" />barima e mu nɔndi falama, e mu fe fanyi maɲɔxunma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">A fe sɛniyɛnxi bɔtɛ rabama, a wule falama Alatala xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">a kaamɛtɔɛ luma a xa kaamɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:6">a tondi ye ma mixi bɛ, ye xɔli na naxan ma.<verse eid="ISA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 32:7" />Mixi ɲaaxi wali ki mu fan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:7">a a mato a misikiinɛ xun nakanama tɔɔɲɛgɛ ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 32:8" />Kɔnɔ mixi fanyi tan a matoma nɛ a fe fanyi rabama ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:8">a xun nakeli a xa wali fanyi saabui ra,<verse eid="ISA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 32:9" />Banna ginɛe, wo xa wo tuli mati n xui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:9">Wo tan naxee laxi wo yɛtɛ ra, wo xa n ma masenyi ramɛ.<verse eid="ISA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 32:10" />Beenun ɲɛ keren xa dangi, wo sɛrɛnma nɛ gaaxui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">wo tan naxee laxi wo yɛtɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">barima wɛni bogie kanama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:10">xɛ xabɛ fan mu fanma.<verse eid="ISA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 32:11" />Banna ginɛe, wo xa wo magoro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">wo tan naxee laxi wo yɛtɛ ra, wo xa gaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:11">Wo xa wo xa dugi fanyi masara kaaɲɛ dugi ra.<verse eid="ISA 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 32:12" />Wo xa wa wo xa wɛni bogi nun xɛ kanaxie xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 32:13" />Wo xa wa n ma ɲama xa bɔxi xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">naxan bara findi ɲooge nun tunbe yire ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:13">Wo xa wa wo xa taae xa fe ra ɲɛlɛxinyi ɲɔnxi dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 32:14" />Wo xa yire makantaxi raboloma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">wo xa taa fanyi findima nɛ wula ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:14">sofale nun xurusee dɛ madonma dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 32:15" />A luma na ki nɛ han Ala a Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ragoroma won ma tɛmui naxɛ keli koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">Na tɛmui na gbengberenyi findima nɛ sansi yire ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:15">a gbo yɛ alɔ fɔtɔnyi.<verse eid="ISA 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 32:16" />Sɛriyɛ raɲɛrɛma nɛ gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:16">tinxinyi fan sabatima nɛ sansi yire.<verse eid="ISA 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 32:17" />Tinxinyi xa wali findima bɔɲɛsa nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:17">a findi xaxilisa nun kantari ra waxati birin.<verse eid="ISA 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 32:18" />N ma ɲama luma nɛ naa bɔɲɛsa kui, maraxarɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 32:19" />Hali fɔtɔnyi kana, taa bira,<verse eid="ISA 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 32:20" />hɛɛri nan luma wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:20">wo tan naxee sansi sima xure dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 32:20">wo tan naxee tinma wo xa ningee nun wo xa sofalee xa e dɛ madon.<verse eid="ISA 32:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="ISA 33" />
  <para style="s">Gbaloe nun kisi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 33:1" />Ɲaxankatɛ na i bɛ, i tan naxan gbaloe rabama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">Ɲaxankatɛ na i bɛ, i tan naxan yanfɛ tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:1">I na gɛ na rabade, i xun fa rakana, yanfɛ gbilen i ma.<verse eid="ISA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 33:2" />Alatala hinnɛ muxu ra, muxu xaxili tixi i tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:2">I xa muxu sɛnbɛ xun masa, i xa muxu ratanga fe xɔrɔxɔɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 33:3" />Sie e gima nɛ i xui ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:3">ɲamanɛe yensenma nɛ i xa gere xui ra.<verse eid="ISA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 33:4" />Wo tan sie, mixie fama nɛ wo xa naafuli suxude,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:4">alɔ katoe dinma xɛ ra ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 33:5" />Wo tan Siyonikae, Alatala gbo, a sabatixi koore nan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:5">A tinxinyi nun nɔndi fima nɛ wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 33:6" />A wo bun ti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">A kisi, xaxili fanyi, nun fahaamui ragatama nɛ wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:6">wo tan naxee gaaxuma a ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 33:7" />Wo a mato, ɲalamae nun xɛɛrae na wafe tande.<verse eid="ISA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 33:8" />Mixi yo mu toma kirae ma sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:8">Saatɛ bara kana, saatɛ seedee bara yaagi, binyɛ yo mu na sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 33:9" />Bɔxi na sunnunyi nun halaki nan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">Liban xa mɛrɛ bara maxara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:9">Basan nun Karemele fɔtɔnyi burɛxɛe na yolonfe.<verse eid="ISA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 33:10" />Alatala naxɛ, «Yakɔsi n kelima nɛ fa, wo fa n matɔxɔ.<verse eid="ISA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 33:11" />Wo to natɛ fufafu tongo, wo man fe fufafu nan sɔtɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:11">Wo ɲɛngi luxi nɛ alɔ tɛ naxan fama wo gande.<verse eid="ISA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 33:12" />Tɛ dinma nɛ sie ra, e gan alɔ tunbe masɛgɛxi, sese mu lu.»<verse eid="ISA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 33:13" />Wo tan naxee makuya n na, wo xa wo tuli mati n ma fe rabaxie ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:13">Wo tan naxee makɔrɛ n na, wo xa la n sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 33:14" />Yunubitɔɛ naxee na Siyoni, e bara gaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">Alatala yaxuie bara sɛrɛn fɔlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">«Nde nɔma lude tɛ kasarati sɛɛti ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:14">Nde ratangama tɛ xubentare ma won ya ma?»<verse eid="ISA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 33:15" />Mixi nan a ra naxan ɲɛrɛma tinxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">naxan nɔndi falama, naxan tondima geeni sɔtɔ ki ɲaaxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">naxan mu a bɛlɛxɛ italama buɲa kobi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">naxan mu a tuli matima mixi faxafe natɛ tongoe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:15">naxan mu a xaxili tima fe ɲaaxi ra.<verse eid="ISA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 33:16" />Na mixi mɔɔli tan sabatima nɛ geya fari yire makantaxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:16">a baloe nun ye sɔtɔ a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 33:17" />Wo yae mangɛ toma nɛ a xa tofanyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:17">wo man fa bɔxi to naxan xa gboe mu ɲɔnma.<verse eid="ISA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 33:18" />Wo ratuma nɛ wo gaaxu ki ma, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:18">«Na mangɛ na minden? Duuti maxili go? Yire makantaxi xunmato go?»<verse eid="ISA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 33:19" />Wo mu fama na bɔnsɔɛ yɛtɛ igboe tode sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:19">naxee xa xui fahaamufe xɔrɔxɔ.<verse eid="ISA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 33:20" />Siyoni mato, won ma sali rabama dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">Mɛnni wo Darisalamu toma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:20">taa naxan naxaraxi, ɲama naxan mu talama e xɔnyi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 33:21" />Won Marigi Sɛnbɛma luma nɛ naa won ya ma xuree sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:21">Won yaxuie mu nɔma tide na xuree ma e xa kunkuie kui,<verse eid="ISA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 33:22" />barima Alatala nan na won ma kiitisa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">a sɛriyɛ yati nan fima won ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">Alatala nan na won ma Mangɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:22">a won natangama fe ɲaaxi nan ma.<verse eid="ISA 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 33:23" />Wo tan sie, wo xa luutie bara yɔntɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">wo xa kunkui wuri mu tixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">wo xa bɛla mu gɛxi italade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">Na kui wo xa naafuli fama nɛ xaninde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:23">hali mabɛnyie nɔma na rabade.<verse eid="ISA 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 33:24" />Siyonika yo mu a falama, «N mu yalanxi.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 33:24">E xa yunubie fama nɛ xafaride.<verse eid="ISA 33:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="ISA 34" />
  <para style="s">Edon xa kiiti</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 34:1" />Wo wo maso, wo tan ɲamanɛe, alako wo xa wo tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">Sie, wo xa wo tuli mati n na a fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:1">Duniɲa ɲama birin xa e tuli mati n ma masenyi ra,<verse eid="ISA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 34:2" />barima Alatala xɔnɔxi ɲamanɛ nun e xa sɔɔri gaali birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:2">A fama nɛ dinde e ra, a e ratɔn.<verse eid="ISA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 34:3" />E xa mixi faxaxie mu ragatama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:3">E binbie bɔrɔma nɛ, e xiri fa te koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:3">E wuli ifilima nɛ geyae ma.<verse eid="ISA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 34:4" />Hali tunbui naxee na koore ma, e birama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">alɔ burɛxɛe nun xɔrɛe birama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:4">Koore walaxɛ makuntanma nɛ alɔ dagi.<verse eid="ISA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 34:5" />Alatala naxɛ, «N ma santidɛgɛma na gɛ na wali ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">a goroma nɛ Edon ɲama xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:5">n fa e sɔntɔ kiiti xa fe ra.»<verse eid="ISA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 34:6" />Wuli na Alatala xa santidɛgɛma ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">A bara gɛ sɛrɛxɛ kɔn naxabade a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">xurusee wuli nun ture na a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">Alatala na sɛrɛxɛ nde kɔn naxabafe Bosara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:6">a na faxɛ tife a ɲaaxi ra Edon bɔxi ma.<verse eid="ISA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 34:7" />Ɲama sɔntɔma nɛ, sɛxɛ ningee nun tuurae fan faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:7">han bɔxi yati bara nɔxɔ na wuli birin na.<verse eid="ISA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 34:8" />Alatala xa natɛ nan na ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:8">alako Siyoni gbe xa ɲɔxɔ Edon xa yaxuya xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 34:9" />Edon xa xuree nun bɔxi luma nɛ alɔ dole, a fa lu gan na.<verse eid="ISA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 34:10" />A mu xubenma kɔɛ nun yanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">a tuuri luma nɛ te ra tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">Mɛnni findima gbengberenyi yire nan na abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:10">mixi yo mu dangima naa sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 34:11" />Xɔni nun wulai sube mɔɔli birin luma nɛ naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:11">Alatala bara natɛ tongo mɛnni xa findi gbengberen yire ra.<verse eid="ISA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 34:12" />Mɛnni mangɛ mu sese toma naa e yamarima rabama naxan xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:12">e xa kuntigie yensenma nɛ feo.<verse eid="ISA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 34:13" />Mɛnni xa yire makantaxie findima tunbee yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:13">e xa taae luma nɛ alɔ wulai, wule baree nun xɔnie luma dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 34:14" />Wulai subee mɔɔli birin sabatima naa,<verse eid="ISA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 34:15" />Bɔximase a xalɛ sama nɛ naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">a fa e rasɛgɛ, a e kanta.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:15">Hali yubɛe sabatima mɛnni nɛ, e fa die rasɛgɛ.<verse eid="ISA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 34:16" />Alatala xa sɛbɛli mato a fanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">Yi sube birin fama nɛ lude naa, e fa wuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:16">Alatala bara na natɛ tongo, a Xaxili yati fama nɛ na rakamalide.<verse eid="ISA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 34:17" />A tan nan yati e xa fe matoma, a na bɔxi itaxun e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 34:17">a fa findi e gbe ra abadan.<verse eid="ISA 34:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="ISA 35" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa kira</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 35:1" />Ɲɛlɛxinyi xa lu gbengberen yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:1">sɛɛwɛ xa lu wulai alɔ sansi fugaxie yire.<verse eid="ISA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 35:2" />Sansi tofanyie xa lu naa, sɛɛwɛ xui xa ite.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">A xa lu alɔ Liban fɔtɔnyi, a xa tofan alɔ Karemele geya nun Sarɔn yire.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:2">Won Marigi Alatala xa nɔrɛ toma nɛ naa a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 35:3" />Wo tan naxee bara gaaxu han wo bɛlɛxɛ mu se suxuma, wo xinbi fa sɛrɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:3">wo sɛnbɛ xa so.<verse eid="ISA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 35:4" />Wo a fala mixie bɛ naxee bara gaaxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">«Wo xa limaniya, hali wo mu gaaxu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">Wo Marigi Ala bara fa wo gbe ɲɔxɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:4">A fama wo rakiside a sɛnbɛ ra.»<verse eid="ISA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 35:5" />Na tɛmui, dɔnxuie ya rabɔɔma nɛ, tulixɔrie fe mɛma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 35:6" />Mabɛnyie tuganma nɛ alɔ xeli, boboe fan sɛɛwɛ xui raminima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:6">barima xuree minima nɛ gbengberenyi ma.<verse eid="ISA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 35:7" />Bɔxi maxaraxi mafindima nɛ baa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">dulonyi minima nɛ gbengberen yire.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:7">Wulai baree xɔnyi bara findi ye yire ra.<verse eid="ISA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 35:8" />Kira mabama naa naxan xili falama, «Kira Sɛniyɛnxi.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">Mixi sɛniyɛntare mu dangima mɛnni, fo naxan lanma a xa dangi na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:8">Xaxilitaree mu tima na kira xɔn ma.<verse eid="ISA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 35:9" />Yɛtɛe nun burunyi sube mu toma naa, fo lasiri mixi.<verse eid="ISA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 35:10" />Alatala naxee xɔrɛyaxi, nee nan gbilenma e xɔnyi na kira xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">E soma nɛ Siyoni sɛɛwɛ ra naxan mu ɲɔnma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">E ɲɛlɛxinma nɛ tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 35:10">Sunnunyi nun tɔɔrɛ bama nɛ e ma abadan.<verse eid="ISA 35:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="ISA 36" />
  <para style="s">Asiriya mangɛ xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 36:1" />Mangɛ Xesekiya xa mangɛya ɲɛ fu nun naani nde ra, Asiriya mangɛ Senaxeribi naxa nɔ Yudaya taa sɛnbɛmae ra. <verse eid="ISA 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 36:2" />A to gɛ na rabade, Asiriya mangɛ naxa a xa sɔɔri mangɛ xɛɛ Darisalamu mangɛ xɔn ma, kelife ra Lakisi, a tan nun a xa sɔɔri sɛnbɛmae. E naxa ti ye yire xungbe fɛ ma, mixie nu garɛ soma dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="ISA 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 36:3" />Xilikiya xa di Eliyakimi, mangɛ xa banxi xunyi, mangɛ xa sɛbɛliti Sebena, nun Asafi xa di Yowa, naxan findixi mangɛ xa kɛɛdi ragatɛ ra, nee naxa mini Asiriyakae ralande.<verse eid="ISA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 36:4" />Asiriya mangɛ rasima singe naxa yi masenyi ti e bɛ, «Wo a fala Xesekiya bɛ, Asiriya mangɛ xungbe yi nan masenxi, ‹I xaxili tixi munse ra? <verse eid="ISA 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 36:5" />I wɔyɛn fufafu nan tun falaxi! I ɲɔxɔ a ma i bara fɛɛrɛ nun sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ n gerefe ra? I laxi nde ra, naxan a niyama i xa n matandi? <verse eid="ISA 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 36:6" />I i xa lanlanteya saxi Misirakae nan ma fa? E luxi alɔ wuri ponpoe naxan girama, a fa i sɔxɔ i kilɔnma a ra tɛmui naxɛ. Misira mangɛ Firawuna na na ki nɛ mixi birin bɛ, naxee e xaxili tixi a ra. <verse eid="ISA 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 36:7" />Tɛmunde wo n yaabima nɛ, «Muxu xaxili tixi muxu Marigi Alatala nan na.» Kɔnɔ n xa a fala wo bɛ Xesekiya bara gɛ sɛrɛxɛbadee kanade geyae fari, a fa a fala Yudayakae nun Darisalamukae bɛ, «Wo Alatala batu Darisalamu xa sɛrɛxɛbade gbansan nɛ.»›»<verse eid="ISA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 36:8" />«Xa i sa nɔma soe ragi wulu firin sɔtɔde i xa ɲama ya ma, n marigi Asiriya mangɛ soe fima nɛ i ma, e naxee ragima. <verse eid="ISA 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 36:9" />Hali i i xaxili ti Misirakae ra, soe ragie nun gisee xa fe ra, i sɛnbɛ xurun n ma mangɛ xa mixi xuri di nde nɔfe ra. <verse eid="ISA 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 36:10" />Bafe na ra, wo Marigi Alatala xa mu waxi n xa be gere? Alatala nan a falaxi n bɛ, ‹Siga, i na bɔxi kana.›»<verse eid="ISA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 36:11" />Na tɛmui Eliyakimi, Sebena, nun Yowa naxa a fala Asiriya mangɛ rasima bɛ, «Yandi, i xa wɔyɛn muxu bɛ Arami xui ra, muxu tan i xa konyie na xui fahaamuma. I naxa wɔyɛn muxu bɛ Yuda xui ra ɲama ya xɔri naxan na tɛtɛ fari ma.» <verse eid="ISA 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 36:12" />Kɔnɔ Asiriya mangɛ rasima naxa e yaabi, «N marigi n xɛɛxi yi masenyi falade i xa mangɛ nun i tan nan gbansan bɛ? N mu wɔyɛnfe yi mixie fan xa bɛ, naxee dɔxɔxi tɛtɛ fari yi ki, naxee fama e yɛtɛ xa gbi fuxi donde nun e yɛtɛ xɔli minde nun wo tan na?»<verse eid="ISA 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 36:13" />Mangɛ rasima naxa keli, a a fala a xui itexi ra Yudaya xui ra, a naxɛ, «Wo wo tuli mati Asiriya mangɛ xungbe xa masenyi ra, <verse eid="ISA 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 36:14" />‹Wo naxa tin Xesekiya xa wo madaxu, barima a mu fata wo ratangade n bɛlɛxɛ i! <verse eid="ISA 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 36:15" />Wo naxa tin a xa wo madaxu wo xaxili tife Alatala ra, a falafe ra, «Alatala muxu rakisima nɛ, yi taa mu luma Asiriyakae xa mangɛ sagoe.» <verse eid="ISA 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 36:16" />Wo naxa wo tuli mati Xesekiya ra de! Asiriya mangɛ yi nan falaxi, «Xa wo tin lude n ma yaamari bun ma, kankan fama nɛ a xa xɛɛ bogisee donde, kankan a xa kɔlɔnyi ye min, <verse eid="ISA 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 36:17" />han n sa fama wo xaninde bɔxi nde ma tɛmui naxɛ, naxan luxi alɔ wo xa bɔxi, mɛngi nun wɛni fanyi, taami nun wɛni xɛe na dɛnnaxɛ.» <verse eid="ISA 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 36:18" />Wo naxa wo tuli mati Xesekiya ra, naxan wama wo madaxufe a falafe ra, «Marigi Alatala won nakisima nɛ.» Si gbɛtɛe xa alae nɔ nɛ e xa mixie bade Asiriya mangɛ bɛlɛxɛ i? <verse eid="ISA 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 36:19" />Xamata nun Arapadi xa alae go? Sefarawayimi, Hena nun Iwa xa alae go? Nee bara Samari ba n bɛlɛxɛ i? <verse eid="ISA 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 36:20" />Ɲamanɛe birin xa alae ya ma, ala mundun a xa mixie rakisixi n bɛlɛxɛ i? Alatala tan nɔma Darisalamu ratangade n ma?›»<verse eid="ISA 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 36:21" />Ɲama naxa dundu, e mu a yaabi, barima mangɛ a fala nɛ, «Wo naxa a yaabi de.» <verse eid="ISA 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 36:22" />Xilikiya xa di Eliyakimi, mangɛ xa banxi xunyi, Sebena sɛbɛliti, nun Asafi xa di Yowa kɛɛdi ragatɛ, nee naxa siga mangɛ Xesekiya yire e xa sosee ibɔɔxi ra e ma sunnunyi kui, e fa Asiriya mangɛ rasima xa masenyi dɛntɛgɛ a bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 36:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="ISA 37" />
  <para style="s">Mangɛ Xesekiya marasi fenfe Annabi Esayi ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 37:1" />Mangɛ Xesekiya to na fe mɛ, a naxa a xa donma ibɔɔ a ma, a bɛki dugi ragoro a ma sunnunyi kui, a fa siga Alatala xa banxi kui. <verse eid="ISA 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 37:2" />A naxa a xa banxi xunyi Eliyakimi, a xa sɛbɛliti Sebena, nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛ forie xɛɛ Amosu xa di Annabi Esayi xɔn, bɛki dugi ragoroxi e ma. <verse eid="ISA 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 37:3" />E naxa a fala a bɛ, Xesekiya yi nan falaxi, «To findixi sunnunyi, ɲaxankatɛ, nun bɔɲɛ maɲaaxu lɔxɔɛ nan na. A luxi alɔ die bari tɛmui bara a li, kɔnɔ sɛnbɛ mu na sɔnɔn e xa bari. <verse eid="ISA 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 37:4" />I Marigi Alatala na Asiriya mangɛ xa xɛɛra xa masenyi mɛ Ala ɲiɲɛ rasɔtɔfe ra, tɛmunde a a ɲaxankatama nɛ a xa na wɔyɛnyie ma. I xa Ala maxandi alako won ma mixi dɔnxɔɛe naxa faxa.»<verse eid="ISA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 37:5" />Mangɛ Xesekiya xa mixie naxa siga Annabi Esayi yire. <verse eid="ISA 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 37:6" />Esayi naxa a masen e bɛ, «Wo a fala wo xa mangɛ bɛ, Alatala yi masenyi nan tixi, ‹I naxa gaaxu Asiriya mangɛ xa xɛɛrae xa marasɔtɔɛe xa fe ra, a naxee falaxi n bɛ. <verse eid="ISA 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 37:7" />N fama a xaxili mafindide xibaarui nde ra, a fa gbilen a xɔnyi. N a faxama santidɛgɛma ra mɛnni nɛ.›»<verse eid="ISA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 37:8" />Mangɛ xa xɛɛra to gbilen Asiriya mangɛ yire, a naxa a li a xa mangɛ nu bara keli Lakisi, a nu na Libina gerefe. <verse eid="ISA 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 37:9" />Na tɛmui Asiriya mangɛ naxa a kolon a Kusi mangɛ Tirihaka na fafe a gerede. Na kui a man naxa xɛɛrae xɛɛ Xesekiya ma, a falafe ra, <verse eid="ISA 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 37:10" />«Wo a fala Yudaya mangɛ Xesekiya bɛ, ‹I xa ala, i laxi naxan na, na naxa i madaxu de a falafe ra, «Darisalamu mu luma Asiriya mangɛ bɛlɛxɛ i.» <verse eid="ISA 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 37:11" />I a kolon a fanyi ra Asiriya mangɛe naxan nabaxi ɲamanɛe birin na. E e sɔntɔ nɛ a ɲaaxi ra. I tan fa fama i bade n yi ra di? <verse eid="ISA 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 37:12" />N benbae si naxee bɔnbɔ, e xa alae e ratanga nɛ, alɔ Gosan, Xarani, Resefa, nun Eden bɔnsɔɛ naxee na Teli Asari? <verse eid="ISA 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 37:13" />Xamata mangɛ, Arapadi mangɛ, Sefarawayimi mangɛ, Hena mangɛ, nun Iwa mangɛ na minden?›»<verse eid="ISA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 37:14" />Xesekiya naxa bataaxɛ rasuxu xɛɛrae yi ra, a naxa a xaran. Na dangi xanbi, a naxa te Alatala xa banxi, a a itala Alatala ya i. <verse eid="ISA 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 37:15" />Xesekiya naxa Alatala maxandi, a naxɛ, <verse eid="ISA 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 37:16" />«Isirayila Marigi Alatala, naxan magoroxi malekɛe tagi, i tan nan na duniɲa birin Marigi ra, i tan nan koore nun bɔxi daaxi. <verse eid="ISA 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 37:17" />Alatala, i i tuli mati a fanyi ra, i xa Senaxeribi xa masenyi ramɛ, naxan a xa mixi xɛɛxi Ala Ɲiɲɛ rasɔtɔde. <verse eid="ISA 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 37:18" />Alatala, nɔndi na a ra, Asiriya mangɛe bara si birin sɔntɔ, a e xa fe xun nakana. <verse eid="ISA 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 37:19" />E naxa nee xa alae woli tɛ i, e e kana. A nɔndi ki ma, na kuyee mu findixi Ala ra, barima ibunadama nan nee yailanxi wuri nun gɛmɛ ra. <verse eid="ISA 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 37:20" />Yandi, muxu Marigi Alatala, i xa muxu ratanga Senaxeribi ma, alako duniɲa birin xa a kolon, a i tan nan keren na Ala ra.»<verse eid="ISA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 37:21" />Awa, Amosu xa di Annabi Esayi naxa xɛɛra xɛɛ mangɛ Xesekiya ma, a naxɛ, «Isirayila Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, ‹N bara i xa maxandi suxu i naxan tixi Asiriya mangɛ Senaxeribi xa fe ra. <verse eid="ISA 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 37:22" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya a xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">Siyoni taa fama nɛ yode i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:22">Darisalamu tofanyi fa i maberede.<verse eid="ISA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 37:23" />I nde konbixi, i nde maberexi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">I sɔnxɔxi nde ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:23">I bara i yɛtɛ igbo Isirayila Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 37:24" />I xa xɛɛrae bara Marigi rasɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">I bara a fala, «N tan bara te han Liban geyae fari n ma gisee kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">N sɛdiri wuri itexie fɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:24">n sipirɛ wuri tofanyie sɛgɛ fɔtɔnyi dɛɲɛxi kui.<verse eid="ISA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 37:25" />N tigie ge ɲamanɛe ma, n e ye min.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:25">N Nili xure sɛnkinɛe birin xɔrima nɛ n sanyie ra.»›»<verse eid="ISA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 37:26" />Alatala naxɛ, «I mu a mɛxi ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">n bara yi fee natɛ nu a rakuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">kafi n i daa tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">N fa na e rabafe nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:26">I tan findixi taa sɛnbɛmae sɔntɔma nan tun na,<verse eid="ISA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 37:27" />na taa mixie sɛnbɛ mu na e xa ti wo kanke.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">Gaaxui nun yaagi nan tun e sɔtɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">E luma nɛ alɔ ɲooge xare, alɔ sɛxɛ naxan na banxi kɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:27">alɔ mɛngi bili naxan xarama beenun a xa bogi.<verse eid="ISA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 37:28" />Kɔnɔ n i dɔxɔ tɛmui, i mini tɛmui sigafe ra gere sode, i fa tɛmui, n na birin kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:28">I man na n matandi, n na fan kolon.<verse eid="ISA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 37:29" />I to bara n matandi na ki, i i yɛtɛ igbo n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">n na n ma xurundɛ gbakuma nɛ i ɲɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">n na n ma karafoe sɔti i dɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:29">n i ragbilen i kelide.»<verse eid="ISA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 37:30" />Alatala naxɛ, «Xesekiya, tɔnxuma nan ya i bɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">Toofare wo sansi xɔri yolonxi nan donma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">Tamuna wo sansi bali nan donma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">Kɔnɔ tamuna boore, wo sansie nan donma wo naxee sima wo e xaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:30">wo wɛni min naxan kelima wɛni bilie ma, wo naxee sima.<verse eid="ISA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 37:31" />Yuda bɔnsɔɛe naxee kisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:31">nee luma nɛ alɔ wuri bili</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:31">naxan sanke na bɔxi bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:31">a fa a bogi ramini.<verse eid="ISA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ISA 37:32" />Barima mixi ndee ratangama nɛ faxɛ ma Darisalamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:32">Siyoni mixi ndee kisima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:32">Alatala Sɛnbɛma a mafurama nɛ na birin nabade.»<verse eid="ISA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ISA 37:33" />Na kui, Alatala yi masenyi nan tixi Asiriya mangɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">«A mu soma yi taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">a mu xali yo wolima be,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">a mu tima wo kanke a xa wure lefa ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:33">a mu bɛndɛ matema tuganfe ra wo xa tɛtɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ISA 37:34" />A gbilenma a fa kira nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:34">a mu soma yi taa kui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:34">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ISA 37:35" />N yi taa makantama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 37:35">n a rakisima nɛ n xili nun n ma konyi Dawuda xa fe ra.»<verse eid="ISA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ISA 37:36" />Na kɔɛ ra Alatala xa malekɛ naxa mini, a sa Asiriyaka wulu kɛmɛ tongo solomasaxan nun suuli faxa. A dɔnxɔɛe to keli gɛɛsɛgɛ, e naxa na furee to e ya ma. <verse eid="ISA 37:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ISA 37:37" />Na kui, Asiriya mangɛ Senaxeribi naxa gbilen a xɔnyi Ninewe. <verse eid="ISA 37:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ISA 37:38" />Lɔxɔɛ nde, a to nu na salife a xa ala Nisiri xa banxi kui, Adarameleki nun Sareseri naxa a faxa santidɛgɛma ra, e e gi Ararati bɔxi ma. Esarixadoni naxa ti mangɛ ra a baba Senaxeribi ɲɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 37:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="ISA 38" />
  <para style="s">Xesekiya xa yalanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 38:1" />Na lɔxɔɛe mangɛ Xesekiya naxa fura a ɲaaxi ra. A gbe mu nu luxi a xa faxa. Amosu xa di Annabi Esayi naxa siga a yire, a a fala a bɛ, Alatala yi nan masenxi, «I xa yaamarie fi i xa mixie ma, barima i na faxafe nɛ yi ki, i mu kisima yi fure ma.» <verse eid="ISA 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 38:2" />Xesekiya naxa a yatagi mafindi banxi xalɛ ma, a Alatala maxandi, a naxɛ, <verse eid="ISA 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 38:3" />«Alatala, yandi hinnɛ n na, i a kolon n nan ɲɛrɛxi nɛ kira tinxinxi nan xɔn ma n ma duniɲɛigiri kui n bɔɲɛ fiixɛ ra. N mu i matandi, n mu gbilen i waxɔnfe fɔxɔ ra.» Xesekiya naxa wa ki fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 38:4" />Annabi Esayi mu nu gɛxi minide mangɛ banxi tɛtɛ kui, Alatala man naxa a masen a bɛ, a naxɛ, <verse eid="ISA 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 38:5" />«Gbilen i xa sa a fala n ma ɲama yarerati Xesekiya bɛ, i benba Dawuda Marigi Alatala yi nan masenxi, ‹N bara i xa maxandi mɛ, n bara i yaye to. N i yalanma nɛ, a xi saxan nde. N ɲɛ fu nun suuli sama nɛ i xa simaya xun ma. <verse eid="ISA 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 38:6" />N i tan nun yi taa ratangama nɛ Asiriya mangɛ ma. N yi taa makantama nɛ n ma konyi Dawuda xa fe ra.›»<verse eid="ISA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 38:7" />Annabi Esayi naxa a yaabi, «Yi nan findima Alatala xa tɔnxuma ra i bɛ, alako i xa a kolon a Alatala a xa masenyi rakamalima nɛ. <verse eid="ISA 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 38:8" />Ala naxɛ, ‹N a niyama nɛ soge niini xa gbilen a xanbi xanbi ma dɔxɔ fu Axasi tede ma.›» Na tɛmui, soge niini naxa magbilen a xanbi xanbi ma dɔxɔ fu a goroxi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 38:9" />Yudaya mangɛ Xesekiya xa bɛɛti nan ya, a naxan sɛbɛxi a to yalan a xa fure ma:<verse eid="ISA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 38:10" />N nu a fala nɛ nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:10">«A lanma n xa laaxira yi waxati fanyi n ma duniɲɛigiri kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:10">N ma simaya xa dunke na ki?»<verse eid="ISA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 38:11" />N man nu a fala nɛ nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">«N mu Alatala toma yi duniɲa ma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:11">n man mu ibunadama yo toma fa naxan sabatixi yi bɛndɛ fuɲi fari.<verse eid="ISA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 38:12" />N ma lingira bara tongo n xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">alɔ xuruse kantɛ xa leele italama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">N ma simaya na mafilinfe alɔ mabɔɛ xa gɛsɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">Mabɔɛ na gɛ gɛsɛ sɔxɔde, a dɔnxɔɛ naxan luxi, a na xaba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:12">Alatala, i tan fan, beenun nunmare xa so, i bara n ma simaya raɲɔn.<verse eid="ISA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 38:13" />N naxa mamɛ ti han gɛɛsɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">kɔnɔ i bara n xɔrie igira alɔ yɛtɛ a rabama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:13">Beenun kɔɛ xa so, i bara dan ti n ma simaya ma.<verse eid="ISA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 38:14" />N nu n xui xurudi raminima nɛ alɔ debelin xɔni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">n nu wama nɛ alɔ ganbɛ sunnunxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">N nu n ya rate koore ma, n nu fa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:14">‹N Marigi n na tɔɔrɔfe, i xa n mali.›»<verse eid="ISA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 38:15" />«N nɔma na tagi rabade di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">A tan yati bara n yaabi, a fa n ma duba suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:15">Na kui n fama n ɲɛrɛde yɛtɛ magore nan kui n ma simaya birin na.<verse eid="ISA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 38:16" />N Marigi, ibunadama kisima na ki nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">N ɲɛngife to na nan ma.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 38:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:16">«I tan bara n ma yalanyi ragbilen n ma, n xa kisi.<verse eid="ISA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 38:17" />I bara n mali na tɔɔrɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">I xa xanunteya bara n natanga faxɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:17">i bara n ma yunubie birin woli i kobe ra.<verse eid="ISA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 38:18" />I a kolon a n ma gaburi mu findima matɔxɔɛ ra i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">saya mu i matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">faxa mixie fan mu i tantuma bɛɛti ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">Naxee goroma gaburi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:18">nee xaxili mu tixi i xa hinnɛ ra sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 38:19" />Mixi ɲiɲɛ nan i matɔxɔma, alɔ n na i matɔxɔfe ki naxɛ to lɔxɔɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:19">Babae masenyi tima e xa die bɛ i xa hinnɛ xa fe ra.»<verse eid="ISA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 38:20" />Alatala bara n nakisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:20">Won xa bɛɛti ba a bɛ kɔrae ra a xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 38:20">Won xa lu na raba ra won ma simaya birin na.<verse eid="ISA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 38:21" />Annabi Esayi nu bara a fala, a e xa fa xɔrɛ bogi yailan, e a fatu mangɛ Xesekiya xa fi ma, alako a xa yalan. <verse eid="ISA 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 38:22" />Xesekiya nu bara a yaabi, «Tɔnxuma mundun a niyama n xa a kolon n man nɔma tede Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi?»<verse eid="ISA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="ISA 39" />
  <para style="s">Xesekiya Babilɔn mangɛ xa xɛɛrae rasɛnɛfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 39:1" />Na tɛmui Babilɔn mangɛ Merodaki Baladan naxa bataaxɛ nun buɲa rasanba Xesekiya ma, barima a nu bara Xesekiya furafe nun a yalanfe mɛ. <verse eid="ISA 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 39:2" />Xesekiya naxa na xɛɛrae rasɛnɛ, a a xa naafuli birin masen e bɛ, alɔ gbeti, xɛɛma, surayi, labundɛ nun ture xiri ɲɔxunmɛ, a xa geresose ragatade nun a xa bannaya birin na dɛnnaxɛ. Sese mu lu, Xesekiya mu naxan masen e bɛ a xa banxi nun a xa bɔxi kui. <verse eid="ISA 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 39:3" />Na dangi xanbi, Annabi Esayi naxa fa Xesekiya yire, a a maxɔrin, «Na mixie munse falaxi i bɛ? E kelixi minden?» Xesekiya naxa a yaabi, «E kelixi bɔxi makuye nde nɛ, dɛnnaxɛ xili Babilɔn.» <verse eid="ISA 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 39:4" />Esayi man naxa a maxɔrin, «E munse matoxi i xa banxi kui?» Xesekiya naxa a yaabi, «Se naxan birin na n ma banxi kui. Sese mu luxi n xɔnyi n mu naxan masenxi e bɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 39:5" />Na kui, Annabi Esayi naxa a fala Xesekiya bɛ, «I tuli mati Alatala xa masenyi ra, <verse eid="ISA 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 39:6" />‹Lɔxɔɛ na fafe, yi mixie fama nɛ i harige birin xaninde Babilɔn, i benbae naxan luxi i yi ra. Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki. <verse eid="ISA 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 39:7" />E fama nɛ i xa die suxude, i naxee barixi, e e bana Babilɔn mangɛ bɛ.›» <verse eid="ISA 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 39:8" />Xesekiya naxa a fala Esayi bɛ, «Alatala xa masenyi i naxan tixi, a fan.» A na fala nɛ barima a naxɛ, «Bɔɲɛsa nun kantari tan luma nɛ be, n ma simaya birin kui.»<verse eid="ISA 39:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="ISA 40" />
  <para style="s">Ala a xa ɲama xunsarafe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 40:1" />Ala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:1">«Wo xa n ma ɲama madundu e xa tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 40:2" />Wo xa a fala Darisalamu bɛ a a xa ɲaxankatɛ bara ɲɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">a xa yunubie sare bara gɛ fide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:2">a Alatala bara na ragbilen a ma han dɔxɔ firin.»<verse eid="ISA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 40:3" />Mixi nde na a xui raminife gbengberen yire a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:3">«Wo xa kira yailan Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:3">wo sankira matinxin wo Marigi ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 40:4" />Gulunba xa ite, geya xa igoro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:4">kira ɲaaxi xa yailan a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 40:5" />Alatala xa nɔrɛ makɛnɛnma nɛ daali birin ya xɔri.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:5">Alatala xa masenyi yati nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 40:6" />Mixi nde bara a fala n bɛ, «I xui rate.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">N bara a yaabi, «N xa munse fala?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:6">A naxɛ, «Adama xa nɔrɛ luxi nɛ alɔ sansie.<verse eid="ISA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 40:7" />E lisima nɛ, Alatala xa foye e fuge kana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:7">Adamadie maniyaxi sansie nan na.<verse eid="ISA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 40:8" />Sansie xarama nɛ, e fuge kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:8">kɔnɔ Alatala tan xa masenyi mu kanama abadan.»<verse eid="ISA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 40:9" />Siyoni, i xa te geya itexi nde fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">Darisalamu, i xa i xui ite sɛnbɛ ra limaniya kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:9">A fala Yudaya taae bɛ, «Wo Marigi Ala na be.»<verse eid="ISA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 40:10" />Marigi Alatala na fafe sɛnbɛ ra, nɔɛ xanxi a bɛlɛxɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:10">Xunnakeli na a bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 40:11" />A mɛɛnima nɛ a xa xurusee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">a a xa yɛxɛ yɔrɛe tongoma nɛ, a e sa a kanke ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:11">a e ngae ragbɛngbɛn.<verse eid="ISA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 40:12" />Nde baa ye maniyaxi a bɛlɛxɛ kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">Nde koore walaxɛ maniyaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">Nde duniɲa bɛndɛ maniyaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:12">Nde geyae dɔxɔxi sikeeli ra?<verse eid="ISA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 40:13" />Nde Alatala Xaxili kolon?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:13">Nde nɔma marasi fide a ma?<verse eid="ISA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 40:14" />Nde a yamarima? Nde a matinkanma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Nde fe kolonyi masenma a bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:14">Nde a masenma a bɛ se yailanma ki naxɛ?<verse eid="ISA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 40:15" />Ɲamanɛe luxi nɛ a bɛ alɔ se xunxurie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:15">A e rakelima nɛ a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 40:16" />Liban sube birin nalanxi mu sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi lima naxan daxa a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:16">Liban fɔtɔnyi belebele mu yege lima a xa sɛrɛxɛ ganfe ra.<verse eid="ISA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 40:17" />Sese mu ɲamanɛe ra a ya i, e findixi a bɛ fe fufafu nan na.<verse eid="ISA 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 40:18" />Wo wama Ala maniyafe nde ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:18">Wo a misaalima munse ra?<verse eid="ISA 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 40:19" />Yirawali kuye nan masolima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">xabui xɛɛma radin a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:19">a fa gbeti yɔlɔnxɔnyie yailan a kuye gbakuma naxan na.<verse eid="ISA 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 40:20" />Setaree wuri nde nan fenma naxan mu kanama mafuren mafuren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:20">a mixi fen naxan fata a masolide alako a naxa bira.<verse eid="ISA 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 40:21" />Wo mu a kolon? Wo mu na fe mɛxi kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:21">Wo mu na fahaamuxi kabi duniɲa daa tɛmui?<verse eid="ISA 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 40:22" />A tan nan sabatixi duniɲa birin xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">Duniɲa mixie luxi nɛ a bɛ alɔ katoee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:22">A tan koore walaxɛ italaxi nɛ alɔ dugi naxan sama leele ma.<verse eid="ISA 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 40:23" />A tan nan mangɛe xun nakanama, a mixi xungbee xa fe magoro.<verse eid="ISA 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 40:24" />E luxi nɛ alɔ sansi naxan si to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">kɔnɔ beenu e xa mɔ, a fa wuyenyi radin e ma naxan e xarama gben.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:24">Na tɛmui foye xungbe e xaninma nɛ alɔ sɛxɛ xare.<verse eid="ISA 40:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 40:25" />Ala Sɛniyɛntɔɛ xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:25">«Wo n tan Ala maniyama nde ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:25">N misaalixi nde bɛ?<verse eid="ISA 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 40:26" />Wo wo yae rakeli koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Nde na se yanbaxie daaxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">Ala nan e yamarima, a e xilie kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:26">A sɛnbɛ xa saabui ra, sese mu luxi e ma.»<verse eid="ISA 40:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 40:27" />«Na kui, wo tan n ma ɲama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">naxan fatanxi Yaxuba ra, naxan findixi Isirayila ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">munfe ra wo a falama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">‹Alatala mu fe toxi naxan dɔxɔxi muxu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:27">Muxu Marigi Alatala mu wama muxu gbe ɲɔxɔfe.›<verse eid="ISA 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 40:28" />Wo mu a kolon? Wo mu na fe mɛxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">Alatala findixi Ala nan na kabi abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">a duniɲa yati nan daaxi a fɔlɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:28">A mu taganma, danyi mu na a xaxili ma.<verse eid="ISA 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 40:29" />A sɛnbɛ fima nɛ mixi taganxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:29">a limaniya fi sɛnbɛtaree ma.<verse eid="ISA 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ISA 40:30" />Hali dimɛdie e taganma, sɛgɛtalae birama,<verse eid="ISA 40:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ISA 40:31" />kɔnɔ naxee e xaxili tima Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">nee sɛnbɛ nɛɛnɛ sɔtɔma nɛ, e fa tugan alɔ sɛgɛe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 40:31">E e ɲɛrɛ, e e gi, e mu taganma fefe ma.»<verse eid="ISA 40:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="ISA 41" />
  <para style="s">Ala nan na Isirayila xa mali ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 41:1" />«Ɲamanɛe, wo wo sabari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">Si yensenxie, wo limaniya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:1">wo xa wo maso n ma kiiti yire ra.»<verse eid="ISA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 41:2" />«Nde mixi tixi kira xɔn ma keli sogetede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">wo xa kiiti sama naxan xili ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">Nde ɲamanɛe saxi a sagoe, a mangɛe xa fe igoro a bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:2">A xa santidɛgɛma e xun nakanama nɛ, a xa xali e rayensen yɛ.<verse eid="ISA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 41:3" />A e kerima nɛ sɛnbɛ ra, a man siga yire gbɛtɛ na rabade.<verse eid="ISA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 41:4" />Nde na fee ragirixi a xa yaamari ra kabi duniɲa fɔlɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">N tan Alatala, naxan na fe fɔlɛ nun fe raɲɔnyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:4">n tan bara na mɔɔli birin nagiri.»<verse eid="ISA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 41:5" />«Ɲamanɛe gaaxuma nɛ na birin ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:5">sie sɛrɛn gaaxui ra duniɲa birin.<verse eid="ISA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 41:6" />E limaniya fima e bore ma, a falafe ra, ‹Wo wo sɛnbɛ so!›<verse eid="ISA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 41:7" />Yirawalie e bore malima alako xɛɛma xa sa kuye ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">E naxɛ, ‹A fan na ki nɛ.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:7">E kuye banbanma lantumae ra alako a naxa fa bira.»<verse eid="ISA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 41:8" />«Kɔnɔ wo tan Isirayila findixi n ma konyi nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">N wo tan Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ nan sugandixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:8">naxan fatanxi n xanuntenyi Iburahima bɔnsɔɛ.<verse eid="ISA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 41:9" />N wo tongoxi duniɲa tunxunyie nan na, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:9">‹N ma konyi sugandixie nan wo ra, n mu mɛma naxee ra.›<verse eid="ISA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 41:10" />Wo naxa gaaxu, barima n na wo fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">Wo naxa kɔntɔfili, barima n tan nan na wo Marigi Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:10">N sɛnbɛ fima wo ma n bɛlɛxɛ tinxinxi nan na.»<verse eid="ISA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 41:11" />«Naxee birin wo maberefe, e fama yaagi nan tun sɔtɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:11">Naxee wo fenfe gere ra, e halakima nɛ, e ɲɔn.<verse eid="ISA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 41:12" />Wo na wo yaxuie fen, wo mu fama e tode, barima e lɔɛma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:12">Naxee wo fenma gere ra, nee ɲɔnma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 41:13" />Na rabama nɛ barima n tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">naxan wo bɛlɛxɛ rasuxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:13">a a fala, ‹Wo naxa gaaxu, n fafe wo malide.›<verse eid="ISA 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 41:14" />Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ, wo naxa gaaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">Isirayila, wo wo sɛnbɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">Hali wo findixi mixi xunxurie nan na alɔ kuli di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">n tan naxan lanxi wo Rakisima ma, naxan findixi wo xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">n tan yɛtɛ yati fama nɛ wo malide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:14">N xui nan na ki.»<verse eid="ISA 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 41:15" />«N a niyama nɛ wo xa sɛnbɛ magaaxuxi sɔtɔ wo yaxuie ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:15">Wo luma nɛ alɔ wure wali se naxan geyae rabɔɔma, a e findi xube ra.<verse eid="ISA 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 41:16" />Wo yaxuie rayensenma nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">alɔ xɛ sa naxee maale bɔnbɔ, foye fa maale lagi xanin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">Wo sɛɛwama nɛ Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:16">wo Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ tantuma nɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 41:17" />«Misikiinɛe nun setaree ye fenma, kɔnɔ e mu a toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">E nɛnyi xarama ye xɔli ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">Kɔnɔ n tan Alatala, n e xa maxandi tongoma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:17">N tan Isirayila Marigi Ala, n mu nɛɛmuma e ma.<verse eid="ISA 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 41:18" />N xuree rabɔɔma nɛ geya maxaraxie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">n dulonyi raminima ma gulunbae kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:18">N gbengberenyi mafindima nɛ ye yire ra.<verse eid="ISA 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 41:19" />N sɛdiri, kasiya, miriti, nun oliwi wuri bilie sima nɛ gbengberenyi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:19">N sipirɛ, orimi, nun buyisi sansi bilie si wula i,<verse eid="ISA 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 41:20" />alako ɲama xa na to, e fa fahaamui sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:20">a na birin findixi Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ Alatala sɛnbɛ wali nan na.»<verse eid="ISA 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 41:21" />Alatala naxɛ, «Wo fa, wo wo xa marakɔrɔsi masen n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:21">Wo xa na birin tagi raba a fanyi ra Yaxuba Marigi bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 41:22" />Wo xa fa wo xa kuyee ra alako e xa a fala muxu bɛ fe naxee fama rabade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">Fe naxee singe rabaxi, e xa e raba ki fala muxu bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">alako muxu xa xaxili sɔtɔ na kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:22">E xa a fala muxu bɛ fe naxan fama rabade,<verse eid="ISA 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 41:23" />alako muxu xa a kolon a e findixi alae nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">E xa fe nde raba, a na findi fefe yo ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:23">naxan nɔma muxu dɛ ixarade, muxu xa gaaxu e ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 41:24" />Wo tan kuyee, ‹Wo mu nɔma na sese ra, wo tide yo mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:24">Mixi naxan wo batuma, na mixi findixi mixi xɔnxi nan na.›»<verse eid="ISA 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 41:25" />«N bara mixi nde rakeli kɔɔla mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">a fama n xili ra kelife sogetede mabiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:25">A mangɛe iboronma nɛ alɔ fɛɲɛ rafalɛ bɛndɛ iboronma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 41:26" />Nde na fe masenxi kabi a fɔlɛ, alako muxu xa na kolon beenun a xa raba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Nde na falaxi, alako muxu xa a kolon nɔndi falɛ nan a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Kuye yo mu na fe masen.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Kuye yo mu na xibaarui fi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:26">Kuye yo mu e xui ite.<verse eid="ISA 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 41:27" />N tan nan na singe masen Siyoni bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">‹Yi nan fama rabade.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:27">N tan xɛɛra nan xɛɛ Darisalamu.<verse eid="ISA 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 41:28" />N naxan toma yi kuyee tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">keren mu na naxan nɔma masenyi nde tide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:28">naxan nɔma n ma maxɔrinyie yaabide.<verse eid="ISA 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ISA 41:29" />Wo xa e mato: Kuye fufafu nan e ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:29">E wali fɔxi yo mu na!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 41:29">Sese mu na yi kuyee ra!»<verse eid="ISA 41:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="ISA 42" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xa Konyi Sugandixi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 42:1" />N ma Konyi Sugandixi nan yi ki, n ɲɔxɔ saxi naxan xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">n naxan xanuma n nii birin na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">N bara n Xaxili ragoro a ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:1">A tinxinyi masenma nɛ ɲamanɛe bɛ,<verse eid="ISA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 42:2" />kɔnɔ a mu xaaɲɛma e ma, a mu sɔnxɔɛ ratema e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:2">a mu a yɛtɛ igboma.<verse eid="ISA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 42:3" />A mu kale kuntinxi igirama, a mu lanpui dɛxɛ xuri raxubenma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:3">A kiiti sama a sɛriyɛ ki nan ma.<verse eid="ISA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 42:4" />A mu dagalanma, a mu birama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">han a gɛ tinxinyi rasabatide duniɲa ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:4">Ɲamanɛe xaxili tima a xa yaamari tinxinxi nan na.<verse eid="ISA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 42:5" />Alatala Nɔndi Kanyi xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">Ala naxan koore daa, a a walaxɛ itala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">naxan bɔxi daa, a nun se birin naxan toma naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:5">naxan ɲɛngi fixi duniɲa mixie ma, alako e xa duniɲa igiri.<verse eid="ISA 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 42:6" />«N tan Alatala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">naxan i xɛɛxi, naxan i makantaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">naxan a niya i xa findi saatɛ saabui ra ibunadama bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:6">naxan a niya i xa findi naiyalanyi ra ɲamanɛe bɛ,<verse eid="ISA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 42:7" />alako i xa dɔnxuie ya rabɔɔ, i xa geelimanie ramini geeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:7">i xa mixie xɔrɛya naxee na dimi kui.»<verse eid="ISA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 42:8" />«Alatala nan n na, n xili nan na ki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">N mu wama n firin nde xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:8">n mu tinma n ma matɔxɔɛ xa fi kuyee ma.<verse eid="ISA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 42:9" />N ma masenyi singee bara rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">n man fe nɛɛnɛ masenma nɛ wo bɛ naxan fama rakamalide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:9">N nee xa fe rakolon wo ra beenu e xa raba.»<verse eid="ISA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 42:10" />«Wo xa bɛɛti nɛɛnɛ ba Alatala bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">wo a matɔxɔ sa keli duniɲa baanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">wo tan naxee biyaasima baa xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">wo tan naxee baloma baa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:10">wo tan naxee sabatixi ɲamanɛe kui.<verse eid="ISA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 42:11" />Gbengberenyi nun taae xa e xui ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">Kedarikae sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:11">Selakae xa e sɛɛwɛ xui ite geyae fari.<verse eid="ISA 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 42:12" />E xa Alatala matɔxɔ alɔ a lan a xa matɔxɔ ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:12">Ɲamanɛ birin xa a matɔxɔ.<verse eid="ISA 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 42:13" />Alatala minima nɛ alɔ ɲalama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:13">a bɔɲɛ te gere xa fe ra, a gereso xui ramini sɛnbɛ ra.»<verse eid="ISA 42:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 42:14" />«Kabi a rakuya n sabarixi, n dunduxi, n nan n yɛtɛ suxuxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:14">Kɔnɔ yakɔsi n nan n xui raminima alɔ ginɛ naxan di barife.<verse eid="ISA 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 42:15" />N sansie ralisima nɛ geyae fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">geya findi gbengberenyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">N xuree mafindima nɛ xare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:15">n ye yiree xɔri.<verse eid="ISA 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 42:16" />N dɔnxuie raɲɛrɛma nɛ kira nde ra, e mu naxan kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">n dimi findi e bɛ naiyalanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">n bɔxi magexi findi bɔxi saxi ra e ɲɛrɛma dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:16">N na nan yati rabama e bɛ, n mu e rabɛɲinma.<verse eid="ISA 42:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 42:17" />Naxee e xaxili tixi kuyee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">e gbilenma nɛ yaagi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">Na kuyee yailanxi wure raxunuxi nan tun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:17">kɔnɔ na mixie a falama e bɛ, ‹Wo findixi won ma alae nan na.›»<verse eid="ISA 42:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 42:18" />«Tulixɔrie, wo wo tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:18">Dɔnxuie, wo wo ya ti n na.<verse eid="ISA 42:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 42:19" />Nde dɔnxuxi, xa n ma konyi xa mu a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Nde tuli xɔrixi, xa n n ma xɛɛra xa mu a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:19">Nde dɔnxuxi, xa n ma konyi bɔɲɛ saxi xa mu a ra?<verse eid="ISA 42:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 42:20" />Wo bara fe gbegbe to, kɔnɔ wo mu wo ɲɔxɔ saxi e xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:20">E bara e tuli mati, kɔnɔ e mu fefe fahaamuxi.<verse eid="ISA 42:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 42:21" />Tinxinyi to rafan Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:21">a bara wa a xa sɛriyɛ binyafe, ɲama xa a kolon.<verse eid="ISA 42:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 42:22" />Kɔnɔ yi ɲama xun bara rakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">e suxuxi yili nun geeli nan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">E yaxuie bara e xanin, mixi yo mu na naxan e rakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:22">mixi yo mu na naxan maxandi tima e bɛ e xa gbilen.»<verse eid="ISA 42:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 42:23" />Nde a tuli matima na fee ra wo ya ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:23">Nde a ɲɔxɔ sama na fee xɔn ma tɛmui naxan sa fama?<verse eid="ISA 42:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 42:24" />Nde Yaxuba soxi muɲɛti yi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">Nde Isirayila soxi kasaratie yi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">Alatala xa mu a ra, won yunubi rabaxi naxan na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">E mu waxi ɲɛrɛfe a xa kira xa xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:24">e man mu e tuli matixi a xa sɛriyɛ xa ra.<verse eid="ISA 42:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 42:25" />Na kui a naxa a xa xɔnɛ dusu Isirayila xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">a niya gere xa e xun nakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">Na tɛ bara dɛxɛ e rabilinyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 42:25">kɔnɔ e mu e ɲɔxɔ saxi na xɔn ma.<verse eid="ISA 42:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="ISA 43" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila Rakisima kerenyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 43:1" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">naxan Yaxuba daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">naxan Isirayila yailanxi bɛndɛ ra:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">«Hali wo mu gaaxu, barima n bara wo xun sara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:1">n bara wo xili wo xili ra, barima n gbe nan wo ra.<verse eid="ISA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 43:2" />Wo na baa igiri, won birin nan a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">Wo na xure igiri, a mu wo xaninma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:2">Wo na dangi tɛ xɔɔra, a mu wo ganma, a mu wo tɔɔrɔma,<verse eid="ISA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 43:3" />barima n tan Alatala nan na wo Marigi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ, wo Rakisima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">N Misira nan fixi i xunsare ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:3">n Etiyopi nun Seba fixi wo ɲɔxɔɛ nan na.<verse eid="ISA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 43:4" />Wo tide to gbo n bɛ n ma xanunteya xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:4">n mixie nan bama wo ɲɔxɔɛ ra, n ɲama fi wo nii rakisife ra.<verse eid="ISA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 43:5" />Wo naxa gaaxu, n na wo fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:5">N fama nɛ wo bɔnsɔɛ ra, kelife sogetede nun sogegorode mabiri,<verse eid="ISA 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 43:6" />n fama wo xilide kelife yirefanyi nun kɔɔla ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:6">‹Wo fa n ma die ra, kelife yire makuye,<verse eid="ISA 43:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 43:7" />e birin naxee xilixi n xili ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:7">n naxan daaxi n ma nɔrɛ xa fe ra.›<verse eid="ISA 43:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 43:8" />Ɲamae xa fa naxee ya na kɔnɔ e mu se toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:8">e tuli na kɔnɔ e mu fe mɛma.<verse eid="ISA 43:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 43:9" />Ɲamae nun sie xa e malan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">Nde na e ya ma naxan nu bara yi fe masen won bɛ beenu a xa raba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">E xa seedee ramini, naxee nɔma a fe rafiixɛde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:9">alako booree xa a kolon a nɔndi na a ra.»<verse eid="ISA 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 43:10" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">«Wo tan nan na n ma seedee ra, n ma konyi sugandixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">alako wo xa n kolon, wo xa la n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:10">Ala yo mu nu na n ya ra, Ala yo mu fama n xanbi ra.<verse eid="ISA 43:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 43:11" />N tan keren nan na Alatala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:11">Mixi rakisima yo mu na bafe n tan na.<verse eid="ISA 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 43:12" />N tan nan nɔndi masenxi, n tan nan wo rakisixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">n tan nan fe nɛɛnɛ masenma wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">Ala xɔɲɛ nde xa mu n na wo tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:12">Wo tan nan na n ma seedee ra a n keren nan na Ala ra.<verse eid="ISA 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 43:13" />Kabi fɔlɔ fɔlɛ n tan nan Ala ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">Mixi yo mu nɔma mixi bade n bɛlɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:13">mixi yo mu nɔma n ma fe rabaxi masarade.»<verse eid="ISA 43:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 43:14" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">Ala naxan wo xun sara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">Ala naxan findixi Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">A naxɛ, «N yaamari fima nɛ Babilɔn geelimanie xa fa e xa kunkuie kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:14">e nu laxi naxee ra.<verse eid="ISA 43:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 43:15" />Alatala na n tan nan na, wo xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:15">naxan Isirayila daa, naxan findixi wo xa mangɛ ra.»<verse eid="ISA 43:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 43:16" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, Ala naxan kira bɔɔ baa tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:16">naxan dangide ramini mɔrɔnyie xɔɔra,<verse eid="ISA 43:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 43:17" />naxan a niya sɔɔri ragi see nun soe ragie xa kata dangide mɛnni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">e fa lu baa xɔɔra abadan, e mu te.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:17">Na sɔɔri gali xubenxi nɛ alɔ lanpui xubenma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 43:18" />«Wo naxa wo maɲɔxun fe singee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:18">wo fe forie lu na.<verse eid="ISA 43:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 43:19" />Wo mu a toxi, n na fe nɛɛnɛe rabafe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">Wo mu gɛxi na kolonde?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">N na kira nde bɔɔfe gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:19">n na xuree raminife yire maxaraxi ma.<verse eid="ISA 43:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 43:20" />Burunyi daalise n matɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">alɔ wulai bare nun xundi, barima n ye raminima gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">n xure xungbee rabɔɔ yire maxaraxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:20">alako n ma ɲama sugandixi xa ye min,<verse eid="ISA 43:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 43:21" />alako n ɲama naxan daaxi a xa n matɔxɔ.»<verse eid="ISA 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 43:22" />«Yaxuba, wo mu maxandi tima n xili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:22">Isirayila, wo mu fefe rabafe birafe ra n fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="ISA 43:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 43:23" />Wo mu tin yɛxɛɛe bade sɛrɛxɛ ra n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">wo mu tin n binyade sɛrɛxɛe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">N mu kote dɔxɔxi wo xun ma sansi sɛrɛxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:23">n mu wo karaxan surayi ganfe ra.<verse eid="ISA 43:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 43:24" />Wo mu labundɛ fanyi sara n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">wo mu ninge ture gbegbe ba sɛrɛxɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">Wo naxan nabaxi, wo bara n natagan wo xa yunubie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:24">wo bara n naxɔnɔ wo xa ɲaaxuɲa ra.»<verse eid="ISA 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 43:25" />«N tan nan a ra, naxan i xa yunubie xafarima n xili xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:25">n fa nɛɛmu i xa yunubie ma feo.<verse eid="ISA 43:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 43:26" />I xa i xa fe dangixi masen n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:26">won xa a mato kiiti na ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 43:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 43:27" />I benba singe yunubi raba nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:27">I xa yarerati muruta nɛ n xili ma.<verse eid="ISA 43:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 43:28" />Na nan a ra, n fama i xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛe rayaagide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">naxee walima n ma hɔrɔmɔlingira kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">N a niyama nɛ Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ xun xa rakana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 43:28">Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ xa yaagi.»<verse eid="ISA 43:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="ISA 44" />
  <para style="s">Kuye yailanma xa wali</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 44:1" />«N ma konyi Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ, wo xa wo tuli mati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:1">n ma ɲama sugandixi Isirayila, wo xa n xui ramɛ.<verse eid="ISA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 44:2" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">naxan wo daaxi wo nga tɛɛgɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">naxan wo bun tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">N ma konyi Yaxuba, hali i mu hanmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:2">wo tan Yesurun n naxan sugandixi,<verse eid="ISA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 44:3" />barima n ye ragoroma nɛ wo xa bɔxi maxaraxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">n xure raminima nɛ gbengberen yire ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">N nan n Xaxili ragoroma nɛ wo bɔnsɔɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:3">n barakɛ sama nɛ wo xa die ma.<verse eid="ISA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 44:4" />E fanma nɛ alɔ ɲooge naxan toma fiili tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:4">alɔ wuri naxee sixi xure dɛ i.<verse eid="ISA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 44:5" />Nde a falama nɛ, ‹Alatala gbe nan n na,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">a Yaxuba xili sa a xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">Nde a sɛbɛma nɛ a bɛlɛxɛ ma, ‹Alatala gbe,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:5">a Isirayila xili sa a xun ma.»<verse eid="ISA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 44:6" />«Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">Alatala Sɛnbɛma naxan findixi Isirayila mangɛ nun a rakisima ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">N tan nan na fe fɔlɛ ra, n tan nan na fe raɲɔnyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:6">Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na bafe n tan na.<verse eid="ISA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 44:7" />Nde maniyaxi n tan na? A xa na fala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">Na kanyi xa wɔyɛn ba, a xa fe dangixi masen kabi n ma ɲama daa tɛmui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:7">A xa fe masen naxan fama rabade, iyo a xa na fala kɛnɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 44:8" />Wo naxa gaaxu, wo naxa sɛrɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">N mu na masenxi wo bɛ xɛ, beenu na fee xa raba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">N ma seedee nan wo ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Ala gbɛtɛ na na, ba n tan na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:8">Ade, fanye gbɛtɛ mu na hali keren.»<verse eid="ISA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 44:9" />Fuyantee nan kuye yailanmae ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">E xa wali tide yo mu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">E xa seedee ya mu na, e xaxili ifuxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:9">E fama lude na yaagi nan kui.<verse eid="ISA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 44:10" />Nde kuye yailanma, naxan mu nɔma a malide fefe ra?<verse eid="ISA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 44:11" />Na kanyie yaagima nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">Adamadi nan tun na e ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">E birin xa e malan, e xa ti n ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:11">N e birin nagoroma nɛ gaaxui nun ɲaxankatɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 44:12" />Kuye yailanma wure xabuma tɛ xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">a kuyee yailan dɛrɛma ra, a a rawali a yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:12">Kaamɛ nun ye xɔli luma nɛ a suxu ra, a fa tagan.<verse eid="ISA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 44:13" />Kamudɛri luuti italama nɛ a maniyafe ra, a a kɔɔrin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">A wali fɔlɔ wali see ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:13">a a yailan han a lu alɔ mixi tofanyi naxan tima a xa banxi kui.<verse eid="ISA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 44:14" />A nu wuri ndee si fɔtɔnyi yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:14">a mamɛ ti han tunɛ ye a ramɔ, a fa a sɛgɛ.<verse eid="ISA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 44:15" />A nde findi yege ra, alako xinbeli naxa a suxu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">a nde rawali taami ganfe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">Kɔnɔ naxan luxi, a na findi ala ra a naxan batuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:15">a kuye rafala, a suyidi a bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 44:16" />A sɛɛti findi yege ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">a sube ganma naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:16">a fa a dɛge, a a fala, «Yi tɛ fan. Xinbeli mu n suxuma be.»<verse eid="ISA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 44:17" />A wuri dɔnxɔɛ nan findima a xa kuye ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">a suyidi naxan bɛ a batufe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">A maxandi ti a bɛ, a falafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:17">«N nakisi, barima i tan nan n ma ala ra.»<verse eid="ISA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 44:18" />Kɔnɔ na mixi mu gɛxi fahaamui sɔtɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">A luxi alɔ dɔnxui naxan mu se toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:18">a xaxili mu fata fee tagi rabade.<verse eid="ISA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 44:19" />Sese mu a a bɔɲɛ ratima sɔnɔn, a xa a maɲɔxun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">«N bara wuri sɛɛti sa tɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">alako n xa taami nun sube gan a tɛ wole ra n naxan donma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">A lanma n xa na wuri dɔnxɔɛ rafala kuye ra Ala naxan xɔnma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:19">N xa n suyidi wuri xuntunyi bɛ?»<verse eid="ISA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 44:20" />Na kuye yailanma birama se nan fɔxɔ ra naxan findima tɛ xube ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">A bɔɲɛ bara a yɛtɛ yanfa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">A mu fata a yɛtɛ rakiside,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:20">a man mu xaxili sɔtɔ a falafe ra, «N naxan tixi n bɛlɛxɛ ra wule ala nan a ra.»<verse eid="ISA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 44:21" />«Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ, wo xa ratu yi fee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">wo tan Isirayila ɲama naxan findixi n ma konyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">N wo daa nɛ, alako wo xa findi n ma konyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:21">Isirayila, n mu nɛɛmuma wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 44:22" />N bara wo xa yunubie xafari, wo naxan sɔtɔ wo xa murutɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">n bara nee ba naa alɔ nuxui bama koore ma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:22">Wo xa gbilen n ma, barima n bara wo xun sara.»<verse eid="ISA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 44:23" />Koore xa sɛɛwa Alatala xa wali xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Bɔxi bunyi xa a xui ramini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">Geyae xa e xui ite alɔ wuri naxee na fɔtɔnyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">barima Alatala bara Yaxuba xun sara,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:23">a bara a nɔrɛ masen Isirayila ya ma.<verse eid="ISA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 44:24" />Wo Rakisima Alatala xa masenyi nan ya naxan wo rafalaxi wo nga tɛɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">«N tan, Alatala nan n na, naxan fe birin daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">naxan koore itala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:24">naxan bɔxi rafala a bɛlɛxɛ ra,<verse eid="ISA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 44:25" />naxan namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛe xa tɔnxumae kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">naxan sematoe rayaagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:25">naxan lɔnnilae xa marasi mafindi lɔnnitareɲa ra,<verse eid="ISA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 44:26" />naxan a xa namiɲɔnmɛ konyie xa masenyie rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">naxan a xa xɛɛrae xui findi nɔndi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">naxan a masenma Darisalamu xa fe ra, ‹Ɲama fama sabatide naa,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:26">naxan a masenma Yudaya taae xa fe ra, ‹E man fama nɛ tide,›<verse eid="ISA 44:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ISA 44:27" />naxan a falama baa bɛ, ‹Xara, n i xa ye raxɔrima nɛ,›<verse eid="ISA 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ISA 44:28" />naxan mangɛ Sirusi xɛɛma a sago rabade, alɔ xuruse madonyi a rabama ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">naxan a masenma Darisalamu xa fe ra, ‹A man xa ti,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 44:28">naxan a masenma hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra, ‹A man xa ti!›»<verse eid="ISA 44:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="ISA 45" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa wali nun Sirusi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 45:1" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya a xa mixi sugandixi Sirusi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">a naxan xɛɛxi ɲamanɛe xun nakanafe ra, e xa lu a xa yaamari bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:1">a naadɛ rabixi naxan bɛ alako a xa wali xa sɔɔnɛya.<verse eid="ISA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 45:2" />«N tima nɛ i ya ra, n tentenyi magoro i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:2">n wure gbeeli naadɛe kana, n wure naadɛe yensen yɛ i ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 45:3" />N naafuli nɔxunxi fima nɛ i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">alako i xa a kolon n tan nan Isirayila Marigi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:3">naxan i xilixi i xili yati ra.<verse eid="ISA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 45:4" />N ma konyi Yaxuba xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">n ma ɲama sugandixi Isirayila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:4">n i xilixi i xili nan na, n binyɛ fima nɛ i ma hali i to mu n kolonxi sinden.<verse eid="ISA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 45:5" />N tan nan na Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na bafe n tan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:5">N sɛnbɛ fima nɛ i ma hali i to mu n kolonxi sinden.<verse eid="ISA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 45:6" />Na kui mixi birin fama nɛ a kolonde a Ala kerenyi nan n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">kelife sogetede han sogegorode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:6">Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na.<verse eid="ISA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 45:7" />N tan nan koore iyalanma, n dimi rasin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">n tan nan hɛri raminima, n gbaloe raba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:7">N tan Alatala na n na fee birin nabama.»<verse eid="ISA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 45:8" />«Tunɛ ye xa goro kelife koore ma, nuxui xa rabi ye raminife ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">Bɔxi fan xa rabi na ye sɔtɔfe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">Kisi xa sɔtɔ alɔ sansi bulama ki naxɛ, tinxinyi xa lu na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:8">N tan Alatala nan na birin daaxi.»<verse eid="ISA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 45:9" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixi bɛ, naxan a yailanma matandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">naxan findixi fɛɲɛ xuntunyi tun na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">Bɛndɛ doloxi a falama fɛɲɛ yailanma bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:9">«I n yailanfe munse ra? I xa wali mu fan!»<verse eid="ISA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 45:10" />Ɲaxankatɛ na mixi bɛ, naxan a falama a baba nun a nga bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:10">«Wo munse barixi?»<verse eid="ISA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 45:11" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ naxan wo daaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">«Wo wama n maxɔrinfe tina fe nan ma n naxan nabama n ma die ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:11">Wo wama n yamarife n ma wali xa fe nan na?<verse eid="ISA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 45:12" />N tan nan bɔxi yailanxi, n fa mixi daa a fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:12">N tan nan koore itala n bɛlɛxɛ ra, n tunbuie yamari.<verse eid="ISA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 45:13" />N tan nan man Sirusi xɛɛma n ma tinxinyi xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">N kira rabɔɔma nɛ a bɛ alako a xa n ma taa ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">a xa n ma ɲama xɔrɔya xunsare xanbi.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:13">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 45:14" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">«Misira nun Etiyopi xa naafuli luma nɛ i yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">Sebakae findima nɛ i xa konyie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">e bira i fɔxɔ ra yɔlɔnxɔnyi kui, e suyidi i bɛ, e a fala i bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:14">‹Ala na i fɔxɔ ra, a maniyɛ mu na, Ala gbɛtɛ mu na.›»<verse eid="ISA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 45:15" />Isirayila Marigi Ala, a Rakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:15">Ala nan i ra, naxan mu a yɛtɛ masenma kɛnɛ ma.<verse eid="ISA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 45:16" />Kuye yailanmae fama nɛ lude yaagi kui, e e birin xanin,<verse eid="ISA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 45:17" />kɔnɔ Alatala Isirayila tan rakisima nɛ abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:17">a mu fama yaagide feo.<verse eid="ISA 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 45:18" />Alatala naxan koore daaxi, naxan firin nde mu na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">naxan duniɲa daaxi a ki nun a kɛɲa nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">a fa adamadie rasabati a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:18">a fa a fala, «Alatala nan na, Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na.<verse eid="ISA 45:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 45:19" />N mu wɔyɛnxi dunxui xa ra de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">N mu a fala Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ bɛ e xa n fen na ki tun.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:19">N tan Alatala nɔndi nan falama, n tinxinyi nan masenma.»<verse eid="ISA 45:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 45:20" />«Wo wo malan, wo fa, wo wo maso, wo tan mixi gixie kelife ɲamanɛe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">Kuye batuie mu sese kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:20">e kuye maxandima naxee mu nɔma mixi rakiside.<verse eid="ISA 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 45:21" />Wo wo xui ramini, wo xa marakolonyi ti e bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">E xa e bore rasi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Nde yi masenyi tixi kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye? N tan xa mu a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na bafe n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:21">Ala naxan tinxin, naxan mixi rakisima.<verse eid="ISA 45:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 45:22" />Wo xa gbilen n ma, wo tan naxee kelima duniɲa tunxunyie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">alako wo xa kisi sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:22">barima Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na bafe n tan na.<verse eid="ISA 45:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 45:23" />N bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra nɔndi ki ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">n ma masenyi mu kanama fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">Xinbi birin sinma nɛ n bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:23">kali birin nabama n tan nan xili ra.<verse eid="ISA 45:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 45:24" />Ɲama a falama nɛ n bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">‹Tinxinyi nun sɛnbɛ toma i tan Alatala nan gbansan yi.›»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 45:24" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">Mixi naxee nu murutaxi a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:24">e fama nɛ a yire yaagi kui.<verse eid="ISA 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 45:25" />Kɔnɔ Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ gbe ɲɔxɔma nɛ Alatala saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 45:25">e fa xunnakeli sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="ISA 46" />
  <para style="s">Babilɔn xa alae</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 46:1" />Babilɔn xa kuye Beli a xinbi sinma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">A xa kuye Nebo fan a felenma bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">Sofalee e bɛndunma xanin se fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:1">Na kote binya, a sofalee rataganma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 46:2" />E mu nɔ na kuyee ratangade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:2">E birin xa siga konyiya kui.<verse eid="ISA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 46:3" />«Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ, wo wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">Isirayilaka naxee luxi, wo wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:3">Kabi wo barixi tɛmui naxɛ, n bara wo xanin n bɛlɛxɛ, n bara wo bun ti.<verse eid="ISA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 46:4" />N nu na raba nɛ han wo fori waxati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">Wo xunsɛxɛ to nu fiixɛma, n tan nan man nu wo bun tima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:4">N to wo daa, n man nu wo malima nɛ, n wo xanin, n wo rakisi.<verse eid="ISA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 46:5" />Wo n ma maniyɛ toma minden? Wo n firin nde kolon?<verse eid="ISA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 46:6" />Naafuli kanyi xɛɛma nun gbeti raminima, a a sa sikeeli fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">alako xabui xa kuye nde yailan a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:6">a a xinbi sinma naxan bɛ a batufe ra.<verse eid="ISA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 46:7" />E na tongo, e a dɔxɔ e tunki fari, e a xanin yire, e a tima dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">Mɛnni a tixi tun, a mu sigama dɛdɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">Hali mixi nde a mawa a bɛ, a mu a yaabima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:7">a mu mixi ratangama a xa tɔɔrɛ ma.»<verse eid="ISA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 46:8" />«Wo tan murutɛlae, wo xa ratu na fee ma, alako wo xa nɔ kiside.<verse eid="ISA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 46:9" />Wo xa ratu n naxan nabaxi tɛmui dangixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:9">Ala gbɛtɛ yo mu na bafe n tan na, n firin nde mu na.<verse eid="ISA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 46:10" />Ala gbɛtɛ mu na naxan fe masenma beenun a xa raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">naxan nɔma a falade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:10">‹N waxɔnfe fama nɛ rakamalide. N tan nan a ragirima.›<verse eid="ISA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 46:11" />N tan nan xɔni nde xilima kelife sogetede mabiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">naxan n waxɔnfe rabama n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">Iyo, n naxan falaxi, n a rabama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:11">n naxan natɛxi, n a rakamalima nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 46:12" />Wo wo tuli mati n na, wo tan naxee xaxili xɔrɔxɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:12">wo tan naxee makuyaxi tinxinyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 46:13" />N ma kiiti tinxinxi bara makɔrɛ, a mu makuya feo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">N fama n ma kisi fan na, a mu buma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">N Siyon rakisima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 46:13">N nan n ma nɔrɛ ragoroma nɛ Isirayila ma.»<verse eid="ISA 46:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="ISA 47" />
  <para style="s">Babilɔn birafe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 47:1" />«Babilɔn taa, keli i xa kibanyi kui, i dɔxɔ bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:1">I xa tofanyi nun i xa bannaya bama nɛ i yi.<verse eid="ISA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 47:2" />Wali see tongo kuri sofe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:2">I xa mafelenyi bama nɛ i ma, i xa dugi mate, i xure igiri i mageli ra.<verse eid="ISA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 47:3" />I ɲaibɔma nɛ yaagi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:3">n fama nɛ n gbe ɲɔxɔde kinikini xanbi.»<verse eid="ISA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 47:4" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma nan findi muxu xunsarama ra, Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ.<verse eid="ISA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 47:5" />«Babilɔn ɲama, wo dɔxɔ, wo wo dɛ balan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:5">Wo xa mangɛya bara ɲɔn.<verse eid="ISA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 47:6" />N nu xɔnɔxi n ma ɲama ma, n fa e kɛ tongomae xun nakana.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">N naxa e lu wo sagoe, kɔnɔ wo mu kinikini e ma fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:6">Hali forie, wo bara e ɲaxankata a ɲaaxi ra.<verse eid="ISA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 47:7" />Wo nu a falama nɛ, ‹N ma mangɛya mu ɲɔnma abadan!›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:7">Kɔnɔ wo mu wo ɲɔxɔ saxi fe xɔn ma naxan nɔma wo lide.»<verse eid="ISA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 47:8" />«Yakɔsi wo wo tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">wo tan banna naxee a maɲɔxunxi a fefe mu nɔma wo tɔɔrɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">naxee a falama, ‹N keren nan tide gbo duniɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:8">n mu findima kaaɲɛ ra, n ma die mu bama n yi.›<verse eid="ISA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 47:9" />Kɔnɔ n xa a fala wo bɛ, na fe firinyie wo lima nɛ fɛɛɲɛn keren kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">Wo ganma nɛ wo xa die ra, wo findi kaaɲɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:9">hali wo duureya nun karamɔxɔ wali rawuya.<verse eid="ISA 47:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 47:10" />Wo nu laxi wo xa ɲaaxuɲa nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">wo ɲɔxɔ a ma na mu toma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">Wo xa fe kolonyi bara wo madaxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:10">Wo bara a fala wo bɔɲɛ ma, ‹N keren nan be, n tan nan gbansan tide gbo.›<verse eid="ISA 47:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 47:11" />Gbaloe fama nɛ wo lide, wo mu nɔma wo yɛtɛ ratangade naxan ma wo xa naafuli ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:11">gbaloe naxan wo tɛrɛnnama.»<verse eid="ISA 47:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 47:12" />«Wo to laxi na fe mɔɔli nan na, wo xa lu wo xa duureya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">nun wo xa manduruya kui wo darixi naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:12">Wo a maɲɔxun a na sɔɔnɛyama nɛ wo bɛ, wo fa geeni wo yaxui xun ma,<verse eid="ISA 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 47:13" />kɔnɔ na birin fama nɛ wo ratagande.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">Wo xa se matoe xili, naxee koore matoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:13">e fe fala naxan fama wo lide.<verse eid="ISA 47:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 47:14" />Nee tan fan luma nɛ alɔ sɛxɛ naxan ganma tɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">E mu nɔma e yɛtɛ rakiside tɛ xɔɔra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:14">Sese mu luma e yi ra, hali tɛ xunxuri e dɔxɔma naxan sɛɛti ma xinbeli tɛmui.<verse eid="ISA 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 47:15" />E mu nɔma fefe rabade wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">hali wo to bara wo xaxili ti e ra kabi wo dimɛdi tɛmui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">E sigama nɛ yare e xa kira ɲaaxi xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 47:15">Mixi yo mu nɔma wo rakiside.»<verse eid="ISA 47:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="ISA 48" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila nun Ala xa lanyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 48:1" />«Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ naxan xili Isirayila, naxan fatanxi Yudaya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">wo wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">Wo tan naxee wo kalima Alatala xili ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:1">wo tan naxee Isirayila Marigi Ala maxandima tinxintareya kui,<verse eid="ISA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 48:2" />wo tan naxee wo yɛtɛ xilima Taa Sɛniyɛnxi Kanyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:2">wo tan naxee wo xaxili tima Isirayila Marigi Alatala ra,<verse eid="ISA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 48:3" />n naxan masenxi wo bɛ tɛmui dangixi, n bara gɛ na ragiride.<verse eid="ISA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 48:4" />N to a kolon wo xaxili xɔrɔxɔ alɔ wure,<verse eid="ISA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 48:5" />n naxa wo rakolon na fe ra beenun a xa raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">alako wo naxa fa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:5">‹Muxu xa kuye wuri daaxie nun wure daaxie nan na fe natɛxi.›<verse eid="ISA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 48:6" />Wo bara na mɛ? Wo bara so na fe kui?»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">«Yakɔsi n fe nɛɛnɛe masenma nɛ wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:6">naxee nu bara nɔxun wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 48:7" />Nee minixi yi waxati nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">wo mu nu naxee kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:7">Na kui wo mu nɔma a falade, ‹Iyo, muxu nu nee kolon.›<verse eid="ISA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 48:8" />Wo mu na fee fahaamuxi tɛmui dangixi barima wo tuli xɔrɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:8">Yanfantee nan wo ra kabi wo bari tɛmui.<verse eid="ISA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 48:9" />N xili xa fe ra, n mu n ma xɔnɛ ramini wo ma kerenyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:9">N ma matɔxɔɛ xa fe ra, n mu wo rabolo.<verse eid="ISA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 48:10" />N bara wo mato,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:10">kɔnɔ n mu a rabaxi alɔ xabui a rabama ki naxɛ gbeti ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:10">N wo matoma tɔɔrɛ nan saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 48:11" />N yi rabama n yɛtɛ bɛ alako n xili naxa kana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:11">alako n ma matɔxɔɛ naxa fi n firin nde ma.»<verse eid="ISA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 48:12" />«Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ, wo wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">Isirayila n naxan xilixi, wo wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:12">N tan nan na a singe ra, n tan nan na a dɔnxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 48:13" />N bɛlɛxɛ nan duniɲa bunyi saxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">n sɛnbɛ nan koore italaxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:13">N na e xili, e tima nɛ keren na.»<verse eid="ISA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 48:14" />«Wo xa wo malan, wo xa wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Kuye mundun bara yi fe masen wo bɛ beenun a xa raba?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">Alatala bara mixi nde sugandi naxan a sagoe rabama Babilɔn na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:14">naxan e xili xun nakanama.<verse eid="ISA 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 48:15" />Iyo, n tan yati bara n ma masenyi ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:15">n bara a xili, a xa na wali rakamali.»<verse eid="ISA 48:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 48:16" />«Wo wo maso n na, wo xa wo tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Kabi a fɔlɛ, n mu wɔyɛn dunxui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Na fe rabama n ya xɔri.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 48:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:16">Yakɔsi, n Marigi Alatala na n xɛɛfe, a a Xaxili ragoroxi n ma.<verse eid="ISA 48:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 48:17" />Wo Rakisima Alatala, Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ, a xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">«N tan findixi wo Marigi Alatala nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">naxan wo xa fe sɔɔnɛya ki masenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:17">naxan wo raɲɛrɛma ɲɛrɛ ki fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 48:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 48:18" />Xa wo wo ɲɔxɔ sa n ma sɛriyɛ xɔn ma nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:18">bɔɲɛsa nun kisi nu gboma nɛ wo yi ra alɔ ye naxan na baa ma.<verse eid="ISA 48:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 48:19" />Wo bɔnsɔɛ nu wuyama nɛ alɔ mɛyɛnyi naxan na baa dɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:19">wo xa die xilie mu nu bama n ya i.<verse eid="ISA 48:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 48:20" />Wo xa keli Babilɔn sɛɛwɛ xui ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">Wo xa na masen duniɲa birin bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:20">Wo xa a fala, ‹Alatala bara a konyi Yaxuba xun sara.›<verse eid="ISA 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 48:21" />Ye xɔli mu luma e ma gbengberenyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:21">a fanye ibɔɔma, a ye ramini a kui.<verse eid="ISA 48:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 48:22" />Mixi ɲaaxi xa fe mu sɔɔnɛyama.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 48:22">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 48:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="ISA 49" />
  <para style="s">Alatala xa konyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 49:1" />Si yensenxie, wo xa wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">Yire makuyee, wo xa wo ɲɔxɔ sa n wɔyɛn xui xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">Alatala n xili nɛ kabi n nga tɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:1">a naxa n xili fala beenun n xa mini foye ra.<verse eid="ISA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 49:2" />A naxa n dɛ lu alɔ santidɛgɛma xɛɲɛnxi a bɛlɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">a naxa n findi xali ɲɔɛ rameluxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:2">a naxa n sa a xa xali gbɔnfɔɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 49:3" />A naxa a fala n bɛ, «Isirayila, n ma konyi nan i ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:3">n na n ma nɔrɛ masenma naxan saabui ra.»<verse eid="ISA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 49:4" />Kɔnɔ n naxa a yaabi, «N ma wali mu sɔɔnɛyaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">n bara kata, kɔnɔ fufafu na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:4">N ma wali sare na n Marigi Alatala nan yi.»<verse eid="ISA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 49:5" />Na kui Alatala naxa masenyi nde ti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">naxan n daa n nga tɛgɛ i, n xa findi a xa konyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">alako n xa Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ ragbilen a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">Isirayila ɲama man xa malan a fɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">Alatala bara binyɛ xungbe fi n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:5">a tan naxan findixi n sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 49:6" />A naxɛ, «Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ Isirayila ragbilenfe n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">wali na a ra naxan xurun i bɛ n ma konyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">N man i findima nɛ naiyalanyi ra si gbɛtɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:6">alako n ma kisi xa masen duniɲa yire birin.»<verse eid="ISA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 49:7" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">Alatala naxan findixi Isirayila Xunsarama ra, Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">won bɔnsɔɛ naxan xɔnxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">naxan walixi mangɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">«Mangɛe na wo to, e tima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">kuntigie na wo to, e e xinbi sinma nɛ wo bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">barima dugutɛgɛ Alatala naxan Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:7">na nan wo sugandixi.»<verse eid="ISA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 49:8" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">«N wo yaabima yaabi tɛmui nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">n wo rakisima kisi lɔxɔɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">N wo makantama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">n wo tima nɛ alɔ ɲama n saatɛ tongo naxan bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:8">alako wo xa bɔxi xa fan, naxan kanaxi a xa yailan.<verse eid="ISA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 49:9" />Geelimanie minima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:9">mixi naxee na dimi xɔɔra, nee xɔrɛya sɔtɔma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 49:10" />E luma nɛ alɔ xurusee naxee e dɛmadonma fiilie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">kaamɛ nun ye xɔli mu e suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">kuyefure nun soge xɔnɛ mu e tɔɔrɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">E rahinnɛma nan luma e raɲɛrɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:10">a e xun ti dulon yire ra.<verse eid="ISA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 49:11" />Tentenyi ragoroma nɛ, yili rafe, alako e xa kira xa fan.<verse eid="ISA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 49:12" />E fama nɛ kelife yire makuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">kelife kɔɔla nun sogegorode ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:12">kelife Asuwan bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="ISA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 49:13" />«Naxee na koore ma, e xa e sɛɛwɛ xui ite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">naxee na bɔxi ma, e xa ɲɛlɛxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">naxee na geyae fari, e xa bɛɛti ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">barima Alatala a xa ɲama madunduma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:13">a kinikini tɔɔrɔ mixie ma.»<verse eid="ISA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 49:14" />Kɔnɔ Siyonkae nu a falama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:14">«Alatala bara muxu rabolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:14">Muxu Marigi bara nɛɛmu muxu ma.»<verse eid="ISA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 49:15" />«Dingɛ nɔma nɛɛmude a xa diyɔrɛ ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">A mu kinikinima xɛ a xa di ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">Hali a tan nɛɛmu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:15">n tan mu nɛɛmuma wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 49:16" />Wo xilie korinxi n bɛlɛxɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:16">n yae tixi nɛ i xa banxi ra tɛmui birin.<verse eid="ISA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 49:17" />Wo xa die na gbilenfe wo xɔnyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:17">Naxee wo tɔɔrɔxi, nee na kelife wo xun ma.<verse eid="ISA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 49:18" />Wo wo ya ite. Wo xa die bara e malan, e na fafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">N tan Alatala bara n kali n yɛtɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">wo xa mixie fama nɛ lude wo sɛɛti ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:18">alɔ dugi tofanyie luma ginɛ ma ki naxɛ a xa futi xiri lɔxɔɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 49:19" />«Hali wo yaxuie to wo xɔnyi kanaxi, e wo xa ɲama rayensen yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">yakɔsi wo fama nɛ wuyade han wo gbo wo xa bɔxi bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:19">Mixi naxee kasarɛ tixi wo xɔnyi, e bara siga.<verse eid="ISA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 49:20" />Wo xa di naxee barixi yi tɔɔrɔ waxati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">e fama nɛ a falade, ‹Be xurun won bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:20">Won xa yire nɛɛnɛ ti won luma dɛnnaxɛ.›<verse eid="ISA 49:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 49:21" />Na tɛmui wo fama nɛ a falade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">‹Nde yi die barixi n bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Mixi rabɛɲinxi nan nu na n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Ala nu bara n nabolo, a mɛɛ n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Nde yi die ramɔxi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">N keren peti nan nu a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:21">Yi die kelixi minden?›»<verse eid="ISA 49:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 49:22" />Won Marigi Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">«N nan n bɛlɛxɛ itema nɛ ɲamanɛe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">n tɔnxuma masen e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">alako e xa fa wo xa di xɛmɛe ra e bɛlɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:22">e xa fa wo xa di ginɛe ra e tunki ma.<verse eid="ISA 49:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 49:23" />Mangɛe mɛɛnima nɛ wo xa die ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">mangɛ ginɛe e ramɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">Na mixi xungbee e xinbi sinma nɛ wo bun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">e wo sanyie masunbuma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">Na kui wo fama nɛ a kolonde a Alatala na n tan nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:23">Mixi naxee e xaxili tima n na, na kanyi mu yaagima.»<verse eid="ISA 49:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 49:24" />Sɔɔri xa se tongoxi nɔma rasuxude a yi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:24">Sɛnbɛma xa mixi suxuxi nɔma bade a yi ra?<verse eid="ISA 49:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 49:25" />Alatala wo yaabima yi ki nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">«Iyo, n sɔɔri xa se tongoxi rasuxuma nɛ a yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">n sɛnbɛma xa mixi suxuxi bama nɛ a yi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:25">N wo gerefae gerema nɛ, n wo xa die rakisi.<verse eid="ISA 49:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ISA 49:26" />Naxee wo ɲaxankatama, e fama nɛ e yɛtɛ sube donde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">e siisima nɛ e yɛtɛ wuli ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">Na kui ibunadama birin a kolonma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 49:26">a n tan nan Alatala ra, wo Rakisima, wo Xunsarama, Yaxuba xa Sɛnbɛma.»<verse eid="ISA 49:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="ISA 50" />
  <para style="s">Yunubi sare</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 50:1" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">«N kɛɛdi mundun sɛbɛxi n xa mɛɛ wo nga ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">N sare mundun sɔtɔxi wo matife ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">Wo matixi wo yɛtɛ xa yunubie nan ma fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:1">N mɛɛxi wo nga ra a xa matandi nan ma.<verse eid="ISA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 50:2" />Munfe ra wo mu n yaabima?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Munfe ra wo mu tima n ya ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Wo a maɲɔxunxi nɛ n bɛlɛxɛ mu fata wo fulunde?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">Wo a maɲɔxunxi nɛ n sɛnbɛ mu nɔma wo rakiside?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">N ma wɔyɛn keren nɔma baa xarade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:2">N nɔma xure findide gbengberenyi ra, yɛxɛe xa faxa, e xa bɔrɔ.<verse eid="ISA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 50:3" />N fata koore rafɔɔrɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:3">alɔ mixi na kaaɲɛ dugi ragoroxi a ma.»<verse eid="ISA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 50:4" />N Marigi Alatala bara masenyi so n yi ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">naxan nɔma mixi taganxi malide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">A n na naxunuma gɛɛsɛgɛ birin, a n tuli ibama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:4">alako n xa n tuli mati a ra alɔ xarandi fanyi.<verse eid="ISA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 50:5" />N Marigi Alatala bara n tuli rabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:5">n tan mu tondima birade a fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="ISA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 50:6" />N nan n fari tima nɛ n yaxuie xa n bɔnbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">N na n xɛrɛ fan tima nɛ e xa n dɛ xabe matala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">N mu n ya tagi nɔxun e xa konbie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:6">n mu tondi e xa e dɛ ye bɔxun n ma.<verse eid="ISA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 50:7" />N Marigi Alatala to n mali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">n mu yaagi, n mu n gi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:7">N luma nɛ alɔ fanye, barima n a kolon n mu luma yaagi kui.<verse eid="ISA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 50:8" />Naxan n gbe ɲɔxɔma a na n sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Nde wama n sɔnxɔfe? Won xa wɔyɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:8">Nde wama n kalamufe? Kiiti xa sa.<verse eid="ISA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 50:9" />N Marigi Alatala nan n malife.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">Nde nɔma a ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:9">E xa kalamui kanama nɛ alɔ dugi fori teese naxan donma.<verse eid="ISA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 50:10" />Nde gaaxuma Alatala ya ra wo ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">a Ala xa konyi xui suxu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">Naxan birin na ɲɛrɛfe dimi xɔɔra naiyalanyi xanbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:10">a xa a xaxili ti Alatala xili ra, a la a ra.<verse eid="ISA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 50:11" />N xa a fala wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">wo tan naxee tɛ radɛxɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">wo fa tanbɛ raxaɲɛnma gere xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 50:11">N fama nɛ wo tɔɔrɔde a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 50:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="ISA 51" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila fatanxi dɛnnaxɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 51:1" />«Wo wo tuli mati n na, wo tan naxee tinxinyi nun Alatala fenfe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:1">Wo xa wo ya ti fanye ra Alatala wo raminixi dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 51:2" />Wo xa wo ya ti wo baba Iburahima nun wo nga Sara ra naxee wo barixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">N to a xili a keren nan nu a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">kɔnɔ n to gɛ dubade a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:2">a findi nɛ bɔnsɔɛ wuyaxi benba ra.<verse eid="ISA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 51:3" />Alatala Siyon madunduma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">a kinikini a xa kasarɛ birin ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">Alatala a xa gbengberenyi findima nɛ yire fanyi ra alɔ Eden bɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">a a xa bɔxi ratofanma nɛ alɔ a darixi a ra ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">Sɛɛwɛ nun ɲɛlɛxinyi lu naa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:3">suuki nun bɛɛti ba tɛmui birin.»<verse eid="ISA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 51:4" />«N ma ɲama, wo wo tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">N ma si, wo xa n xui ramɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">Sɛriyɛ fatanxi n tan nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:4">n ma kiiti tinxinxi findima nɛ naiyalanyi ra sie bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 51:5" />N ma kiiti tinxinxi bara makɔrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">n ma kisi na fafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:5">sie fama nɛ e xaxili tide n sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 51:6" />Wo wo ya rate koore ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Mɛnni lɔɛma nɛ alɔ foye tuuri ralɔɛma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Wo wo ya ti bɔxi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Mɛnni ɲɔnma nɛ alɔ dugi fori.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Mɛnnikae faxama nɛ alɔ tugitugi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">Kɔnɔ n ma kisi tan abadan nan a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:6">n ma tinxinyi mu kanama.»<verse eid="ISA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 51:7" />«Wo xa wo tuli mati n xui ra, wo naxan kolon tinxinyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">N ma sɛriyɛ sabatixi wo bɔɲɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">Wo naxa gaaxu mixie xa mabere ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:7">wo naxa wo gi e xa sɔnxɔɛ ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 51:8" />Nimase xunxurie e donma nɛ alɔ dugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">teese e raɲɔn alɔ gɛsɛ fute.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">Kɔnɔ n ma tinxinyi buma nɛ abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:8">n ma kisi luma nɛ bɔnsɔɛ ya ma tɛmui birin.»<verse eid="ISA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 51:9" />Alatala, i xa keli sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">I xa keli alɔ singe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:9">I tan xa mu Misirakae bɔnbɔ alɔ wulai sube magaaxuxi?<verse eid="ISA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 51:10" />I tan xa mu baa xungbe raxɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:10">i fa kira ibɔɔ baa tagi i xa mixi rakisixie dangima dɛnnaxɛ?<verse eid="ISA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 51:11" />Alatala xa mixi xɔrɛyaxie gbilenma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">e fa so Siyon kui bɛɛti ra, sɛɛwɛ nan luma e bɛ abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">E bɔɲɛ rafanxi e ma, ɲɛlɛxinyi luma nɛ e sondonyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:11">Nimisɛ nun yaye makuyama nɛ e ra.<verse eid="ISA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 51:12" />«N tan nan wo bɔɲɛ madunduma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">Nde nɔma gaaxude adamadi ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:12">naxan faxama, naxan ɲɔnma alɔ sɛxɛ?<verse eid="ISA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 51:13" />Munfe ra wo fa nɛɛmuxi wo daalima Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">naxan koore italaxi, a bɔxi bunyi sa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">Munfe ra wo luma gaaxui kui tɛmui birin wo yaxuie ya ra naxee wama wo tɔɔrɔfe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:13">Wo gaaxuma e ya ra munfe ra?<verse eid="ISA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 51:14" />A gbe mu luxi, wo xa geelimanie fama nɛ xɔrɛya sɔtɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:14">e mu faxama geeli kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:14">e mu faxama kaamɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 51:15" />N tan nan na wo Marigi Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">naxan baa imaxama, a mɔrɔnyie ramini.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:15">N xili nɛ Alatala Sɛnbɛma.<verse eid="ISA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 51:16" />N nan n ma masenyi saxi nɛ i dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">n na n bɛlɛxɛ ti i xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">n tan naxan koore itala, n bɔxi bunyi sa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:16">naxan Siyonkae xilima, ‹N ma ɲama.›»<verse eid="ISA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 51:17" />«Darisalamukae, wo keli keren na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">wo tan naxee Alatala xa minse xɔrɔxɔɛ minxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">wo tan naxee a xa xɔnɛ kolonxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:17">a to din wo ra, a fa a lu wo xa bira alɔ siisilae.<verse eid="ISA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 51:18" />A xa di yo mu nu na naxan a malima a xa ɲɛrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:18">naxan lu a sɛɛti ma a suxufe ra.<verse eid="ISA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 51:19" />Na gbaloe xɔrɔxɔɛ bara wo sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">kasarɛ nun sɔntɔɛ, kaamɛ nun gere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:19">nde nɔma wo madundude?<verse eid="ISA 51:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 51:20" />Wo xa die bara bira, e saxi kira xunyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">alɔ xeli naxan suxuxi yɛlɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">Alatala xa xɔnɛ bara din e ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:20">a bara e ɲaxankata a ɲaaxi ra.»<verse eid="ISA 51:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 51:21" />Na kui wo tan tɔɔrɔmixie, wo xa wo tuli mati yi masenyi ra</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:21">wo tan naxee luxi alɔ siisilae beere xanbi.<verse eid="ISA 51:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 51:22" />Wo Marigi Alatala naxan a xa ɲama makantama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">a xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">«Awa, n mu xɔnɔxi wo ma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:22">na xɔnɛ mu wo lima sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 51:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 51:23" />N ma xɔnɛ sigama wo yaxuie nan ma naxee bara wo tɔɔrɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">e fa a fala ‹Wo wo felen bɔxi ma, muxu xa ti wo fari.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 51:23">E bara wo tɔɔrɔ na ki, e fa ɲɛrɛ wo fari alɔ bɔxi.»<verse eid="ISA 51:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="ISA 52" />
  <para style="s">Xibaaru fanyi Darisalamu bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 52:1" />Siyonikae, wo xa keli sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">wo xa dugi tofanyi ragoro wo ma, wo tan taa sɛniyɛnxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:1">Sunnataree nun sɛniyɛntaree mu soma wo xɔnyi sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 52:2" />Darisalamukae, wo xa keli, wo xube ba wo ma, wo dɔxɔ kibanyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:2">Yɔlɔnxɔnyi xa ba wo kɔnyi ma.<verse eid="ISA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 52:3" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:3">«E wo matixi nɛ fufafu, wo xun mu sarama kɔbiri ra.»<verse eid="ISA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 52:4" />Alatala Sɛnbɛma xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:4">«Singe n ma ɲama nu na Misira bɔxi nan ma konyiya kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:4">Na dangi xanbi, Asiriyakae naxa e ɲaxankata, e e xanin.<verse eid="ISA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 52:5" />Yakɔsi na findixi munse ra n bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">E bara n ma ɲama xanin fufafu, e fa yo e ma e xa yaamari kui.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:5">«Tɛmui birin n xili na kanafe.<verse eid="ISA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 52:6" />Na kui n bara natɛ tongo a n ma ɲama fama nɛ n xili kolonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:6">e fa a kolon a n tan nan yi masenyi tixi, a n tan nan na e sɛɛti ma.»<verse eid="ISA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 52:7" />Xɛɛra tofe fa ra geya fari, fe fanyi na a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">A fama nɛ xibaaru fanyi ra naxan bɔɲɛsa fima mixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">naxan findima kisi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:7">naxan a masenma Siyoni bɛ, «Wo Marigi Ala nan mangɛ ra!»<verse eid="ISA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 52:8" />Wo wo tuli mati wo kantamae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">e bara e xui ite sɛɛwɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:8">Alatala na gbilen Siyoni, e fama nɛ a tode e yae ra.<verse eid="ISA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 52:9" />Darisalamukae, wo birin xa wo xui ite sɛɛwɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">barima Alatala na a xa ɲama mayotofe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:9">a na Darisalamu xun sarafe.<verse eid="ISA 52:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 52:10" />Alatala na a sɛnbɛ sɛniyɛnxi masenfe ɲamanɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:10">Duniɲa birin fama nɛ Alatala xa kisi tode.<verse eid="ISA 52:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 52:11" />Wo siga, wo siga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Wo naxa wo maso se sɛniyɛntare yo ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">Wo xa mini na kui sɛniyɛnyi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:11">wo tan naxee hɔrɔmɔlingira see xaninma Alatala bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 52:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 52:12" />Kɔntɔfili naxa a niya wo xa gbata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">gaaxui naxa a niya wo xa wo gi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">barima Alatala nan tixi wo ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:12">Isirayila Marigi Ala nan tixi wo xanbi ra.<verse eid="ISA 52:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 52:13" />«N ma konyi xa fe sɔɔnɛyama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:13">a xa fe te, a xun nakeli, a tide xungbe sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 52:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 52:14" />A xa fe magore findima tɛrɛnna nan na mixi gbegbe bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:14">a lahalɛ mafindi, a mu lu adama ki ma sɔnɔn,<verse eid="ISA 52:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 52:15" />a man mangɛe dɛ ixarama nɛ marasɛniyɛnyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">a naxan fima bɔnsɔɛ gbegbe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">E findima nɛ seedee ra fe nde ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">e mu naxan singe toxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">e fahaamui sɔtɔma nɛ fe nde xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 52:15">e mu naxan singe mɛxi.»<verse eid="ISA 52:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="ISA 53" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa konyi findife sɛrɛxɛ ra</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 53:1" />Nde laxi won ma masenyi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:1">Nde Alatala sɛnbɛ toxi?<verse eid="ISA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 53:2" />A xa konyi lu nɛ alɔ sansi xuri, naxan tixi bɔxi xare ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:2">A to ki mu nu rayabu, a xa tofanyi mu gbo.<verse eid="ISA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 53:3" />Mixi raɲaaxuxi nan nu a ra ɲama mu tinxi naxan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">Tɔɔrɔmixi nan nu a ra, naxan darixi ɲaxankatɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">Mixie mu tinxi e ya tide a bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:3">E nu yo a ma, e mu tide yo fixi a ma.<verse eid="ISA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 53:4" />A bara won ma tɔɔrɛ findi a gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">a bara won ma kɔntɔfili findi a gbe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">Won tan bara a maɲɔxun a Ala nan a dankaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:4">a a xa tɔɔrɛ fatanxi Ala nan na.<verse eid="ISA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 53:5" />Kɔnɔ a sɔxɔ nɛ won ma yunubie xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">a butuxun won ma ɲaaxuɲa xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">A ɲaxankatɛ sɔtɔ nɛ alako won xa yalanyi sɔtɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:5">a xa fie findixi kisi nan na won bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 53:6" />Won birin nu lɔɛxi nɛ alɔ xuruse naxee yensenma wula i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">kankan naxa siga a xa kira xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:6">Kɔnɔ Alatala bara won ma yunubie kote dɔxɔ a xun.<verse eid="ISA 53:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 53:7" />Tɔɔrɛ nun fe xɔrɔxɔɛ to a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">a mu a dɛ rabi hali keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">A lu nɛ alɔ yɛxɛɛ naxan xaninfe a faxade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">A a sabari nɛ tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:7">alɔ yɛxɛɛ xabe maxaba tɛmui.<verse eid="ISA 53:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 53:8" />A to gɛ kiiti tinxintare sɔtɔde, a naxa faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">Nde nɔ a bade duniɲa mixie yi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:8">A ɲaxankataxi n ma ɲama xa yunubie nan ma fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 53:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 53:9" />E nu wama a fure ragatafe mixi ɲaaxie nan ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">kɔnɔ a raɲɔnyi a ragata mixi bannaxie nan ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:9">barima a mu mixi tɔɔrɔ, a mu mixi madaxu.<verse eid="ISA 53:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 53:10" />Alatala bara natɛ tongo a xa a ɲaxankata tɔɔrɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">kɔnɔ sɛrɛxɛ na ba yunubie xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">a fama nɛ a bɔnsɔɛ tode, a bu abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:10">Alatala waxɔnfe rakamalima a tan nan saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 53:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 53:11" />A na gɛ a xa wali rabade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">a fama nɛ sɛɛwade.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 53:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">«N ma konyi tinxinxi ɲama findima nɛ tinxintɔɛe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:11">a e xun sara e xa yunubie xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 53:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 53:12" />N tide xungbe soma nɛ a yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">a xunnakeli sare sɔtɔ sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">a to faxa matandilae yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 53:12">a nu bara a yɛtɛ fi sɛrɛxɛ ra mixi gbegbe xa yunubie xa fe ra.»<verse eid="ISA 53:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="ISA 54" />
  <para style="s">Siyoni xa xunnakeli</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 54:1" />«Dibaritare, naxee mu nɔma di baride, wo xa sɛɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">wo xa bɛɛti ba, wo tan naxee mu di sɔtɔxi sinden.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">Wo fama nɛ di wuyaxi sɔtɔde dangife ginɛ gbɛtɛe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:1">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.»<verse eid="ISA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 54:2" />«Wo xa wo xɔnyi raxungbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">wo xa nde sa wo xa banxie xa gboe xun,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:2">wo xa na birin yailan a fanyi ra,<verse eid="ISA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 54:3" />barima wo yiriwama nɛ yirefanyi nun kɔɔla ma wo xa bɔxi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:3">Wo xa mixie ɲamanɛ nde mixie kerima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:3">e fa sabati e xa taae kui.<verse eid="ISA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 54:4" />Hali wo mu hanmɛ, wo mu yaagi yo sɔtɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">Wo naxa gaaxu na ya ra, wo xa fe mu ragoroma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">Wo fama nɛ nɛɛmude na yaagi xa fe ra wo naxan sɔtɔ wo fonike tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:4">wo mu lu ra maɲɔxun na wo xa kaaɲɛ fe ra,<verse eid="ISA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 54:5" />barima wo Daali Mangɛ mɛɛnima wo ma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">alɔ xɛmɛ mɛɛnima a xa ginɛ ma ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">naxan xili falama wo Marigi Alatala Sɛnbɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">naxan findixi Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">naxan wo Rakisima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:5">naxan xili Ala duniɲa kanyi.<verse eid="ISA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 54:6" />Alatala fama nɛ wo ragbilende a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">alɔ ginɛ naxan nu bara rabolo, a fa lu tɔɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">alɔ sungbutunyi naxan xa mɔri bara mɛɛ a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:6">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.»<verse eid="ISA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 54:7" />«Ala naxɛ, ‹N i rabolo nɛ tɛmui dunke di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:7">kɔnɔ n man i masoma nɛ n na n ma xanunteya xungbe kui.<verse eid="ISA 54:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 54:8" />N i keri bɔɲɛte xungbe nan kui tɛmui dunke di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">kɔnɔ n man kinikinima nɛ i ma marafanyi kui abadan.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:8">N tan Alatala wo kantama xa masenyi nan na ki.»<verse eid="ISA 54:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 54:9" />«A luma nɛ n bɛ alɔ Nuha xa tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">n to n kali a banbaranyi mu duniɲa kanama sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:9">N bara n kali a n mu xɔnɔma wo ma, n mu wo sɔntɔma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 54:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 54:10" />Hali geyae sa sɛrɛnfe nɛ, tentenyie naxa gira a ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">n ma xanunteya mu nɔma xurunde wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">n mu ma bɔɲɛsa saatɛ kanama n naxan tongoxi won bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:10">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki naxan kinikinima wo ma.»<verse eid="ISA 54:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 54:11" />«Wo tan bɔnsɔɛ ɲaxankataxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">naxee bara tɔɔrɔ kinikinitareɲa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">n man wo xa taa tima nɛ gɛmɛ fanyi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:11">n wo raxunma diyaman na,<verse eid="ISA 54:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 54:12" />N wo xa yire itexi yailanma gɛmɛ tofanyie nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:12">n wo xa naadɛe raxunma gɛmɛ rayabuxie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:12">n wo xa tɛtɛ ti gɛmɛ yanbaxie ra.<verse eid="ISA 54:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 54:13" />Wo xa die birin birama nɛ Alatala fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:13">e xa fe birin sɔɔnɛya.<verse eid="ISA 54:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 54:14" />N to wo gbe ɲɔxɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">wo man fama nɛ tide sɛnbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">Wo yaxuie mu wo tɔɔrɔma sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">wo mu luma gaaxui kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:14">Wo mu gaaxuma fefe ya ra sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 54:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 54:15" />Xa gere sa bula wo xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">na mu kelixi n tan xa ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:15">N xa a fala wo bɛ, wo gerefae xa fe kanama nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 54:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 54:16" />N tan nan xabui daa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">naxan wure raxunuma tɛ ra, a fa geresose yailan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:16">Na kui n man fa sɔɔri daa, naxan a yaxuie xa fe kanama.<verse eid="ISA 54:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 54:17" />Kɔnɔ geresose naxan birin yailanxi wo tan xili ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">n a niyama nɛ e mu wo li fefe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Naxan yo wo tɔɔɲɛgɛ, kiiti nan kanama na kanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Alatala a xa konyie gbe ɲɔxɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 54:17">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.»<verse eid="ISA 54:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="ISA 55" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa kisi ibunadama bɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 55:1" />«Ye xɔli na wo tan naxee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">wo fa ye yire, wo xa fa ye min.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">Hali kɔbiri mu na wo yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">wo fa, wo xa fa donse sɔtɔ, wo xa wo dɛge.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:1">Wo fa, wo xa wɛni nun xiɲɛ min hali wo mu a sare fi.<verse eid="ISA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 55:2" />Munfe ra wo kɔbiri bama see xa fe ra naxee mu findi baloe ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">Munfe ra wo wali rabama naxan tide mu na wo bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">Wo wo tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:2">wo xa wo balo fe fanyi ra naxan sɛɛwɛ fima wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 55:3" />Wo wo tuli mati n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">wo xa fa n yire alako wo xa baloe sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">Na kui n fama xanunteya saatɛ xiride won tagi naxan mu kanama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:3">Na luma nɛ alɔ n saatɛ naxan xiri Annabi Dawuda nun n tan tagi a sɛriyɛ ki ma,<verse eid="ISA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 55:4" />n naxan tixi seede ra sie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:4">a findi mangɛ xungbe ra e bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 55:5" />Wo fama nɛ sie xilide wo mu naxee kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">sie fama nɛ wo yire naxee mu nu wo kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:5">barima wo Marigi Alatala, Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ fama nɛ binyɛ fide wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 55:6" />Wo xa gbilen Alatala ma, a to nɔma tode.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:6">Wo xa a xili, a to na yire makɔrɛxi.<verse eid="ISA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 55:7" />Mixi ɲaaxi xa gbilen a xa kira kobi fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">yunubitɔɛ xa a xa natɛ lu naa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">A xa gbilen won Marigi Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">alako a xa kinikini a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:7">a xa a xa yunubie xafari.<verse eid="ISA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 55:8" />N ma maɲɔxunyie nun wo tan xa maɲɔxunyie, e keren mu a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:8">N ma kirae nun wo xa kirae fan, e keren mu a ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:8">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.»<verse eid="ISA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 55:9" />«Koore makuyaxi bɔxi ra ki naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">n ma kira makuyaxi wo gbee ra na ki nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:9">N ma maɲɔxunyie makuya wo gbee ra pon.<verse eid="ISA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 55:10" />Tunɛ na goro bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:10">a mu gbilenma fo a bɔxi bunda, a sansie rafan, naxee adamadie birin nabaloma.<verse eid="ISA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 55:11" />N ma masenyi fan na na ki nɛ naxan minima n dɛ i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">A mu gbilenma n ma fo a n sagoe rakamali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:11">a n waxɔnfe raba, n a xɛɛxi naxan ma.<verse eid="ISA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 55:12" />Wo minima sɛɛwɛ nun bɔɲɛsa nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">geyae yati ɲɛlɛxinyi sigi sama nɛ wo ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:12">daaxa sansie e bɛlɛxɛ bɔnbɔma nɛ wo bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 55:13" />Sipirɛ wuri bulama nɛ tunbe sansi nu na dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">wuri gbɛtɛe bulama nɛ ɲooge ɲaaxi nu na dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">Na birin findima tɔnxuma nan na Alatala xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 55:13">tɔnxuma naxan mu kanama abadan.»<verse eid="ISA 55:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="ISA 56" />
  <para style="s">Bɔnsɔɛ gbɛtɛe kisi sɔtɔfe</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 56:1" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">«Wo bira nɔndi nun tinxinyi fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">barima n ma kisi na fafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:1">a gbe mu luxi n ma tinxinyi xa to.<verse eid="ISA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 56:2" />Baraka na mixi bɛ naxan walima na ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">naxan na sɛriyɛ suxuma a fanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">naxan a ɲɔxɔ sama malabu lɔxɔɛ xa fe xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:2">a mu a mabere, a mu a bɛlɛxɛ ti wali ɲaaxi ma.»<verse eid="ISA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 56:3" />«Xɔɲɛ naxan a xaxili ti Alatala ra, na naxa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">‹Alatala n bama nɛ a xa ɲama ya ma n ma xɔɲɛya xa fe ra.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">Mixi banaxi naxa a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:3">‹N luxi nɛ Ala bɛ alɔ wuri xaraxi naxan tide mu gbo.›»<verse eid="ISA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 56:4" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">«Mixi banaxi naxee e ɲɔxɔ sama malabui lɔxɔɛ xa fe xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">naxee n waxɔnfe rabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:4">naxee n ma saatɛ mabanbanma,<verse eid="ISA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 56:5" />n tɔnxuma nde tima nɛ nee bɛ n ma banxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">naxan tide dangi di barife ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">N e xili xungboma nɛ abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:5">na binyɛ mu bama e ma fefe ma.<verse eid="ISA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 56:6" />Xɔɲɛ naxee e xaxili tima Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">e bira a xili fɔxɔ ra xanunteya kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">e a batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">e e ɲɔxɔ sa a xa malabui lɔxɔɛ xa fe xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">e mu a mabere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:6">naxee n ma saatɛ mabanbanma,<verse eid="ISA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 56:7" />n e xaninma nɛ n ma geya sɛniyɛnxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">e xa sɛɛwa n ma banxi kui mixi n maxandima dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">N e xa sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi nun e xa sɛrɛxɛ gbɛtɛe suxuma nɛ n ma sɛrɛxɛbade fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:7">barima n ma banxi xili falama nɛ ‹Salide banxi si birin bɛ.›<verse eid="ISA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 56:8" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya, Ala naxan Isirayila di rayensenxie malanma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:8">a naxɛ, ‹N man e malanma nɛ n yire.›»<verse eid="ISA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 56:9" />Wo tan sube naxee na burunyi, wo fa wo dɛ madon.<verse eid="ISA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 56:10" />E kantamae luxi nɛ alɔ dɔnxuie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">e mu gɛxi fahaamui sɔtɔde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">E luxi nɛ alɔ bare naxee mu nɔma wonwonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:10">e saxi tɛmui birin, xi xɔli nan tun ɲɔxun e bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 56:11" />E luxi nɛ alɔ bare naxee mu lugama e xa donse ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">E luxi nɛ alɔ xuruse kantɛe naxee mu gɛxi fahaamui sɔtɔde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:11">kankan biraxi a yɛtɛ xa kira nan fɔxɔ ra geeni xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 56:12" />E a falama e booree bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">«Wo fa, won xa beere fen, won xa sisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">Tina fan won xa gbilen na raba ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 56:12">Tɛmunde tina fama nɛ fisade to bɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 56:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="ISA 57" />
  <para style="s">Bɔɲɛsa kanyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 57:1" />Tinxintɔɛ na saya kira xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">kɔnɔ mixi yo mu a ɲɔxɔ sa na hinnɛtɔɛ xa fe xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:1">Mixie mu a kolon a Ala nan tinxintɔɛe bama tɔɔrɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 57:2" />Naxan luma tinxinyi xa kira xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:2">a malabui fanyi sɔtɔma nɛ yare.<verse eid="ISA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 57:3" />«Kɔnɔ wo tan sematoe bɔnsɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:3">naxee fatanxi yɛnɛ nun langoeɲa ra, wo fa be.<verse eid="ISA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 57:4" />Wo nde mayelefe? Wo nde maberefe wo dɛ ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:4">Matandilae nan wo ra naxee fatanxi wule falɛe ra.<verse eid="ISA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 57:5" />Wo yɛnɛ rabama wurie bun ma mixi kuyee batuma dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:5">Wo die faxama sɛrɛxɛ ra fole kui na kuyee bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 57:6" />Na kuyee findixi wo xa alae nan na wo birama naxee fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">Wo minse sɛrɛxɛ bama e bɛ, wo sansi xɔri fima e ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:6">A mu lanma n xa n gbe ɲɔxɔ na fe ma?»<verse eid="ISA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 57:7" />«Wo bara sade yailan geya fari wo sɛrɛxɛe bama dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 57:8" />Wo wo xa kuye tɔnxumae tima wo xa naadɛ sɛɛti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">Wo bara gbilen n tan fɔxɔ ra, wo fa kuyee xili e xa sa wo fɛ ma sade ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:8">Wo to gɛ saatɛ xiride wo bore tagi, wo naxa sade fe raba.<verse eid="ISA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 57:9" />Wo bara ture nun labundɛ xanin wo xa mangɛ xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:9">wo bara xɛɛrae xɛɛ han aligiyama.<verse eid="ISA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 57:10" />Na birin findixi taganyi nan na wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">kɔnɔ wo man tondixi gbilende na fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:10">Wo wo sɛnbɛ nan tun sofe, lufe ra na kira xɔn ma.»<verse eid="ISA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 57:11" />«Pe, wo kɔntɔfilixi nde xa fe ra, naxan a niyama wo xa nɛɛmu n ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">Wo gaaxuxi nde ya ra, naxan a niyama wo mu n ma fe mato sɔnɔn?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">Munse a niyaxi wo xa n yanfa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:11">N to dunduxi a xɔnkuye ra, na nan a niyaxi wo mu gaaxuxi n ya ra sɔnɔn?<verse eid="ISA 57:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 57:12" />N wo makiitima nɛ wo xa wali ma, wo naxan xilima wali fanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:12">Na mu fanma wo bɛ fefe ma.<verse eid="ISA 57:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 57:13" />Wo xa wo xa kuyee xili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Won xa a mato xa e nɔma wo malide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Foye e xaninma nɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">Kɔnɔ naxan yo na a xaxili ti n tan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">a yi bɔxi sɔtɔma nɛ kɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:13">a te n ma geya sɛniyɛnxi nan fari.»<verse eid="ISA 57:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 57:14" />Alatala a falama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:14">«Wo wakili, wo xa kira yailan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:14">wo xa se ɲaaxi birin ba n ma ɲama ya ra!»<verse eid="ISA 57:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 57:15" />Marigi Ala, naxan ma fe mu kanama abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">naxan xili sɛniyɛn, a xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">«N sabatixi koore nan na sɛniyɛnyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">N mixi xilima nɛ n sɛɛti ma naxan bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">naxan bara a yɛtɛ magoro.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">N wama e ralimaniyafe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:15">n wama e xun nakelife.<verse eid="ISA 57:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 57:16" />N mu wama n ma xɔnɛ xa bu e fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:16">xa na mu n na n xaxili fixi mixi naxee ma, nee taganma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 57:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 57:17" />Isirayila to mila yunubi rabafe ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">n naxa e ɲaxankata, n e rabolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:17">kɔnɔ e xa murutɛ nan tun xun nu masama.<verse eid="ISA 57:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 57:18" />N bara e wali ki yati to,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:18">kɔnɔ n e dandanma nɛ, n e mali, n e bɔɲɛ dɔxɔ,<verse eid="ISA 57:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 57:19" />alako e man xa bɛɛti ba n bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">N tan Alatala naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">‹Bɔɲɛsa xa lu yire makuyekae bɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:19">N e rayalanma nɛ.›<verse eid="ISA 57:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 57:20" />Kɔnɔ mixi ɲaaxie tan luma nɛ alɔ baa mɔrɔnyie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:20">naxee mu raxara, naxee nɔxɔɛ tun natema.<verse eid="ISA 57:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 57:21" />N tan Alatala naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 57:21">‹Bɔɲɛsa yo mu na mixi ɲaaxie tan bɛ.›»<verse eid="ISA 57:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="ISA 58" />
  <para style="s">Sunyi fanyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 58:1" />«I xa i xui ite alɔ sara fe xui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">a falafe ra n ma ɲama bɛ e bara muruta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:1">Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ bara yunubi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 58:2" />Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ e ya rafindixi n ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">A luxi nɛ alɔ e wama n waxɔnyi nan kolonfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">alɔ ɲama naxan wama tinxinyi xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">naxan mu gbilenxi Ala xa yaamari fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">E n maxandima kiiti tinxinxi safe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:2">a luxi nɛ alɔ e na wa Ala xa makɔrɛ e ra.»<verse eid="ISA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 58:3" />«Kɔnɔ e a falama, ‹Munfe ra muxu sunma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">kɔnɔ i mu a suxuma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">Munfe ra muxu muxu suyidima i bɛ, kɔnɔ i mu a toma?›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">N xa a fala wo bɛ wo xa sunyi kui wo wo yɛtɛ waxɔnfe nan tun nabama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:3">wo kote xɔrɔxɔɛ dɔxɔ wo xa walikɛe xun ma.<verse eid="ISA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 58:4" />Wo sunxi tɛmui naxɛ, wo wo bore gerema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">wo sɔnxɔɛ ratema, wo wo bore bɔnbɔ mixi kobiɲa kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:4">N mu na sunyi mɔɔli suxuma feo!<verse eid="ISA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 58:5" />N wama sunyi naxan xɔn, na findima mixi xa suyidi nan tun na?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Mixi a tigi tife bɔxi, alɔ maale mɔxi foye naxan ramaxama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">na keren findima sunyi ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">Sunnunyi dugi ragorofe mixi ma, xube tefe mixi xunyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:5">na xili falama sunyi fanyi naxan nafan Alatala ma?»<verse eid="ISA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 58:6" />«N wama sunyi mɔɔli naxan xɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">wo xa gbilen tinxintareya fɔxɔ ra, wo xa kote xɔrɔxɔɛ ba mixi xun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:6">Geelimani xa xɔrɛya, kote xɔrɔxɔɛ xa ba mixi xun ma.<verse eid="ISA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 58:7" />Wo xa donse fi kaamɛtɔɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">wo xa xide fi mixi ma a mu naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">wo xa dugi ragoro mixi ma a mu naxan yi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:7">wo naxa a lu wo ngaxakerenyi xa siga a bɛlɛxɛ igeli ra.<verse eid="ISA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 58:8" />Na kui wo yanbama nɛ alɔ subaxɛ looloe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">wo yalanma mafuren mafuren,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">wo xa tinxinyi kolonma nɛ wo ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:8">Alatala xa nɔrɛ wo kantama nɛ wo xanbi ra.<verse eid="ISA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 58:9" />Na tɛmui wo Alatala maxandima nɛ, a fa na suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">Wo na a xili a xa wo mali, a wo xa xili ratinma nɛ, ‹N na be.›»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">«Xa wo mu mixi tɔɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:9">xa wo mu mixi tɔɔɲɛgɛma,<verse eid="ISA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 58:10" />xa wo kaamɛtɔɛ malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">xa wo tɔɔrɔmixi kima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:10">na kui wo yanbama nɛ dimi kui, wo fa dimi kana alɔ soge yanyi tagi.<verse eid="ISA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 58:11" />Alatala wo raɲɛrɛma nɛ tɛmui birin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">a wo hayi fanma nɛ wo bɛ hali tɛmui xɔrɔxɔɛ kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">A sɛnbɛ fima nɛ wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:11">wo fa lu alɔ laakɔɛ ye mu xɔrima naxan ma.<verse eid="ISA 58:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 58:12" />Wo xa ɲama fama nɛ wo xa yire kanaxie tide alɔ a singe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:12">E fama nɛ wo xili falade, ‹Taa bilitie, banxitie, nun taa yalanmae.›»<verse eid="ISA 58:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 58:13" />«Xa wo malabui lɔxɔɛ sɛriyɛ rabatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">xa wo mu wo waxɔnfe raba n ma lɔxɔɛ sɛniyɛnxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">xa wo sɛɛwa na lɔxɔɛ xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:13">wo a binya wo xa ɲɛrɛ ki fanyi ra, wo mu tin wɔyɛnyi fufafu ra,<verse eid="ISA 58:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 58:14" />na kui wo fama nɛ sɛɛwade Alatala xa fe kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">n fa wo xa fe ite wo xa bɔxi fanyi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">wo xa ɲɛlɛxinyi na wo benba Yaxuba kɛ nan na.»</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 58:14" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 58:14">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 58:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="ISA 59" />
  <para style="s">Tinxintareɲa raɲɔnyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 59:1" />Alatala fata wo rakiside,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:1">a fata wo xa duba ramɛde,<verse eid="ISA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 59:2" />kɔnɔ wo xa wali ɲaaxi nan wo makuyaxi wo Marigi Ala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:2">wo xa yunubie nan a yatagi nɔxunxi wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:2">Na nan a ra, a mu wo xa maxandi suxuma.<verse eid="ISA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 59:3" />Wuli na wo bɛlɛxɛe ma, yunubi na wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:3">Wo wule falama, fe ɲaaxi na wo dɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 59:4" />Mixi yo mu birama kiiti tinxinxi fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">nɔndi tide mu na wo xa kiitife kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">Wo birama wɔyɛnyi fufafu nan fɔxɔ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:4">wo wulee falama naxee tɔɔrɛ nun fe ɲaaxi raminima.<verse eid="ISA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 59:5" />Wo luxi nɛ alɔ bɔximase xɛlɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">Naxan na donma, a kanyi faxama nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">Na xalɛ na bula, bɔximase nan minima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:5">Wo luxi nɛ alɔ sayɛlɛ.<verse eid="ISA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 59:6" />A gɛsɛ mu findima dugi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">A naxan yailanma na mu nɔma a makotode.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:6">Fe ɲaaxi na a ra, naxan mu tinxin feo.<verse eid="ISA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 59:7" />E xulun fe ɲaaxi rabade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">e gbata mixi tɔɔɲɛgɛde, e a faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:7">E xa maɲɔxunyi kobi, e fe xun nakanama nan tun.<verse eid="ISA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 59:8" />E mu wama bɔɲɛsa xɔn ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">tinxinyi yo mu na e xa kira xɔn ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">E kira madalinxie nan yailanxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:8">naxan mixi xun tima tinxintareya xɔn.<verse eid="ISA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 59:9" />Na nan a ra, won makuyaxi tinxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">a mu nɔma won lide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">Won naiyalanyi nan fenma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">kɔnɔ dimi nan tun sinma won ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:9">Won kuye iba nan mamɛfe, kɔnɔ won luma kɔɛ tan nan kui.<verse eid="ISA 59:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 59:10" />Won na won santide fenfe alɔ dɔnxui naxan ɲɛrɛma a yire masuxu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">Won birama yanyi ra, alɔ won na ɲɛrɛfe dimi nan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:10">Won luxi nɛ alɔ mixi faxaxi sɛnbɛmae tagi.<verse eid="ISA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 59:11" />Won xurundunma alɔ burun subee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">won wa xui raminima alɔ ganbɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">Won gbe ɲɔxɔɛ nan fenfe, kɔnɔ won mu a sɔtɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:11">Won xaxili tixi kisi nan na, kɔnɔ a makuya won na.<verse eid="ISA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 59:12" />Muxu na na ki nɛ, barima muxu xa yunubie wuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">e findixi seede nan na muxu xilima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">Muxu xa yunubie toma nɛ muxu ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:12">muxu bara e kolon, muxu bara muxu ti e ra.<verse eid="ISA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 59:13" />Muxu bara i matandi, muxu bara i yanfa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">Muxu bara gbilen muxu Marigi Ala fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">Muxu bara fe xɔrɔxɔɛ dɔxɔ muxu ngaxakerenyie ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:13">muxu bara wule fala naxee fatanxi muxu bɔɲɛ kui.<verse eid="ISA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 59:14" />Muxu nun tinxinyi tagi ikuya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:14">Nɔndi mu toma won ya ma sɔnɔn. Yanfanteya gbo.<verse eid="ISA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 59:15" />Nɔndi to xɔnɔ, tinxintɔɛ nan tun tɔɔrɔma.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 59:15" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:15">Alatala to a to, a tinxinyi mu na sɔnɔn, na mu rafan a ma.<verse eid="ISA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 59:16" />A a toxi nɛ mixi yo mu nimisaxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">a a dɛ rawa Alatala xɔn ma na fe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:16">Na kui a bara na kisi wali suxu a yɛtɛ ra a xa tinxinyi xa fe ma.<verse eid="ISA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 59:17" />A xa tinxinyi luxi nɛ alɔ kanke makantase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">a xa kisi lu alɔ a xunyi makantase.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">Gbeɲɔxɔɛ luxi nɛ a bɛ alɔ donma a naxan nagoroma a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:17">a xa wakili lu a bɛ alɔ xinbeli donma.<verse eid="ISA 59:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 59:18" />Ala kankan sare fima nɛ a xa wali ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:18">a xɔnɔ a yaxuie ma yire makuye, a e sare fi.<verse eid="ISA 59:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 59:19" />Ibunadama gaaxuma nɛ Alatala xili ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">e a xa nɔrɛ binya kelife sogetede ma han sogegorode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:19">barima Alatala sɛnbɛ e lima nɛ alɔ ye naxan diki bɔɔma a ra.<verse eid="ISA 59:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 59:20" />«Xunsarama na fafe Siyon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:20">Yaxuba bɔnsɔɛ bɛ naxee tuubima e xa yunubie xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:20">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.»<verse eid="ISA 59:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 59:21" />Alatala naxɛ, «N ma saatɛ nan ya e bɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">‹N Xaxili naxan goroxi i ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">na n ma masenyi naxan saxi i dɛ i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">nee mu kelima wo xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">nee mu kelima wo xa die xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">nee mu kelima e fan xa die xun ma abadan.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 59:21">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.»<verse eid="ISA 59:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="ISA 60" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu xa dariyɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 60:1" />«Wo keli, wo xa naiyalanyi bara fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:1">Alatala xa nɔrɛ bara ti wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 60:2" />Dimi bara dusu bɔxi birin xun na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">kuye bara ifɔɔrɔ na ɲamae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">kɔnɔ Alatala bara ti wo xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:2">a xa nɔrɛ bara lu wo ya ma.<verse eid="ISA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 60:3" />Ɲamanɛe fama nɛ wo xa nɔrɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:3">mangɛe bɛndunma nɛ wo xa looloe xa yanbɛ ma.»<verse eid="ISA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 60:4" />«Wo wo ya rage wo rabilinyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">E birin malanxi wo yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">wo xa die fafe kelife yire makuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:4">wo xa di ginɛe dɔxɔxi mixie tunki fari.<verse eid="ISA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 60:5" />Wo na na to, wo sɛɛwama nɛ hɛri ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">wo bɔɲɛ ɲɛlɛxin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">Bannaya naxan na baa naakiri ma a findima nɛ wo gbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:5">ɲamanɛe xa bannaya fa lu wo xɔnyi.<verse eid="ISA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 60:6" />Ɲɔxɔmɛ gali wuyama nɛ wo xa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">fafe ra kelife Madiyan nun Efa bɔxi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">Naxee fama kelife Seeba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">e fama xɛɛma nun surayi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:6">e nu Alatala matɔxɔ.<verse eid="ISA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 60:7" />Kedari xa xurusee malanma nɛ wo xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">Nebayoti yɛxɛɛ kontonyie lu wo sagoe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">ndee ba sɛrɛxɛ gan daaxi ra n ma sɛrɛxɛbade fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:7">N ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi yanbama nɛ n ma nɔrɛ ra.»<verse eid="ISA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 60:8" />«Laaba fiixɛe ɲɛrɛma koore ma alɔ ganbɛ naxee gbilenma e xɔnyi.<verse eid="ISA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 60:9" />Ɲamanɛe xaxili tixi n na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">Tarasisi kunkuie na yare fafe ra wo xa die ra kelife yire makuye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">E fama nɛ gbeti nun xɛɛma ra wo Marigi Alatala binyafe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:9">Isirayila xa Sɛniyɛntɔɛ naxan bara wo xun nakeli.»<verse eid="ISA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 60:10" />«Xɔɲɛe yati fama nɛ wo xa tɛtɛ rakelide,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">ɲamanɛe mangɛe walima nɛ wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">Hali n to wo ɲaxankata n ma xɔnɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:10">n fama nɛ hinnɛde wo ra n ma kinikini xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 60:11" />Hali wo mu wo xa taa naadɛe balan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">barima mixie fama nɛ naafuli ra kelife ɲamanɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:11">e xa mangɛe tixi yare.<verse eid="ISA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 60:12" />Si yo naxan tondima walide wo bɛ, a xun nakanama nɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 60:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 60:13" />«Liban xa wuri fanyie xaninma nɛ wo xɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">alako n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:13">nɔrɛ xa lu n sanyi tide.<verse eid="ISA 60:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 60:14" />Wo gerefae xa die fama nɛ e yɛtɛ magorode wo bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">wo yaxuie e xinbi sin wo bun ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:14">E fama nɛ wo xili falade, ‹Siyoni, Isirayila Marigi Sɛniyɛnxi Alatala xa taa.›»<verse eid="ISA 60:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 60:15" />«Hali n wo rabolo nɛ nu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">mixi yo mu lu wo xa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">n fama nɛ wo findide si xungbe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:15">naxan luma xunnakeli kui abadan.<verse eid="ISA 60:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 60:16" />Ɲamanɛe xa mangɛe xiɲɛ fima nɛ wo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">Na kui wo a kolonma nɛ a n tan nan na Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:16">wo Rakisima, wo Xunsarama, Yaxuba Marigi Sɛnbɛma.<verse eid="ISA 60:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 60:17" />N xɛɛma fima nɛ wo ma wure gbeeli ɲɔxɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">n gbeti fi wo ma wure ɲɔxɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">n wure gbeeli fi wo ma wuri ɲɔxɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">n wure fi wo ma gɛmɛ ɲɔxɔɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:17">Bɔɲɛsa nun tinxinyi nan findima wo xa mangɛe ra.<verse eid="ISA 60:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 60:18" />Fe kobi mu toma wo xa bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">gbaloe mu wo xɔnyi lima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">Wo xa tɛtɛ xili falama nɛ ‹Kisi,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:18">wo xa taa naadɛ xili fala ‹Matɔxɔɛ.›<verse eid="ISA 60:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 60:19" />Soge xa mu yire iyalanma wo bɛ yanyi ra sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">kike xa mu yire iyalanma wo bɛ kɔɛ ra sɔnɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">A kelima Alatala yati nan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:19">a a xa nɔrɛ fima nɛ wo ma abadan.<verse eid="ISA 60:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 60:20" />Soge nun kike mu dulama sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">Alatala nan findima wo xa naiyalanyi ra tɛmui birin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:20">Wo xa sunnunyi tɛmui ɲɔnma nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 60:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 60:21" />Wo xa ɲama luma tinxinyi nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">wo xa bɔxi lu wo bɛ abadan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">Wo luxi nɛ alɔ sansi solie n naxee sixi n bɛlɛxɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:21">alako n xa n ma nɔrɛ masen duniɲa bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 60:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 60:22" />Hali wo xurun, wo sɛnbɛ luma nɛ alɔ gali belebele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">Alatala nan n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 60:22">N yi wali rabama nɛ mafuren mafuren.»<verse eid="ISA 60:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="ISA 61" />
  <para style="s">Ala xa xɛɛra kisixi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 61:1" />N Marigi Alatala Xaxili na n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">barima a bara n sugandi xibaaru fanyi kawandide tɔɔrɔmixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">n xa e bɔɲɛ nimisaxi rayalan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">A bara n xɛɛ geelimanie xɔrɛyade,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:1">n xa mixie ramini e xa dimi kui.<verse eid="ISA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 61:2" />N xa mixie rakolon a Alatala xa hinnɛ tɛmui bara fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:2">a e gbe ɲɔxɔma nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:2">A fama nɛ e madundude,<verse eid="ISA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 61:3" />a xa hinnɛ ra a naxan fima Siyonikae ma, naxee na sunnunyi kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">A dariyɛ fima nɛ e ma e xa tɔɔrɛ ɲɔxɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">a e wa xui madunduma sɛɛwɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">E xa nimisɛ findima matɔxɔɛ nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">E xili falama nɛ «Konde fanyi Alatala naxan sixi,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:3">alako a xa a nɔrɛ masen duniɲa ma.<verse eid="ISA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 61:4" />E e xa taa kanaxi yailanma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">e e xa tɛtɛ biraxi rakeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:4">e xa yire kanaxi fori findi yire fanyi ra.<verse eid="ISA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 61:5" />Xɔɲɛe fama nɛ wo xa xurusee dɛ madonde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:5">e wo xa xɛe rawalima nɛ.<verse eid="ISA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 61:6" />Wo tan xili falama nɛ «Alatala xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:6">naxee Ala xa wali rabama.»<verse eid="ISA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 61:7" />«N ma ɲama xa yaagi masarama hɛɛri gbegbe nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">e kɛ belebele nan sɔtɔma e xa yaagi ɲɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">E yire belebele sɔtɔma nɛ e xa bɔxi singe tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:7">e fa sɛɛwa abadan.»<verse eid="ISA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 61:8" />«Tinxinyi nan nafan n tan Alatala ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">kɔnɔ funmaya raɲaaxu n ma ki fanyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">N mixi sare fima n xui bɛrɛ nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:8">n mu n ma saatɛ kanama abadan.<verse eid="ISA 61:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 61:9" />E bɔnsɔɛ kolonma nɛ sie tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">e bɔnsɔɛ luma nɛ bɔnsɔɛ gbɛtɛ ya ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">Mixi naxee e toma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:9">e a kolon Alatala xa ɲama barakaxi nan e ra.»<verse eid="ISA 61:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 61:10" />N bara sɛɛwa Alatala ra ki fanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">n ɲɛlɛxinxi n Marigi Ala xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">barima a bara n nakisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">a bara n matinxin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">alɔ guba ragoroma mixi ma ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">A luxi nɛ alɔ tɔnxuma naxan tima sɛrɛxɛdubɛ xun ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:10">alɔ kɔnmagore naxan gbakuma kɔn ma.<verse eid="ISA 61:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 61:11" />Alatala tinxinyi nun matɔxɔɛ raminima nɛ duniɲa ya ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 61:11">alɔ sansi xɔrie findima solie ra ki naxɛ laakɔɛ tagi.<verse eid="ISA 61:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="ISA 62" />
  <para style="s">Siyoni xa futi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 62:1" />«N mu dunduma Siyoni xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">n mu taganma Darisalamu xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">han e gbe ɲɔxɔma tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:1">han e kisi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 62:2" />Na tɛmui ɲamanɛe wo xa tinxinyi toma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">e xa mangɛe kaabama nɛ wo xa dariyɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:2">Alatala xili nɛɛnɛ fima nɛ wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 62:3" />Wo findima nɛ ɲama tofanyi ra Alatala bɛlɛxɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:3">wo xa mangɛya yanba a yi.<verse eid="ISA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 62:4" />E mu wo xili falama sɔnɔn ‹Bɔxi raboloxi,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">xa na mu a ra ‹Bɔxi kanaxi.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">E wo xili falama nɛ ‹N ma baatɛ,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">e wo xa bɔxi xili fala ‹Ginɛ dɔxɔɛ.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">E wo xilima na ki nɛ barima Ala wo xanuxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">a bara wo xa bɔxi tongo a yɛtɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:4">alɔ xɛmɛ ginɛ tongoma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 62:5" />Wo fan wo xa bɔxi tongoma wo yɛtɛ bɛ na ki nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:5">Ala fan ɲɛlɛxin wo ra.<verse eid="ISA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 62:6" />N kantamae tima nɛ Darisalamu tɛtɛ fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">naxee luma Ala maxandi ra wo bɛ yanyi nun kɔɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">Wo tan naxee Alatala xilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:6">wo naxa tagan na raba ra,<verse eid="ISA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 62:7" />wo naxa wo sabari</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">han a xa Darisalamu rasabati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:7">a fa findi tantui ra duniɲa birin ma.»<verse eid="ISA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 62:8" />Alatala a kalixi nɛ a sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">«N mu i xa donse sama i yaxuie bɛlɛxɛ sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">e mu wo xa wɛni nɛɛnɛ minma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:8">wo naxan nawalixi.<verse eid="ISA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 62:9" />Naxee xɛ sama, nee nan a donma tantui ra Alatala bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:9">Naxee wɛni bogi bunduma, nee nan a minma n ma hɔrɔmɔbanxi buntunyi ra.»<verse eid="ISA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 62:10" />«Wo mini taa kui naadɛe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">wo sa n ma ɲama xa kira rafala!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">Wo a yailan, wo gɛmɛe ba kirae ra!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:10">Wo xa tɔnxuma ti sie bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 62:11" />Alatala xa masenyi nan yi ki duniɲa bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">‹Wo a fala Siyonikae bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">Wo Rakisima na fafe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:11">A fama wo sare ra.›<verse eid="ISA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 62:12" />E xili falama nɛ ‹Ɲama Sɛniyɛnxi,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">Alatala naxan xun saraxi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 62:12">Wo xili falama nɛ ‹Ɲama fenxi,› ‹Ɲama naxan mu raboloxi.›»<verse eid="ISA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="ISA 63" />
  <para style="s">Gbeɲɔxɔɛ lɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 63:1" />Nde na fafe kelife Edon bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">dugi gbeeli ragoroxi naxan ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">dugi naxan yailanxi Bosara taa kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">A sɛnbɛ gbo, a tofan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">A fa a fala, «N xa a fala wo bɛ nɔndi ki ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:1">n faxi wo rakiside nɛ!»<verse eid="ISA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 63:2" />«Munfe ra i xa dugi gbeelixi alɔ mixi naxan wɛni bogi bunduma?»<verse eid="ISA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 63:3" />«N tan keren bara wali alɔ mixi naxan wɛni bunduma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">Si yo mu n malixi na wali kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">N bara e boron n ma xɔnɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:3">e wuli fa kasan n ma dugi ma han a gbeeli soe.<verse eid="ISA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 63:4" />N bɔɲɛ nu wama gbe ɲɔxɔɛ nan xɔn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:4">Xunsare tɛmui bara a li.<verse eid="ISA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 63:5" />N mu mixi to naxan n malima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">na kui n bara kisi wali suxu n yɛtɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:5">n ma xɔnɛ fa n tutun yare.<verse eid="ISA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 63:6" />N bara sie boron n ma xɔnɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:6">e fa lu alɔ siisilae, e wuli lu bɔxi ma.»<verse eid="ISA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 63:7" />N Alatala xa hinnɛ fe falama nɛ wo bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">Won xa a tantu a xa fe rabaxie xa fe ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">a naxan nabaxi won bɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">A bara fe fanyi wuyaxi raba Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:7">a xa hinnɛ nun kinikini saabui ra.<verse eid="ISA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 63:8" />A a fala nɛ, «N laxi a ra n ma ɲama nan yi ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">maifuya mu na naxee ya ma!»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:8">Na kui a naxa findi e rakisima ra.<verse eid="ISA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 63:9" />E xa tɔɔrɛ xa fe nu a tɔɔrɔma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">kɔnɔ a fafe bara findi e xunsare ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">A bara e tongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:9">a e xanin a xa xanunteya nun kinikini kui kabi tɛmui xɔn kuye.<verse eid="ISA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 63:10" />Kɔnɔ e naxa muruta a ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">e fa a Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi tɔɔrɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">Na kui a naxa e bɛɲin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:10">a findi e yaxui ra e gerefa.<verse eid="ISA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 63:11" />Ɲama bara a maɲɔxun fe singee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">naxan nabaxi Annabi Munsa xa waxati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">E bara e yɛtɛ maxɔrin,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">«Ala naxan Isirayilakae ragiri Xulunyumi baa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">na na minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">Ala naxan a xa ɲama tongo alɔ xuruse dɛmadonyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">na na minden?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">Ala naxan a Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ragoro a xa ɲama ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:11">na na minden?<verse eid="ISA 63:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 63:12" />Ala naxan Munsa mali a sɛnbɛ karalanke ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">naxan baa ibɔɔ e ya ra e ragirife ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:12">alako a xili xa binya abadan,<verse eid="ISA 63:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 63:13" />na na minden?»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:13">Na kui e mu bira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:13">E sɛnbɛ nu gbo alɔ soe naxan a gima.<verse eid="ISA 63:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 63:14" />Alatala Xaxili nu malabui fima e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">e fa lu alɔ ninge naxan ɲooge donma fiili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">I bara i xa ɲama raɲɛrɛ na ki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:14">I bara xili fanyi sɔtɔ na ma.<verse eid="ISA 63:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 63:15" />I xa i ya ragoro keli koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">kelife i xa kibanyi sɛniyɛnxi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">naxan itexi, naxan luma nɔrɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">i fa a mato i xa xanunteya nun sɛnbɛ na e yɛtɛ masenfe di?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:15">I xa hinnɛ nun kinikini makuya muxu ra.<verse eid="ISA 63:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 63:16" />Kɔnɔ hali Iburahima nun Isirayila nɛɛmu muxu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">i tan nan na muxu Baba ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">Alatala nan muxu Baba ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:16">muxu Xunsarama kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye.<verse eid="ISA 63:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 63:17" />Munfe ra i a niyama, muxu xa i xa kira rabɛɲin?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">Munfe ra i muxu bɔɲɛ xɔrɔxɔma han muxu xa susa i ra?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:17">Muxu Marigi, i xa muxu ragbilen i xa yaragaaxui kui.<verse eid="ISA 63:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 63:18" />I xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi nu na muxu bɛlɛxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:18">kɔnɔ yakɔsi muxu yaxuie bara mɛnni boron.<verse eid="ISA 63:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 63:19" />I gbe nan muxu ra kabi tɛmui xɔnkuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">kɔnɔ e tan mu tinxi i xa yaamari ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">e mu i xili falama.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 63:19" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">Xa i sa koore rabi nɛ nu gorofe ra duniɲa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 63:19">geyae sɛrɛnma nɛ i ya ra nu.<verse eid="ISA 63:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="ISA 64" />
  <para style="s">Isirayila xa maxɔrinyi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 64:1" />Duniɲa rakolon i xili sɛnbɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:1">alako sie xa sɛrɛn gaaxui kui i ya ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:1">A xa lu alɔ yege naxan dɛxɛma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:1">a fa ye satun a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 64:2" />I bara kaabanakoe raba naxee bara muxu tɛrɛnna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:2">i bara goro, geyae fa sɛrɛn i ya ra.<verse eid="ISA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 64:3" />Yi fe mɔɔli mu kolonxi sinden.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">I keren nan bara na fe mɔɔli kolon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:3">i tan naxan mixi malima naxee laxi i ra.<verse eid="ISA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 64:4" />I fa nɛ mixi malide naxee tinma tinxinyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">naxee wama birafe i xa kira fɔxɔ ra.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 64:4" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">Kɔnɔ muxu tan bara yunubi raba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">i fa xɔnɔ muxu ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:4">Muxu nɔma kiside sɔnɔn?<verse eid="ISA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 64:5" />Muxu birin bara findi mixi sɛniyɛntare ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">Muxu naxan nabama i bɛ a nɔxɔxi alɔ dunkobi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">Muxu xa fe luxi nɛ alɔ burɛxɛ lisixi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:5">Muxu xa yunubie na muxu xaninfe alɔ foye burɛxɛ xaninma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 64:6" />Kɔnɔ mixi yo mu na muxu ya ma naxan i xilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">e mu i xa fe suxuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">barima i bara i yɛtɛ makuya muxu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:6">i bara muxu tɔɔrɔ muxu xa yunubi xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 64:7" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi, Muxu Marigi, Muxu Baba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">muxu bara lu alɔ bɛndɛ doloxi i yi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">i naxan nawalima a xa findi fɛɲɛ tofanyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:7">Muxu tan nan i bɛlɛxɛ wali fɔxi masenma.<verse eid="ISA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 64:8" />I naxa xɔnɔ muxu ma Marigi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">I naxa ratu muxu xa yunubie ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:8">I ya ti muxu ra, i xa ɲama.<verse eid="ISA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 64:9" />I xa taa sɛniyɛnxie bara findi gbengberen yire ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:9">Siyoni bara findi yire maxaraxi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:9">Darisalamu bara kana,<verse eid="ISA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 64:10" />i xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi muxu nu sɛɛwaxi naxan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:10">na bara gan.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:10">Muxu harige fanyi birin bara kana.<verse eid="ISA 64:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 64:11" />Na birin kui, i tondixi muxu malide?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">I i sabarima han mun tɛmui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 64:11">I muxu ɲaxankatama nan tui?<verse eid="ISA 64:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="ISA 65" />
  <para style="s">Kiiti nun kisi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 65:1" />«N bara n yɛtɛ masen mixie be naxee mu nu n xilixi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">mixie bara n to naxee mu nu n fenma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">N bara a fala, ‹N tan nan ya,›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:1">si nde bɛ naxan mu nu xilima.<verse eid="ISA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 65:2" />N na n bɛlɛxɛ ti nɛ lɔxɔɛ birin ɲama tuli xɔrɔxɔxi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:2">naxan ɲɛrɛma kira ɲaaxi xɔn e yɛtɛ waxɔnyi fenfe ra.<verse eid="ISA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 65:3" />Na ɲama katama tɛmui birin n naxɔnɔfe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">E sɛrɛxɛe bama sansi yire,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:3">e surayi fan gan sɛrɛxɛ ra e xa alae bɛ.<verse eid="ISA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 65:4" />E dɔxɔma gaburi sɛɛti ma kɔɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:4">e xɔsɛ sube don, a nun se sɛniyɛntare gbɛtɛe.<verse eid="ISA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 65:5" />E a falama mixie bɛ, ‹Wo naxa wo maso n na de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">barima n sɛniyɛnxi dangife wo ra.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">Na mixi mɔɔli xa fe xɔrɔxɔ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:5">alɔ tuuri naxan tema tɛ yire, a siga mixi ma.»<verse eid="ISA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 65:6" />«Yi nan sɛbɛxi n ya i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">N mu dunduma na ma feo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:6">N na sare birin fima nɛ e ma.<verse eid="ISA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 65:7" />N tan wo Marigi naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">‹N wo xa yunubi sare fima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">wo tan nun wo benbae ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">barima wo nu sɛrɛxɛe bama geyae nan fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">wo nu fe ɲaaxi raba n na mɛnni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">Na kui n wo xa yunubi sare fima nɛ wo ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:7">wo xa fe ɲaaxie xa fe ra.›»<verse eid="ISA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 65:8" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">«Mixi na bogi nde bundufe tɛmui naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">e fa wa na bogi wɔlɛfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">mixi gbɛtɛ a falama nɛ e bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">‹I naxa na wɔlɛ. Ye nde man luxi a kui.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">N fan na mɔɔli rabama nɛ n fɔxirabirɛe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:8">N mu e birin ɲaxankatama.<verse eid="ISA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 65:9" />N Yaxuba xa di ndee rakelima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">n Yuda xa di ndee ki n ma geyae ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">N na n ma geyae fima nɛ n ma ɲama sugandixi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:9">e xa sabati naa, a fa findi e kɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 65:10" />Sarɔn fiili fima nɛ e ma e xurusee madonma dɛnnaxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">Akori gulunba findima malabude nan na e xa gɔɔrɛ be.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:10">N na birin nabama nɛ n ma ɲama bɛ naxan n fenma.»<verse eid="ISA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 65:11" />«Kɔnɔ wo tan naxee wo kobe soxi n tan Alatala ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">wo fa nɛɛmu n ma geya sɛniyɛnxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">wo fa sɛrɛxɛ ba wo xa alae bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">naxan xilima Gadi ‹Xunnafanyi kanyi›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:11">xa na mu a ra, naxan xilima Meni ‹Maragiri kanyi,›<verse eid="ISA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 65:12" />n bara natɛ tongo wo tan ɲaxankatama santidɛgɛma nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">wo birin fa faxa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">N bara wo xili, kɔnɔ wo mu fa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">N bara wɔyɛn, kɔnɔ wo mu wo tuli mati.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:12">Wo bara fe ɲaaxi raba naxan mu rafan n ma feo.»<verse eid="ISA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 65:13" />Na kui wo Marigi Ala yi nan fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">«N ma konyie e dɛgema nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">kɔnɔ n wo tan luma kaamɛ nan kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">N ma konyie e minma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">kɔnɔ ye xɔli luma nɛ wo tan ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">N ma konyie sɛɛwama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:13">kɔnɔ yaagi dusuma nɛ wo tan xun na.<verse eid="ISA 65:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 65:14" />N ma konyie bɛɛti bama sɛɛwɛ nan kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:14">kɔnɔ wo tan wama nɛ tɔɔrɛ kui, wo bɔɲɛ fa raɲaaxu wo ma.<verse eid="ISA 65:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 65:15" />Wo xili findima nɛ dankɛ ra n ma ɲama tagi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:15">Alatala Sɛnbɛma wo faxama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:15">kɔnɔ a xili nɛɛnɛ fima nɛ a xa konyie ma.<verse eid="ISA 65:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 65:16" />Mixi naxan dubɛ rabama yi bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">a na rabama Nɔndi nan kui Ala xili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">Mixi naxan kali tima yi bɔxi ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">a na rabama Nɔndi nan kui Ala xili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:16">Tɔɔrɛ dangixi nɛɛmuma nɛ n na, a ba n ya i.»<verse eid="ISA 65:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 65:17" />«Wo xa a kolon n fama nɛ koore nun bɔxi nɛɛnɛ daade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:17">Mixi mu ratuma fe forie ma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 65:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 65:18" />Kɔnɔ n ma daali, wo xa sɛɛwa abadan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:18">barima n Darisalamu daama nɛ a xa wo rasɛɛwa han.<verse eid="ISA 65:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 65:19" />N sɛɛwama nɛ Darisalamu tagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">n fe fanyi raba n ma mixie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:19">wa xui mu mɛma sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ISA 65:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 65:20" />Di yo mu faxama a yɔrɛ ra sɔnɔn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">mixi mɔxi yo fan mu faxama fo a xa simaya kamali.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">Mixi naxan ɲɛ kɛmɛ simaya sɔtɔma, a fa faxa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">a luma nɛ alɔ a na faxa a dimɛdi tɛmui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:20">a findi mixi dankaxi ra.<verse eid="ISA 65:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 65:21" />E banxie tima nɛ, e sabati e kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:21">E wuri bilie sima nɛ, e e bogi don.<verse eid="ISA 65:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 65:22" />E mu banxie tima sɔnɔn, mixi gbɛtɛe fa sabati nee kui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">E mu sansi sima sɔnɔn, mixi gbɛtɛe fa na bogi don.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">N ma ɲama buma nɛ, alɔ wuri xungbee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:22">N ma mixi sugandixie sɛɛwama nɛ e xa wali ra.<verse eid="ISA 65:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 65:23" />E mu walima fu ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">e xa die mu gbaloe sɔtɔma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">E findima Ala bɔnsɔɛ barakaxi nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:23">e tan nun e xa die luma na ki nɛ abadan.<verse eid="ISA 65:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 65:24" />Beenu e xa n maxandi, a lima nɛ n ɲan bara e xui suxu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:24">Beenu e xa gɛ fe nde falade, n ɲan bara na mɛ.<verse eid="ISA 65:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ISA 65:25" />Xulumase nun si luma nɛ kulɛ keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">Yɛtɛ nun ninge ɲooge donma nɛ yire keren.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">Kɔnɔ bɔximase luma a balo ra xubutanyi nan na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">E mu fe yo kanama n ma geya sɛniyɛnxi fari.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 65:25">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.<verse eid="ISA 65:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="ISA 66" />
  <para style="s">Kiiti nun kisi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ISA 66:1" />Marigi xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">«Koore nan na n ma kibanyi ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">duniɲa nan na n san tide ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">Banxi mɔɔli mundun nɔma tide n tan bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:1">Yire mundun nɔma findide n malabude ra?<verse eid="ISA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ISA 66:2" />N bɛlɛxɛ nan see birin nafalaxi naxee na duniɲa.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">Alatala xa masenyi nan na ki.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ISA 66:2" />
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">«Mixi naxan nafan n ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">a findixi yɛtɛ magore nan na,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:2">a gaaxu n ya ra, a n xui suxu.<verse eid="ISA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ISA 66:3" />Kɔnɔ mixi naxan ninge bama sɛrɛxɛ ra gbansan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na tan luma nɛ alɔ faxɛti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Mixi naxan yɛxɛɛ bama sɛrɛxɛ ra gbansan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na tan luma nɛ alɔ mixi naxan bare kɔnyi girama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Mixi naxan sansi xɔri bama sɛrɛxɛ ra gbansan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na tan luma nɛ alɔ mixi naxan xɔsɛ wuli bama sɛrɛxɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">Mixi naxan surayi ganma sɛrɛxɛ ra gbansan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">na tan luma nɛ alɔ kuye batui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">E bara e xa kira sugandi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:3">kira naxan findixi sɛniyɛntareɲa xɔnxi ra.<verse eid="ISA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ISA 66:4" />Na kui n fan e ɲaxankatama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">n fe magaaxuxi ragoroma nɛ e ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">barima n to e xili, e mu n ma xili ratinxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">n to wɔyɛn, e mu e tuli mati n na.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">E bara fe ɲaaxi raba n ya xɔri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:4">e bara kira sugandi, naxan mu rafan n ma.»<verse eid="ISA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ISA 66:5" />Wo xa wo tuli mati Alatala xui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">wo tan naxee gaaxuxi a ya ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">«Wo ngaxakerenyi naxee wo xɔnma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">e wo keri n xili xa fe ra, e naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">‹Wo xa Alatala tantu alako muxu xa wo xa sɛɛwɛ to.›</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:5">Kɔnɔ e fama nɛ yaagide.<verse eid="ISA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ISA 66:6" />Wo bara na sɔnxɔɛ mɛ kelife taa kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">kelife Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">Alatala na a yaxuie sare fife.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:6">Na findixi na xui nan na wo naxan mɛma.»<verse eid="ISA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ISA 66:7" />Beenu di bari xɔnɛ xa a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">a ɲan gɛ di baride.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">Beenu tɔɔrɛ xa fa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:7">a ɲan bara di xɛmɛ sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ISA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ISA 66:8" />Nde singe bara yi fe mɔɔli mɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Nde singe bara yi fe mɔɔli to?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Ɲamanɛ nɔma findide a ra lɔxɔɛ keren kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Bɔnsɔɛ nɔma sɛnbɛ sɔtɔde tɛmui keren kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:8">Kɔnɔ Siyoni bara foye to keren na.<verse eid="ISA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ISA 66:9" />Wo Marigi Alatala naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">«N mixi malima han e di bari tɛmui, n fa e rabolo na kui?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:9">Ginɛ furi na mɔ, n mu fama na di bari sɔɔnɛyade xɛ?»<verse eid="ISA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ISA 66:10" />Wo tan Darisalamu rafan naxee ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">wo xa sɛɛwa a xa fe ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">Wo tan naxee wama a bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:10">wo xa ɲɛlɛxin a xa fe ra.<verse eid="ISA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ISA 66:11" />Wo fama nɛ a xiɲɛ minde han wo luga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">wo bɔɲɛsa sɔtɔ a saabui ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:11">a wo hayi birin fan.<verse eid="ISA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ISA 66:12" />Alatala xa masenyi nan ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">«N bɔɲɛsa fima nɛ a ma alɔ xure xungbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">n ɲamanɛ naafuli xaninma nɛ a xɔn ma alɔ banbaranyi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:12">A fama nɛ mɛɛnide wo ma alɔ dingɛ mɛɛnima a xa di ma ki naxɛ.<verse eid="ISA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ISA 66:13" />N wo xa tɔɔrɛ bama nɛ wo ma alɔ dingɛ a xa di xa tɔɔrɛ bama ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:13">Na birin toma nɛ Darisalamu.»<verse eid="ISA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ISA 66:14" />Wo na na to, wo bɔɲɛ sɛɛwama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">wo xa fe sɔɔnɛya alɔ ɲooge naxan toma fiili ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">Alatala a sɛnbɛ masenma nɛ a xa konyie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:14">a yaxui fama nɛ a xa xɔnɛ kolonde.<verse eid="ISA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ISA 66:15" />Alatala nan na ki, a na fafe tɛ xɔɔra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">a ɲɛrɛma foye xungbe fari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">A a xa xɔnɛ ragoroma nɛ sɛnbɛ ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:15">a ɲaxankatɛ ti tɛ ra.<verse eid="ISA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ISA 66:16" />Alatala a xa kiiti sama nɛ tɛ nun santidɛgɛma ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ISA 66:16">a fa mixi gbegbe sɔntɔde.<verse eid="ISA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ISA 66:17" />Alatala naxɛ, «Mixi naxee sɛrɛxɛ bama wondi kui, e fa xɔsɛ nun bale sube don, a nun donse sɛniyɛntare gbɛtɛe Alatala naxee xɔnxi, e xa fe fama nɛ raɲɔnde kerenyi ra.»<verse eid="ISA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ISA 66:18" />«N fama nɛ si birin malande, si naxee xui wuyaxi falama, n fa n ma nɔrɛ masen e bɛ e xa fe rabaxie nun e xa maɲɔxunyie xa fe ra. <verse eid="ISA 66:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ISA 66:19" />N tɔnxuma nde luma nɛ e tagi, n fa e xa mixi kisixie xɛɛ bɔnsɔɛe tagi, alɔ Tarasisi, Pulu, Ludu xali wolie, Tubali, Yawani, nun si gbɛtɛ naxee na yire makuyee, naxee mu n xili kolon, naxee mu n ma nɔrɛ toxi sinden. N ma xɛɛrae fama nɛ n ma nɔrɛ masende e bɛ. <verse eid="ISA 66:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ISA 66:20" />E man fama nɛ wo ngaxakerenyie ra naxee toma na ɲamanɛe tagi. E fama nɛ e ra n ma geya sɛniyɛnxi fari alɔ sɛrɛxɛ fama ki naxɛ. E fama nɛ e ra soee nun ɲɔxɔmɛe fari, e tixi sarɛtie kui. E fama nɛ na birin na alɔ Isirayilakae fama e xa hadiyae ra sesase sɛniyɛnxie kui ki naxɛ Alatala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. <verse eid="ISA 66:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ISA 66:21" />N sɛrɛxɛdubɛ ndee sugandima nɛ e fan ya ma, e xa lu Lewi bɔnsɔɛ sɛɛti ma.»<verse eid="ISA 66:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ISA 66:22" />«N tan Alatala, n xa a fala wo bɛ, a n fama nɛ koore nɛɛnɛ nun bɔxi nɛɛnɛ yailande wo bɛ. Na buma ki naxɛ, wo xili nun wo bɔnsɔɛ buma na ki nɛ abadan. <verse eid="ISA 66:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ISA 66:23" />Keli kike nɛɛnɛ sɛrɛxɛ ma han kike nɛɛnɛ sɛrɛxɛ gbɛtɛ, keli malabu lɔxɔɛ ma han malabu lɔxɔɛ gbɛtɛ, ibunadama birin fama nɛ suyidide n ya i. <verse eid="ISA 66:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ISA 66:24" />E mixi faxaxie toma nɛ naxee murutaxi n ma. Nimasee e furee donma nɛ, tɛ fan e sube gan, e fa findi fe magaaxuxi ra adamadie bɛ.»<verse eid="ISA 66:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ISA 66" />
</usx>